    "snippet": "與艾基爾並肩作戰，打敗海灘上的怪物！  獎勵 最多可獲得 500 顆「奧秘寶石」、最多 500 顆「記憶尼特 S」、最多 20 顆「格鬥藝術勳章」、最多 100 顆「覺醒之星」以及最多 20 顆「偉大寶石」。 300 顆奧秘寶石來自地牢清除，其餘來自商人...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Agil Summer Festival 2026 -Tuna Wars!- is on! Get a ★4 Agil Skill Record and a fish-themed Weapon Avatar!\nEVENT\n2026-08-05 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nFight alongside Agil and defeat the monsters on the beach!\nRewards\nGet up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 500\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\n, up to 20\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, and up to 20 each of the\n\"Great Jewels\"\n.\n300 Arcana Gems come from dungeon clears, and the rest from the Trader in the second half. Memoria Niter S, Medals of Combat Arts, Awakening Stars, and Great Jewels are all available via both dungeon clears and the Trader.\nYou can also get\n\"Superior Ingot\"\n,\n\"Rare Metal Scrap\"\n, and\n\"Superior Metal Scrap\"\n, all equipment-refinement materials. Superior Ingot increases Slash-element weak-point damage.\nWeapon Avatar\nFish-themed weapon avatars: Mahi-Mahi Sword (1H Sword), Halfbeak Rapier (1H Rapier), Porcupinefish Hammer (1H Club), Sawshark Lance (2H Spear), Tuna Axe (2H Axe), Saury Dagger (Dagger), Angelfish Bow (Bow).\nSkill Record\n★4[Returning Seaman] Agil\nSkill Name\nOutmatch/Flash Blade\nAttack\n37\nDefense\n42\nHP\n1790\nSkill Effect\n●[Outmatch 4] 200 of additional damage to enemy when attack./[Flash Blade 4] Critical rate for normal attack's +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nTrader Rewards\nExchange \"Rainbow Tuna\" at the Trader for items.\n\"Shining Sea Plate\" starts dropping after the high-difficulty release on August 13, 2026 (Thu) maintenance, and Trader rewards will be added at that time.\nAdditional Trader rewards for Rainbow Tuna will be added after the August 19, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrade \"Rainbow Tuna\" for items\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n75\n★4[Returning Seaman] Agil\n300\n1\nMahi-Mahi Sword\n150\n2\nHalfbeak Rapier\n150\n2\nPorcupinefish Hammer\n150\n2\nSawshark Lance\n150\n2\nTuna Axe\n150\n2\nSaury Dagger\n150\n2\nAngelfish Bow\n150\n2\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n30\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nSuperior Ingot\n75\n15\nRare Metal Scrap\n75\n5\nSuperior Metal Scrap\n25\n50\nTrade \"Shining Sea Plate\" for items\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n20\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n75\n★4[Returning Seaman] Agil\n300\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTotal Score Reward\n\"Entry\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\", \"Gaining Ground\", \"Special\", \"Extreme\", and \"Unknown\" difficulties share the same score pool.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score₍This does not include the Special Bonus₎\nEntry\nBasic Clear Bonus:99P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n105\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:299P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n305\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:1185P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n1215\nGaining Ground\nBasic Clear Bonus:3585P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n3615\nSpecial\nBasic Clear Bonus:2940P＋Survival Bonus:10P per surviving player\n3000\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus:4880P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n5000\nUnknown\nBasic Clear Bonus:32380P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n32500\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×300\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nMemoria Niter S×300\nAwakening Star×50\nGreat Red Jewel×10\nGreat Green Jewel×10\nGreat Yellow Jewel×10\nGreat Blue Jewel×10\nSuperior Ingot×10\nRare Metal Scrap×55\nDungeon Difficulties\nThere are 8 tiers: Entry, Depth, DANGER, Gaining Ground, Special, Extreme, Unknown, and Abyss.\nAbyss can be cleared up to 10 times per day. The clear count resets daily at 4:00 AM.\nUnknown and Abyss are Crystal-Disabled Areas.\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join \"Gaining Ground\", \"Special\", \"Extreme\" and \"Unknown\" difficulty Quick Parties.\nGaining Ground: Total Power 40,000 or higher／Special: Total Power 60,000 or higher／Extreme: Total Power 80,000 or higher／Unknown: Total Power 200,000 or higher\nYou can clear \"Gaining Ground\" once per day. The clear count resets daily at 4:00 AM. Take it on every day to get more total rewards!\nItem use is limited on \"Extreme\", with Revive Crystals usable only once.\nSpecial Bonus\nEntry through Unknown have Special Bonus compatible Skill Records. Abyss is not eligible. Equipping a compatible Skill Record increases the score reward.\nList of Special Bonus Compatible Skill Records\n[Racing Firewheel] Kirito\n[Fox Spirit Under the Moon] Asuna\n[Demon Night Parade] Koharu\n[Shrine of Phantoms] Sachi\n[Innocent Detour] Alice\n[Command of Sorcery] Alice\n[Retribution of Chaos] Agil\n[Roaring Strongarm] Agil\n[Returning Seaman] Agil\n[Fieldwork Awaits] Sasha\nAchievement Rewards\nEarn titles based on your cumulative total of event tokens obtained.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nAbyss C. E. Sword Hero 6\nDefeat the boss \"Captain Evil Sword\" in \"Abyss\" and obtain the item \"Abyss C. E. Sword Hero 6\"\nRevive Crystal×1\nSeaside Merchant\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Rainbow Tuna in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nLegendary Sailor\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Rainbow Tuna in the time period. Unlocks after \"Seaside Merchant\".\nRevive Crystal×1\nSurfing Body Builder\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Shining Sea Plate in the time period. Shown once Shining Sea Plate is added.\nRevive Crystal×1\nUnachieved Records will be hidden after the event ends.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Beach Guide\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to head to the Day Beach.\nAt the Day Beach, talk to \"Agil\" to take on the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the August 5, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 27, 2026 (Thu) maintenance.\n* The high-difficulty dungeon \"Abyss\" will be implemented after the August 13, 2026 (Thu) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nTrader display period: Starts on the event start date, August 5, 2026 (Wed) maintenance, and ends before the September 2, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nRainbow Tuna drops: Event start date to event end date, before August 27, 2026 (Thu) maintenance.\nShining Sea Plate drops: High-difficulty start date, August 13, 2026 (Thu) maintenance, to event end date.\nTokens and related items become hidden: September 2, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nTokens and related items are deleted: September 9, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nCaptain Evil Sword\nWeakness / Resistance\nAll except Unknown/Abyss\nWeak to: Slash, Earth / Resistance: none\nUnknown\nWeak to: Slash, Earth / Resistant to: all other weapon and natural elements, Critical, Damage\nAbyss\nWeak to: Thrust, Wind / Resistant to: all other weapon and natural elements, Critical, Damage\nStatus Ailments (all difficulties)\nBleeding, Severe Poison, Paralysis\nBreak\nExcept Abyss: Break with Earth Element only / Abyss: Break with Wind Element only\nOther\nDANGER and above: uses Chaos Recollection / Special and above: uses the Seal Items debuff\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf the ★4 Skill Records you acquire as rewards for this event have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Memoria Niter L\".\nRainbow Tuna, Shining Sea Plate and related consumable items will be unavailable in the Trader after the September 2, 2026 (Wed) maintenance, and deleted after the September 9, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
