    "full_details": "Notices\nAugust 3 is Mito's birthday! Lots of campaigns are being held! You've gotta check out this announcement!<\nNOTICES\n2026-08-03 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAugust 3 is Mito's birthday!\nWe're holding various campaigns in SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor to celebrate Mito's birthday!\nLet's all celebrate this wonderful day together!\nIntensive Training Event VS Mito\nIn this event you can get a Mito Chat Stamp and Medals of Combat Arts!\nPeriod\nJuly 31, 2026 (Fri) 4:00 - August 7, 2026 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nMito's Birthday Order\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Mito!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nMito's Birthday Order is here!\nDuration\nAugust 3, 2026 (Mon) 0:00 - August 12, 2026 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Panels\nPanels featuring illustrations of Mito have been placed in four in-game locations!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nAugust 3, 2026 (Mon) 0:00 - August 12, 2026 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nArcana Gem Gift\nLog in on the day of Mito's birthday to get a gift of 250 Arcana Gems!\nTime Limit\nAvailable until August 3, 2026 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
