    "full_details": "Notices\n[7/30 14:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] \"Guild of Guilds\" Season 73 Ranking Results!<\nNOTICES\n2026-07-30 14:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[7/30 14:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nRanking Rewards have been distributed. Please collect them from the present box.\nFor more details about the rewards, see \"Ranking Rewards\" below.\nPick up period\nUntil December 9, 2026 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n■The Champion's Room is Unlocked\nThe winning guild can now access the Champion's Room.\nYou will able to access the Champion's Room if you are a member of the winning guild, even if you joined afterwards.\nThere are two ways to enter the Champion's Room.\n1. Talk to the \"Guild Room Guide\" NPC in Teleport Gate Plaza.\n2. Talk to the \"Champion's Room Guide\" NPC in the Guild Room.\nThere are two ways to enter the normal Guild Room.\n1. Talk to the \"Guild Room Guide\" NPC in Teleport Gate Plaza.\n2. Talk to the \"Guild Room Guide\" NPC in the Champion's Room.\nThe \"Guild Quest\" bulletin board and NPC's from the normal Guild Room will be moved to the Champion's Room.\nIf you were logged in from before July 30 at 14:00 (JST/UTC+9), you will be able to receive rewards and access the Champion's Room by logging in again.\nIn \"Guild of Guilds\" Season 74, there will be a High Score Ranking in which guilds compete for ranks based on their high scores.\nThe boss, \"Viaio Cetus\", will have weapon elemental weaknesses to \"Thrust Element\", \"Wind Element\", and \"Earth Element\".\nPlease stay tuned for more information on the next \"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason schedule.\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
