    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(7/29)\nMAINT.\n2026-07-29 13:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 7/29, 2026, 13:00, was completed on 7/29, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nScenario event \"Operation: Summer Memories\"\nRing Production Campaign\n▼Official Live Stream Rewards\nWe have sent out the reward of \"300 Arcana Gems\" for the viewer-participation event held during the official live stream on 7/24, 2026.\nReceive by: Until 8/5, 2026, 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\nWe have confirmed an issue in which Arcana Gems received from the Present Box were not properly reflected for some players due to the connection issues that occurred on 7/16 and 7/24.\nDuring this maintenance, we have compensated players with the Arcana Gems that were not properly reflected.\nWe sincerely apologize for the inconvenience caused.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n7/29, 2026 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nScenario event \"Operation: Summer Memories\"\nRing Production Campaign\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 7/29 Maintenance\nRanking Event \"Guild of Guilds\" Season 73\nSilica's Heapin' 50M EXP Event\nGuild Support Campaign\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
