    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Yuna's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Yuna!\nShop\n2026-07-29 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Yuna's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Supporting Melody] Yuna\n\" and \"\n[Protected by a Melody] Yuna\n\" are now available!\n\"\nYuna's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Yuna guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Yuna\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Supporting Melody] Yuna\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nShade Fall\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n39\nSkill Effect\n2360% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Protected by a Melody] Yuna\nSkill Name\nPiercing Surge/Prosper/Hold the Front/Frontal Attack\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Piercing Surge 3] Damage to thrust element weakness rises by the number of Kirito Skill Records in the same set x 20%./[Prosper 5] Attack +25% when HP is above 50%./[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Frontal Attack 5] Aggro increase -50% when attack hits.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nJuly 29, 2026 (Wed) 0:00 - August 7, 2026 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Yuna\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Yuna\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
