    "full_details": "Notices\nJuly 29 is Yuna's birthday! Lots of campaigns are being held!\nNOTICES\n2026-07-29 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nJuly 29 is Yuna's birthday!\nWe're holding various campaigns in SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor to celebrate Yuna's birthday!\nLet's all celebrate this wonderful day together!\nHappy Dungeon with Yuna\nWe're holding an event where you can get a Yuna chat stamp and up to 500 Arcana Gems!\nPeriod\nJuly 24, 2026 (Fri) 4:00 - July 31, 2026 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nYuna's Birthday Order\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Yuna!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nYuna's Birthday Order is here!\nDuration\nJuly 29, 2026 (Wed) 0:00 - August 7, 2026 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Panels\nPanels featuring illustrations of Yuna have been placed in four in-game locations!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nJuly 29, 2026 (Wed) 0:00 - August 7, 2026 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nArcana Gem Gift\nLog in on the day of Yuna's birthday to get a gift of 250 Arcana Gems!\nTime Limit\nAvailable until July 29, 2026 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
