    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Lv. 295 Dark Black Series \"Eliminator Chaos\" is here! New boss monster added to the \"Chaos Showdown\"!\nEVENT\n2026-07-23 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe high-difficulty dungeon, \"Chaos Showdown\", has been updated!\nGet the powerful \"Dark Black Series\" armor!\nDungeon Duration\nAfter July 23, 2026 (Thu) maintenance - August 5, 2026 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nNew Boss monster\nEliminator Chaos\nDetails\nThis battle takes place in a Crystal Nullification Zone, so some items cannot be used.\nWhen battle starts, it will use a Critical Resistance buff.\nIt is breakable with a Two-handed Spear. After the first Break, it becomes breakable with a Bow.\nWhen a Break happens, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all its buffs will be removed.\nIt is also skill-breakable with Thrust and Dark element skills.\nWith a certain attack, it gets a powerful buff to reduce damage.\nIt has an attack that removes player buffs.\nIt has an attack that lowers the player's awakening gauge.\nWhen its HP falls beneath a certain amount, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nDark Element\nResistance\nSlash Element\nBlunt Element\nFire Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nWater Element\nCritical\nDamage\nBuffs used\n\"Critical resistance\" and \"Chaos Recollection\"\n\"Reduces damage\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Grudge\", \"Burn\" and \"Paralysis\"\nDebuffs \"Item Seal\" and \"CT Increase\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects. After the first Break, it becomes breakable only with a Bow. Each Skill Break also applies a stackable debuff that increases damage dealt to the boss.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nFor details on the effects of \"Status Ailments\", please check in-game via \"Menu\" > \"System\" > \"Help\" > \"Buff, Debuff, and Status Ailments\".\nAlternatively, please refer to the\n\"Status Ailments\"\nsection of the Play Guide.\nBoss Appearing\nDifficulty\nBoss Name\nWeakness\nObtainable Chaos Crystals\nChallenge with party\nChaos Showdown 90\nDark Black Spirit Tree\nSlash Element\n・\nFire Element\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 95\nDark Black Beast\nSlash Element\n・\nWater Element\nAmber Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 110\nDark Black Evil Spirit\nBlunt Element\n・\nEarth Element\nTopaz Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 135\nDark Black Sturdy Crab\nBlunt Element\n・\nHoly Element\n→\nThrust Element\n・\nHoly Element\n→\nBlunt Element\n・\nHoly Element\nEmerald Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 155\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast\nBlunt Element\n・\nFire Element\nSapphire Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 175\nDark Black Sticky Thing\nThrust Element\n・\nWind Element\nIndigo Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 195\nDark Black Last Number\nSlash Element\n・\nEarth Element\nAmethyst Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 215\nDark Black Gleam Eyes\nThrust Element\n・\nFire Element\nQuartz Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 235\nDark Black Chaos Drake\nSlash Element\n・\nFire Element\nRose Quartz Chaos Crystal\nNO\nChaos Showdown 255\nDark Black Teaser Tentacles\nThrust Element\n・\nWind Element\nSky Chaos Crystal\nNO\nChaos Showdown 275\nDark Black Adamas Snake\nBlunt Element\n・\nEarth Element\nDeep Emerald Chaos Crystal\nNO\nChaos Showdown 295\nDark Black Eliminator\nThrust Element\n・\nDark Element\nDeep Amethyst Chaos Crystal\nNO\n\"Dark Black Series\" equipment can be produced at the Workshop using Chaos Crystals and production materials dropped from the boss.\nEach \"Chaos Crystal\" can be obtained by collecting the correlating \"Crystal Shards\" and using them for production.\nDark Black Series List\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black Spirit Tree Armor\n816\n12210\nLv.90\nDark Black Spirit Tree Greaves\n670\n8547\nLv.90\nDark Black Beast Armor\n866\n12810\nLv.95\nDark Black Beast Greaves\n710\n8967\nLv.95\nDark Black Evil Spirit Armor\n917\n14010\nLv.110\nDark Black Evil Spirit Greaves\n752\n9807\nLv.110\nDark Black Sturdy Crab Armor\n1257\n20190\nLv.135\nDark Black Sturdy Crab Greaves\n1031\n14133\nLv.135\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast Armor\n1358\n21990\nLv.155\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast Greaves\n1114\n15393\nLv.155\nDark Black Sticky Thing Armor\n1460\n24400\nLv.175\nDark Black Sticky Thing Greaves\n1197\n16303\nLv.175\nDark Black Last Number Armor\n1563\n26850\nLv.195\nDark Black Last Number Greaves\n1282\n17253\nLv.195\nDark Black Gleam Eyes Armor\n1667\n29350\nLv.215\nDark Black Gleam Eyes Greaves\n1367\n18253\nLv.215\nDark Black Chaos Drake Armor\n1772\n31900\nLv.235\nDark Black Chaos Drake Greaves\n1453\n19303\nLv.235\nDark Black Teaser Tentacles Armor\n1878\n34500\nLv.255\nDark Black Teaser Tentacles Greaves\n1540\n20403\nLv.255\nDark Black Adamas Snake Armor\n1985\n37150\nLv.275\nDark Black Adamas Snake Greaves\n1628\n21553\nLv.275\nDark Black Eliminator Armor[NEW!]\n2093\n39850\nLv.295\nDark Black Eliminator Greaves[NEW!]\n1716\n22753\nLv.295\nRandom Bonus\nThe value and type of the Dark Black Series bonus are random.\nExample: Equippable Lv. 295 Dark Black Series\nStatus\nUpper\nLower\nAttack\n30\n30\nDefense\n120\n50\nHP\n2500\n6000\nExample: If three types of defenses are given to Dark Black Eliminator Armor, defense will increase by 360 total.\n* Succession cannot be used for the Dark Black Series.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end\nAccept it from the \"Chaos Showdown\" NPC at the \"Blackiron Palace\".\nImportant\nChaos Showdown is a permanent dungeon where the boss changes approximately every two weeks. The rotation will start over again after six weeks.\nYour score reward and challenge reward information will not reset when each dungeon returns.\nCheck the game for details about the rewards of each dungeon.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
