    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(7/15)\nMAINT.\n2026-07-14 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 7/15, 2026, 13:00, was completed on 7/15, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 72nd \"Guild of Guilds\"\nSilica's Heapin' 50M EXP Event\nMultiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\nGuild Support Campaign\n\"Will of Steel to Catch the King\" is back\nAs compensation for the issue causing unintended behavior after clearing the Chaos Showdown 295 Dungeon, we have distributed Deep Amethyst Crystal Shards based on the number of times each player cleared the dungeon.\n- Eligible Players\nPlayers who cleared the Chaos Showdown 295 Dungeon between the end of the maintenance on 7/8 (Wed) and the start of the emergency maintenance on 7/9 (Thu).\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n7/15, 2026 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 72nd \"Guild of Guilds\"\nSilica's Heapin' 50M EXP Event\nMultiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\n\"Will of Steel to Catch the King\" is back\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 7/15 Maintenance\nLive Event: Rainbow-colored Duet ～Echoes of Aincrad Launch Celebration～\nLabyrinth Strategy Campaign\nThe 17th Squad Jumble\nMultiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\n92F Start Dash Event\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
