    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Heat the Beach Order\" is back! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2026-07-07 10:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nWe have confirmed an issue where the contents of STEP 3 in this Order differed from what was displayed on the banner.\nTo address this display error, we will take the following action.\n▽Affected Customers\nCustomers who purchased this Order during the period in which the display error occurred will be refunded the Arcana Gems spent.\n▽Affected Period\n7/5 (Sun) 17:00 – 7/6 (Mon) 12:22\n▽Compensation Schedule\nDuring maintenance on 7/8 (Wed)\nWe sincerely apologize for the delay in posting this announcement.\nWe also apologize for any inconvenience caused by this display error.\n----------------------\nBlinding bathing suit bods!\nYuuki, Asuna, Koharu, and Sinon leap from the key visuals of the summer scene as returning ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nHeat the Beach Order\n\" is back! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and returning ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【Returning ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Unearthed Riches] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSummer V Square\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n104\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n2250% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nHoly damage +50% when using Holy skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Holy damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Shining Summer Memories] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nSummer Riot\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n2250% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Treasure in the Tropics] Koharu\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nTerror Summer Burst\nSkill Name\nTerror Summer\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nHoly\n→Slash→(\nHoly\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n55\nSwitch Gauge\n55\nBreak Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n76\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2350% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] Inflict Frostbite (Stack 1) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5700% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Increases attack against enemies with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite). +1% for every Stack 1./[Bonus] Holy element damage increases x 0.5% the number of Debility stacks when the player is inflicted with the Debility status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Swept Away by Treasure] Sinon\nSkill Name\nEngrave/Persistence/Pierce\nAttack\n45\nDefense\n60\nHP\n2875\nSkill Effect\n[Engrave] When equipping 3 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set and hitting with switch, adds debuff (Mark).(Invalid when equipped by Partner)The next attack the enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)/[Persistence 4]Attack +20% at below 50% of your own HP.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Pierce 4] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Treasure in the Tropics] Koharu\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nJuly 5, 2026 (Sun) 17:00 - Before July 15, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
