    "snippet": "劇情活動「有點嚇人？！洞穴探險」回來了！  本次活動將延續上一期的以下進度： ・任務進度和獎勵 ・總分和分數獎勵 ・挑戰獎勵 ・交易金額 ・成就和成就進度 有點嚇人？ ！洞穴探險之旅",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Bit scary?! Cave Exploration\" is back! Get [Summer Clothes] Lisbeth!\nEVENT\n2026-06-30 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"Bit scary?! Cave Exploration\" is back!\nThis event will carry over the following progress from the previous run:\n・Quest progression and rewards\n・Total Score and Score Rewards\n・Challenge rewards\n・Amount traded\n・Achievements and achievement progress\nBit scary?! Cave Exploration\nWatch fireworks blossom and light up the night sky! The beautiful Night Beach is open, and Asuna and the others are ready in their swimsuits to explore the caves!\nThere are tons of monsters waiting in the caves! A little scenario quest with Asuna and the others is also available.\n* Fireworks light the sky at the Night Beach from 19:00 to 24:00.\nRewards\nGet Arcana Gems and Aged Medals to use at the Trader from the rewards by completing the cave exploration quest with Asuna and the others!\nIf you defeat all the monsters in the quest, a treasure box will appear!  There are Aged Medals in the treasure box, too!\nYou can exchange your Aged Medals for items like\n★3 [Summer Clothes] Lisbeth\n, Limited-edition Stamps, Medals of Combat Arts, and awakening material.\nSkill Record\n★3[Summer Clothes] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nFortitude\nAttack\n26\nDefense\n56\nHP\n900\nSkill effect\n[Fortitude 3] Defense +10% when HP is <25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMemory Stamp\nLimited-edition Stamps are back.\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nFireworks\nFan\nShaved Ice\nShooting\nTrade \"Aged Medal\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\n★3[Summer Clothes] Lisbeth\n40\n1\n★3[Summer Clothes] Lisbeth\n60\n2\n★3[Summer Clothes] Lisbeth\n100\n3\n★3[Summer Clothes] Lisbeth\n150\n5\nMemory Stamp 37\nUse to obtain the \"Fireworks\" stamp.\n50\n1\nMemory Stamp 38\nUse to obtain the \"Fan\" stamp.\n50\n1\nMemory Stamp 39\nUse to obtain the \"Shaved Ice\" stamp.\n50\n1\nMemory Stamp 40\nUse to obtain the \"Shooting\" stamp.\n50\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n5\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nTrader\nSee each Trader NPC for more info, or go to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the \"Trade Aged Medal\" banner.\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nCave Explorers\nLet's collect a total of 500 Aged Medals in the time period.\n1000Col\nRing of Fireworks\nLet's collect a total of 1000 Aged Medals in the time period.\n2500Col\nBeach Angel\nLet's collect a total of 1500 Aged Medals in the time period.\n5000Col\nHow to Participate\nOpen the List of Events from the Menu in the upper left corner of the screen, and tap the \"Bit scary?! Cave Exploration\" banner to go to the Night Beach.\nAccept the quests from Asuna, Yuuki, Leafa, and Sinon at the night beach.\n* This is a solo quest that lets you challenge it with the quest giver as your partner.\nStory Replay\nAfter completing the scenario quest, you can replay it via the Night Map Guide NPC for the event.\nStory Replay is displayed beneath the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the June 30, 2026 (Tue) maintenance and ends before the August 26, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nTrader Period\nStarts after the June 30, 2026 (Tue) maintenance and ends before the September 2, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nImportant\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nIf the ★3 Skill Records you acquire as rewards for this event have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Memoria Niter M\".\n\"Aged Medals\" will be deleted on September 2, 2026 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2026-06-29T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2026-08-25T19:00:00+00:00"
