    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Beckoning Foxfire Order is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2026-06-24 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna and Sachi paint the night with their foxfire in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe Beckoning Foxfire Order is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Spirit Fox Flame] Asuna\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nEarth Torrent Burst\nSkill Name\nEarth Torrent\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→Thrust→\nEarth\n→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n92\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2020% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Earth Element Enhance4/Buff] Earth element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5600% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 150%./[Bonus] Critical rate +1000%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Fire Fox's Invitation] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nSand Disk\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n132\nBreak Gauge\n38\nSkill Effect\n2360% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nEarth damage +50% when using earth skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise earth damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nAfter June 24, 2026 (Wed) maintenance - Before July 23, 2026 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
