    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Lunatic Showtime Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2026-05-13 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Sinon, Leafa and Agil are performing thrilling illusions onstage in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nLunatic Showtime Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Mysterious Show] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWater Creep\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n41\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDamage done to enemies weak to slashing +50% when using water skills.\nAttack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Master of the Stage] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nLight Barrage\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n110\nBreak Gauge\n42\nSkill Effect\n2490% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nHoly damage +50% when using Holy skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Holy damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Opening Ceremony] Leafa\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Hidden Blessing/Halo/Ground Dance\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 5] Attack +1200./[Hidden Blessing 3] Attack +15%, and non-natural elemental damage-100%./[Halo 3] Defense -30% and during the buff effect for increased max HP the hit rate -30%\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Ground Dance 2] Deals +10% Earth element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Keeper of the Stage] Agil\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nSand Judgement Burst\nSkill Name\nSand Judgement\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→Blunt→\nEarth\n→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nBreak Gauge\n49\nBreak Gauge\n98\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2460% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Earth Element Enhance4/Buff] Earth element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n6000% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 250%./[Bonus] Earth element damage increases x 0.5% the number of poison stacks when the player is inflicted with the poison status ailment./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Mysterious Show] Kirito\", \"[Master of the Stage] Sinon\", \"[Keeper of the Stage] Agil\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the May 13, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 10, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
