    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(4/30)\nMAINT.\n2026-04-30 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 4/30, 2026, 12:00, was completed on 4/30, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild Battle Challenge VS Chaos Drake\" begins\n\"Fatal Battle: Bloody Eyes\" begins\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nThe Guild Room will be changed to the usual theme.\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where the Lost Epic Mace could not be traded\nFixed an issue where illustrations were not displayed while progressing through the Underground Labyrinth B8F quest\nIf you have already cleared the quest, you can view them via Story Replay in the Underground Labyrinth.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n4/30, 2026 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild Battle Challenge VS Chaos Drake\" begins\n\"Fatal Battle: Bloody Eyes\" begins\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 4/30 Maintenance\n\"Birthday Battle Rush\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\"\n\"Ring Production Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
