    "news_date": 1777464000,
    "news_category": "Shop",
    "snippet": "為了紀念Yuna Live，我們將舉辦Yuna Feat。順序等級順序！所有的★4技能記錄不是尤娜的，就是來自序數順序！另外，尤娜的新技能記錄【吟遊詩人的迴響】尤娜也將出現！  在第 1 步，您可以獲得 11 個訂單，價值 1,250 顆奧秘寶石！另外...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nYuna's new Skill Record included! The \"Yuna Feat. Ordinal Scale Order\" is here! All ★4 Skill Records are either Yuna's or from Ordinal Scale Orders! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2026-04-29 21:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo commemorate the Yuna Live, we will be holding the\nYuna Feat. Ordinal Scale Order\n!\nAll ★4 Skill Records are either Yuna's or from Ordinal Scale Orders!\nAdditionally, Yuna's new Skill Record, [Minstrel Echoes] Yuna, will also appear!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n!\nAdditionally, on Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Minstrel Echoes] Yuna\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Aqua Conversion/Glimmer of Hope/Accelerated Healing\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Aqua Conversion 5] Fire element's damage to enemies -15% and water element's damage to enemies +30%./[Glimmer of Hope 4] When equipping 2 or more of Eiji's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Accelerated Healing 4] Recovers a max of 4% HP per 3 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nEffect duration is extended.\nThe higher the Limit Break level, the more Link Level increases when attacking with Link Sword Skills.\nWhen Activated: Attack +500 when using Link Sword Skills.\nLLv100: Skill Power is added +100%.\nLLv250: water element damage +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Dazzling Night Stage] Yuna\nSkill Name\nThrust protect/Song of Pursuit\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Thrust protect 4] Reduce damage from 15% thrust element monster./[Song of Pursuit 4] (Invalid when equipped by Partner) When the target is hit using the Switch, adds a buff that recovers your HP (3%/3 sec) for 30 sec.Also, it adds additional effects depending on Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 3 or more of Yuna's Skill Records: Adds a buff (PT Enhance Blunt 4) that increases damage done to enemies weak to blunt by +30%.When equipping 4 or more of Yuna's Skill Records: Adds a buff (PT Enhance Thrust 4) that increases damage done to enemies weak to thrust by +30%.When equipping 5 or more of Yuna's Skill Records: Adds a buff (PT Enhance Slash 4) that increases damage done to enemies weak to slash by +30%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Dark Revenger] Eiji\nSkill Name\nBloody Battle Strike/Flame Conversion\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2800\nSkill Effect\n[Bloody Battle Strike 3] Attack +35% when attacking with blunt element./[Flame Conversion 4]Water element's damage to enemies -10% and fire element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Memory-Seeking Swordsman] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHeat Creep\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n41\nSkill Effect\n2800% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Flame Force 4/Buff] Fire element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Slash 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to Slash +20% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Fire element damage +50%.\nLLv100: Your own attack increases by defense x 1.\nLLv250: Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Refined Swordwork] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nDark Pain\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1820% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] Own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 3).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nApril 29, 2026 (Wed) 21:00 - Before the May 13, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers/Details\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
