    "news_category": "Shop",
    "snippet": "亞絲娜、愛麗絲、莉法和莉茲貝特正在用新的★4技能記錄中的新技術打擊邪惡！ 「旗袍備戰令」來了！保證在步驟 5 獲得一項新的 ★4 技能記錄！ 6%的總掉率不包括保證的★4技能記錄，以及新的★4S...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Battle-Ready Qipao Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2026-04-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Alice, Leafa and Lisbeth are on their way to strike down evil with their new techniques in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nBattle-Ready Qipao Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Crimson Blade Dance] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHeat Brush\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n24\nSkill Effect\n2500% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Flame Force 4/Buff] Fire element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +20% for 20 sec.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Thrust Boost 3/Buff] Adds a buff where thrust elemental weakness damage +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Fire element damage +50%.\nLLv100: While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 100%.\nLLv250: Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Sacred Blade's Guidance] Alice\nSkill Name\nExtension/Engrave\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2200\nSkill Effect\n[Extension 1] Attack rises 6% x the number of Alice Skill Records in the same set./[Engrave] When equipping no Kirito Skill Records in the same set and hitting with switch, adds debuff (Mark).(Invalid when equipped by Partner)The next attack the enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Dancing in the Verdant Wind] Leafa\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nAqua Ravage Burst\nSkill Name\nAqua Ravage\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Blunt→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n27\nBreak Gauge\n54\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2460% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n6000% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 250%./[Bonus] Water element damage increases x 0.5% the number of frostbite stacks when the player is inflicted with the frostbite status ailment./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Mad Song Strike] Lisbeth\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nAqua Turbine Burst\nSkill Name\nAqua Turbine\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Blunt→\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n17\nBreak Gauge\n34\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2060% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Aqua Force 5/Buff (PT)] Water element damage +20% for you and your party for 5 sec./[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5700% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +150% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark)./[Bonus] Water element's damage rises by the number of Lisbeth Skill Records in the same set x 9%./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%, when equipping no Eiji Skill Records in the same set.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Dancing in the Verdant Wind] Leafa\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the April 22, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 27, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
