    "full_details": "Notices\nApril 19 is Leafa's birthday! Tons of events and Orders! You've gotta check out this announcement!\nEVENT\n2026-04-19 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nApril 19 is Leafa's birthday!\nWe're holding various campaigns in Sword Art Online Integral Factor to celebrate Leafa's birthday!\nLet's all celebrate this wonderful day together!\nFor more details, check the announcements for each event and Order.\nAlso, please note that event periods are different for each.\nHappy Dungeon with Leafa\nWe're holding an event where you can get an Leafa chat stamp and up to 500 Arcana Gems!\nPeriod\nApril 17, 2026 (Fri) 4:00 - April 24, 2026 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Battle Rush\nWe have added the Expert difficulty. Leafa will also take part in the battle!\nThis event will feature plenty of avatars available to obtain. If you don't have them all yet, don't miss their comeback!\nPeriod\nStarts after the April 8, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 30, 2026 (Thu) maintenance.\nLeafa's Birthday Order\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Leafa!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nLeafa's Birthday Order is here!\nDuration\nApril 19, 2026 (Sun) 0:00 - April 28, 2026 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Panels\nPanels featuring illustrations of Leafa have been placed in four in-game locations!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nApril 19, 2026 (Sun) 0:00 - April 28, 2026 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nArcana Gem Gift\nLog in on the day of Leafa's birthday to get a gift of 250 Arcana Gems!\nTime Limit\nAvailable until April 19, 2026 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
