    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Alice's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Alice!\nShop\n2026-04-09 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Alice's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Sanctuary of Falling Petals] Alice\n(Chain Skill)\" and \"\n[A Moment's Rest] Alice\n(Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nAlice's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Alice guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Alice\" is guaranteed!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sanctuary of Falling Petals] Alice\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Grace/Back Up\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Grace 3] Adds a buff (Shine Pile) where holy damage +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec when using Switch. (Invalid when equipped by partner)/[Back Up 6] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records: Attack +25%.When equipping 3 or more of Kirito's Skill Records: Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +15%.When equipping 1 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records: Skill's power is added +200% when used in switch.When equipping 2 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records: Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +15%.When equipping 1 or more of Asuna's Skill Records: Max HP increase 10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nDeals +5% Holy element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[A Moment's Rest] Alice\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShining Ripper Burst\nSkill Name\nShining Ripper\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→Slash→\nHoly\n→\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n37\nBreak Gauge\n74\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2100% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Holy element's damage rises by the number of Kirito Skill Records in the same set x 10%./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +100%, when equipping no Eiji Skill Records in the same set.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nApril 9, 2026 (Thu) 0:00 - April 18, 2026 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Alice\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Alice\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
