    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Argo's Mission Report\" Panel Mission has been updated!\nUPDATE\n2026-04-08 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe\n\"Argo's Mission Report\"\nPanel Mission has been updated following the April 8, 2026 (Wed) maintenance!\nClear missions inside the Panel Mission to get lots of items that will help you complete adventures and strengthen your characters!\nThe Panel Mission will be displayed and accessible after completing the 1F Main Quest [Another Reality].\n* Players who already fully completed \"Argo's Mission Report\" before the renewal will be able to skip the progression of the new \"Argo's Mission Report\" panel mission.\nIf this requirement is met, players will immediately receive the new rewards.\nMission Details\nMission\nRewards\nAmount\nClear the Daily Dungeon 3 times.\nArcana Gems\n500\nRaise any Skill Record to Lv70+.\nRecord Kit M\nHigh Blue Jewel\nHigh Red Jewel\nHigh Yellow Jewel\nHigh Green Jewel\n250\n50\n50\n50\n50\nComplete 10 Achievements and collect rewards.\nArcana Gems\n250\nObtain a weapon or armor with Equipment Level Lv70+.\nGlare Dragon Stone\nRecord Frame L\n300\n600\nProduce a weapon or armor at the Blacksmith.\nRefining Hammer\nSlicing Stone\nPiercing Stone\nStriking Stone\nBlocking Stone\nRefining Hammer+\nSlicing Stone+\nPiercing Stone+\nStriking Stone+\nBlocking Stone+\n200\n100\n100\n100\n100\n200\n100\n100\n100\n100\nClear the Subquest 3 times.\nCol\n200,000\nRegister for transfer.\nEmergency Crystal\nHealing Crystal\n100\n50\nGet to Proficiency Level to 15 or higher.\nArcana Gems\n250\nComplete the first 2F quest \"Wild Plains\".\nRevive Crystal\nCleansing Potion\nRestorative Potion\n25\n50\n100\nComplete Reward\nAmount\n★4[Wise] Asuna\n1\n* Rewards for missions set as \"Pack\" are automatically obtained when the mission is completed.\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
