    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Scenario Event \"Advanced Notice Full of Dreams\" is back! Get your hands on a ★4 [Phantom Thief] Yuuki Skill Record!\nEVENT\n2026-04-08 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"Advanced Notice Full of Dreams\" is back!\nThis event will carry over the following progress from the previous run:\n・Quest progression and rewards\n・Total Score and Score Rewards\n・Challenge rewards\n・Amount traded\n* Previously deleted items such as \"Land Free Pass\" will not be carried over.\nAlso, this event will be supported by Story Replay from now on.\nAfter fully completing the scenario quest, you can replay it via the dungeon NPC for the event.\nWhat is \"Advanced Notice Full of Dreams\"?\nWho appeared at the Theme Park was someone who looks like the Phantom Thief Y.\nThe purpose is......?\nRewards\nOne of the rewards is the \"★4 [Phantom Thief] ???\" Skill Record, which can be transformed into ★5 [Phantom Thief] Yuuki!\nCollect the tradable item \"Land Free Pass\" and trade it for \"★4 [Phantom Thief] ???\" and other great rewards!\nGet up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\"\nfrom the entire event.\nSkill Record\n★4[Phantom Thief] ???\nSkill Name\nSkillful Lightning/ Gale Blade\nAttack\n35\nDefense\n34\nHP\n1150\nSkill Effect\n●[Skillful Lightning 3] When critical rate+ buff is in effect, deal 100 additional damage when attacking./[Gale Blade 3] Deals +5% Wind element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nTrade \"Land Free Pass\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\n[Phantom Thief] ???\n400\n1\n[Phantom Thief] ???\n999\n5\nEnergy Fruit\n10\n10\nGolden Bells\n100\n3\nSlicing Stone+\n30\n50\nPiercing Stone+\n30\n50\nStriking Stone+\n30\n50\nBlocking Stone+\n30\n100\nRefining Hammer+\n50\n50\nTrader\nSee each Trader NPC for more info, or go to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the \"Land Free Pass Trade\" banner.\nHigh difficulty \"\nSpecial\n\"\nYou can clear the \"\nSpecial\n\" 3 times per day.\nIn addition, item use is restricted while inside the dungeon and \"Revive Crystals\" can only be used up to 3 times.\nScore Rewards\nEntry\nInterior\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n150\nLand Free Pass\n5\n200\nLand Free Pass\n10\n300\nHealing Potion\n10\n400\nHealing Potion\n10\n600\nRecord Frame M\n10\n800\nRecord Frame M\n15\n1200\nLand Free Pass\n10\n1600\nLand Free Pass\n15\n2100\nHealing Potion\n10\n2800\nHealing Potion\n10\n3000\nCleansing Potion\n5\n4000\nCleansing Potion\n10\n4200\nHealing Potion\n10\n5600\nRestorative Potion\n5\n5400\nRecord Frame M\n20\n7200\nRecord Frame M\n30\n6600\nLand Free Pass\n30\n8800\nLand Free Pass\n35\n7800\nArcana Gem\n50\n10400\nArcana Gem\n50\n9000\nRevive Crystal\n1\n12000\nRevive Crystal\n2\nDepth\nDANGER\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n250\nLand Free Pass\n15\n300\nLand Free Pass\n20\n500\nRestorative Potion\n5\n600\nRestorative Potion\n10\n1000\nRecord Frame L\n10\n1200\nRecord Frame L\n15\n2000\nLand Free Pass\n20\n2400\nLand Free Pass\n30\n3500\nRestorative Potion\n10\n4200\nRelease Crystal (S)\n3\n5000\nCleansing Potion\n15\n6000\nCleansing Potion\n20\n7000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n1\n8400\nRestorative Potion\n20\n9000\nRecord Frame L\n20\n10800\nRecord Frame L\n30\n11000\nLand Free Pass\n40\n13200\nLand Free Pass\n50\n13000\nArcana Gem\n50\n15600\nArcana Gem\n50\n15000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n5\n18000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n10\nSpecial\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n1000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n3000\nSmall Gift\n1\n5000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n7000\nMemoria Niter S\n10\nEvent Period\nStarts after the April 8, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 13, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the April 8, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 20, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nHow to Participate\nOpen the List of Events from the Menu in the upper left corner of the screen, and tap the \"Advanced Notice Full of Dreams\" banner.\n(Tapping the in-game banner will take you to the \"Kiritoland\" Event Map.)\nOn the \"Kiritoland\" Event Map, talk to \"Kibaou\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 4 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nDestroying the \"Hint\" treasure boxes that appear in the \"Special\" difficulty dungeon will give all enemies inside a debuff that increases your critical rate towards them.\nStory Replay\nAfter completing the scenario quest, you can replay it via the dungeon NPC for the event.\nStory Replay is displayed beneath the dungeon.\nBoss Monster\nKiritobot Mk. II\nDetails\nIt can attack by roaring and trampling you beneath its feet.\nOn \"Depth\", \"DANGER\", and \"Special\" difficulties, Skill Breaks can be performed with 2H Spear skills.\nWeakness\nBlunt Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\n* Skill Break: By completely lowering the Skill Break Gauge, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all of its buff effects will be removed.\nYuuki The Phantom Thief\nDetails\nAppears on \"Special\" difficulty.\nIt attacks with a variety of sword techniques.\nWeakness\nBlunt Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf the ★4 Skill Records you acquire as rewards for this event have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Memoria Niter L\".\n\"Land Free Pass\" will be deleted on May 20, 2026 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nAfter you clear a Special difficulty dungeon three times, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nScenario quests and Special difficulty dungeons cannot be attempted with an \"Assist Party\".\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
