    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Phantom Bullet Sniper Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2026-04-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nFour new ★4 Skill Records of Sinon from a slightly different timeline are here!\nEnjoy the different artworks of Sinon traversing the lower floors, breaking through a trap room, successfully taming a monster, and heading into a climactic showdown!\nThe \"\nPhantom Bullet Sniper Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Eyes of the Wind Reader] Sinon\nSkill Name\nBloody Battle Thrust/Flame Conversion\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Bloody Battle Thrust 3] Attack +35% when attacking with thrust element./[Flame Conversion 4]Water element's damage to enemies -10% and fire element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Crisis-Piercing Trajectory] Sinon\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nFlame Impact Burst\nSkill Name\nFlame Impact\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→Thrust→\nFire\n→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n31\nBreak Gauge\n62\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1990% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Flame Force 4/Buff] Fire element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +20% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5500% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] The lower your own HP, attack increases.(max 200%)/[Bonus] Fire element damage increases x 0.5% the number of burn stacks when the player is inflicted with the burn status ailment./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Hearts on a Hill in Bloom] Sinon\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nLightning Hornet\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n2250% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nHoly damage +50% when using Holy skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Holy damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Heroic Light in Crisis] Sinon\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nLightning Bouncer\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n76\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n2360% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nHoly damage +50% when using Holy skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Holy damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nApril 1, 2026 (Wed) 0:00 - April 30, 2026 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
