    "news_date": 1774969200,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "劇情活動「無弓世界的詠嘆調」現已開啟！  如果我只有一把槍…4月1日：借助超越系統的女神之力，歷史的齒輪正在等待…獎勵獲得活動限定技能記錄★4【荒謬的象徵】莉茲貝特、詩乃聊天印章、蘋果B等恢復道具…",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe scenario event \"Aria of a Bowless World\" is on now! Get a ★4 Skill Record with Goddess Lisbeth's artwork, limited-edition Sinon chat stamps, and more!\nEVENT\n2026-04-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nScenario Event \"Aria of a Bowless World\" is on now!\nIf I only had a gun...\nApril 1: By the power of a goddess who transcends the system, the gears of history lie in wait...\nRewards\nGet the event-limited Skill Record ★4[Symbol of Absurdity] Lisbeth, Sinon chat stamps, recovery items such as Apple Bread, and more!\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Star\"\n, up to 25\n\"Medal of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 300\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\n\"Star Fragment\" may drop on certain difficulty levels!\nSkill Record\n★4[Symbol of Absurdity] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Enhance Antidote\nAttack\n26\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 3] Attack +300./●[Enhance Antidote 4]Poison damage -50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChat Stamps\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nItems for Acquisition\nIf I only had a gun...\nMemory Stamp 368\nCan I say something?\nMemory Stamp 369\nEvent-limited item\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nTarget Apple\nApple used for bow practice.\nInstantly recover 2000 HP.\nApple Bread\nDelicious bread with the aroma of apples and butter.\nInstantly recover 6000 HP.\n* Apple Breads do not expire.\nTrader Rewards\nExchange the \"Crimson Silent Arrow\" you obtain from the event at the exclusive Trader to get items.\n\"Blue Silent Arrow\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the April 8, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on April 15, 2026 (Wed).\nTrade \"Crimson Silent Arrow\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n50\n★4[Symbol of Absurdity] Lisbeth\n400\n1\nMemory Stamp 368\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 369\n100\n1\nApple Bread\n3\n10\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTrade \"Blue Silent Arrow\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n25\n★4[Symbol of Absurdity] Lisbeth\n400\n1\nApple Bread\n3\n10\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Starting Point\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\", \"Gaining Ground\", and \"Unknown\" difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score\nStarting Point\nBasic Clear Bonus:74P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n80\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:170P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n200\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:420P＋Survival Bonus:10P per surviving player\n480\nGaining Ground\nBasic Clear Bonus:1680P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n1800\nUnknown\nBasic Clear Bonus:11000P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n11120\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join \"Gaining Ground\" and \"Unknown\" difficulty Quick Parties.\nGaining Ground: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nUnknown: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 200,000 or higher\n\"\nGaining Ground\n\"\nYou can get a high score in this bonus dungeon.\nIt can be cleared up to once per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\n\"\nUnknown\n\"\nThis is a \"Field with some unusable items\" where certain items cannot be used and players cannot revive.\nOf all the difficulties eligible for a Total Score Reward, these dungeons award the highest scores.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\n★4[Symbol of Absurdity] Lisbeth×7\nApple Bread×70\nArcana Gems×600\nMemoria Niter S×120\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nAwakening Star×40\nGreat Red Jewel×4\nGreat Green Jewel×4\nGreat Yellow Jewel×4\nGreat Blue Jewel×4\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nIf I only had a gun...!\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Crimson Silent Arrows in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nDeadly Shot Demon Lord\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Crimson Silent Arrows in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nEvent Period\nApril 1, 2026 (Wed) 0:00 - Before the May 13, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n* The high-difficulty dungeon Exile will be implemented after the April 8, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nCrimson Silent Arrow: April 1, 2026 (Wed) 0:00 - Before the May 20, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nBlue Silent Arrow: Starts after the April 8, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 20, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"April Fool 2026\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 4 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nStory Replay\nAfter completing the scenario quest, you can replay it via the dungeon NPC for the event.\nStory Replay is displayed beneath the dungeon.\nBoss Monster\nIllfang the Kobold Lord\nDetails\nBreak with Thrust Element.\nOn Exile difficulty, you can break it with the Slash Element.\nWhen a break happens, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all its buffs will be removed.\nIn addition, when a Break happens, it will receive a stack debuff that increases the damage it takes.\nOn Unknown and Exile difficulties, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nOn DANGER, Gaining Ground, Unknown and Exile difficulty levels, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nExcept Exile\nThrust Element\nHoly Element\nExile\nSlash Element\nHoly Element\nResistance\nUnknown\nSlash Element\nBlunt Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nDark Element\nCritical\nDamage\nExile\nThrust Element\nBlunt Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nDark Element\nCritical\nDamage\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Increase Attack\" and \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Paralysis\" and \"Debility\"\nDebuff \"Decrease Non-Elemental Damage\" and \"Seal item\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nFor details on the effects of \"Status Ailments\", please check in-game via \"Menu\" > \"System\" > \"Help\" > \"Buff, Debuff, and Status Ailments\".\nAlternatively, please refer to the\n\"Status Ailments\"\nsection of the Play Guide.\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nIf the ★4 Skill Records you acquire as rewards for this event have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Record Kit M\".\nAfter you clear the Gaining Ground dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\n\"Crimson Silent Arrow\", \"Blue Silent Arrow\", and \"Target Apple\" will be deleted on May 20, 2026 (Wed) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nScenario quests cannot be attempted with an Assist Party.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2026-03-31T15:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2026-05-12T19:00:00+00:00"
