    "snippet": "Lisbeth、Alice、Silica 和 Klein 將為您帶來全新的 ★4 技能記錄，帶來舒適的飛行體驗！ 「艾恩葛朗特航空令」來了！保證在步驟 5 獲得一項新的 ★4 技能記錄！ 6%的總掉率不包括保證的★4技能記錄，以及新增的★4技能記錄…",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Aincrad Airlines Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2026-03-25 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nLisbeth, Alice, Silica and Klein are here to provide a comfortable flight experience in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nAincrad Airlines Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[To the Flight Mission] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Enhance Burn Immunity/Hold the Front\nAttack\n51\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./●[Enhance Burn Immunity 4] Burn damage -50%./[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Joy of the Skies] Alice\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nBurning V Square Burst\nSkill Name\nBurning V Square\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Slash→(\nDark\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n80\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2400% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Leafa's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +100%./[Bonus] Fire element damage increases x 0.5% the number of burn stacks when the player is inflicted with the burn status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Rest Above the Clouds] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nBurning Spin\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n2170% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nFire damage +50% when using fire skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise fire damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Steel-Wing Commander] Klein\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nFlame Down Burst\nSkill Name\nFlame Down\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Thrust→(\nFire\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n78\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2460% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Fire Element Weak 4/Debuff] Fire element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec./[Flame Force 4/Buff] Fire element damage +15% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n6000% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Blaze Demon 5/Buff] Fire element damage +65% for 8 sec./[Bonus] Attack +150% against enemies with debuff status./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Sachi's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Joy of the Skies] Alice\", \"[Steel-Wing Commander] Klein\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the March 25, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 15, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
