    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(3/25)\nMAINT.\n2026-03-24 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 3/25, 2026, 13:00, was completed on 3/25, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Chaos Boss Dungeon Part 24\" Land Devourer Chaos begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt\"\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Core Metal+++ Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n\"Aincrad Airlines Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAdded the Skill Records to the [1x Only] Medal of Combat Arts Trader\nChanged \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to the normal design\nThe Guild Room will be re-themed for a limited time for spring\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue in the Equipment Set filter screen where buttons with empty fields appeared in the list\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n3/25, 2026 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Chaos Boss Dungeon Part 24\" Land Devourer Chaos begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt\"\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Core Metal+++ Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\nNew Order begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 3/25 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 69\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"White Day Assault\"\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Protection Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Skill Releaser Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
