    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Agil's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Agil!\nShop\n2026-03-09 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Agil's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Full-Power Counterattack] Agil\n(Link Skill)\" and \"\n[Veteran Warrior] Agil\n(Link Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nAgil's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Agil guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Agil\" is guaranteed!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Full-Power Counterattack] Agil\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Exciting\nAttack\n57\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Exciting 4] Defense -30% and during the buff effect for increased max HP the critical damage -300%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nEffect duration is extended.\nThe higher the Limit Break level, the more Link Level increases when attacking with Link Sword Skills.\nWhen Activated: Attack +500 when using Link Sword Skills.\nLLv100: Skill Power is added +100%.\nLLv250: Fire element damage +20%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Veteran Warrior] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWind Buster\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n2820% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Wind Force 4/Buff] Wind element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Blunt 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +20% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Wind element damage +50%.\nLLv100: Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP x 200%.\nLLv250: Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nMarch 9, 2026 (Mon) 0:00 - March 18, 2026 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Agil\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Agil\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
