    "full_details": "Notices\nMarch 9 is Agil's birthday! Tons of events and Orders! You've gotta check out this announcement!\nEVENT\n2026-03-09 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nMarch 9 is Agil's birthday!\nWe're holding various campaigns in Sword Art Online Integral Factor to celebrate Agil's birthday!\nLet's all celebrate this wonderful day together!\nFor more details, check the announcements for each event and Order.\nAlso, please note that event periods are different for each.\nHappy Dungeon with Agil\nWe're holding an event where you can get an Agil chat stamp and up to 500 Arcana Gems!\nPeriod\nMarch 6, 2026 (Fri) 4:00 - March 13, 2026 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nAgil's Birthday Order\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Agil!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nAgil's Birthday Order is here!\nDuration\nMarch 9, 2026 (Mon) 0:00 - March 18, 2026 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Panels\nPanels featuring illustrations of Agil have been placed in four in-game locations!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nMarch 9, 2026 (Mon) 0:00 - March 18, 2026 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nArcana Gem Gift\nLog in on the day of Agil's birthday to get a gift of 250 Arcana Gems!\nTime Limit\nAvailable until March 9, 2026 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
