    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(2/25)\nMAINT.\n2026-02-24 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 2/25, 2026, 12:00, was completed on 2/25, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad 16F\"\nPlayer Level Cap Raised(Lv.280→Lv.290)\nAdded \"Valentine Boss Rush\" Event rewards\n\"Silica's Heapin' 50M EXP Event\" begins\n\"Piercing Breakthrough Premium Step-Up Order\" begins\nUpdated \"Appraisal\" lineup\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAdded a filter search function for Ingots\nAdded a transition from completed Ingot production to the Composite screen\nAdded lock and unlock functions accessible from the Ingot Composite screen\nSplit the Face category under Makeup into \"Facial Features\" and \"Eye Color\", and added an eye color customization function\nAdded a Field of View adjustment setting during View Mode\nUpdated the Market so that the current number of listings for each item is now displayed when selecting \"Buy Item\"\n⇒For more details, please check:\n\"Various convenient features have been added, including improvements to Ingot controls and a new eye color customization feature!\"\nThe Guild Room will be changed to the usual theme.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Official Live Stream Rewards\nAs a reward for the correct answers to the quiz portion of the official live stream on 2/20, 2026, 400 Arcana Gems have been sent to all players.\nReceive by: Until 3/4, 2026, 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n2/25, 2026 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad 16F\"\nPlayer Level Cap Raised(Lv.280→Lv.290)\nAdded \"Valentine Boss Rush\" Event rewards\n\"Silica's Heapin' 50M EXP Event\" begins\nUpdated \"Appraisal\" lineup\nNew Order begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 2/25 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 68\n\"Bitter Chocolate Road\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
