    "snippet": "為了慶祝小春的生日，新的★4技能記錄「[發光拱門下]小春（連鎖技能）」和「[盛開的債券]小春（全面爆發技能）」現已推出！ 「小春的生日訂單」來了！步驟 3 保證獲得 1 個 ★4 小春！  在第 1 步，您可以獲得 11 個訂單，價格為 1,250 Arca...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Koharu's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Koharu!\nShop\n2026-02-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Koharu's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Under the Luminous Arch] Koharu\n(Chain Skill)\" and \"\n[Bonds in Full Bloom] Koharu\n(Full Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nKoharu's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Koharu guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Koharu\" is guaranteed!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Under the Luminous Arch] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nFlame Thrust\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n92\nBreak Gauge\n47\nSkill Effect\n2250% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nFire damage +50% when using fire skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise fire damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Bonds in Full Bloom] Koharu\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nCubic Water Burst\nSkill Name\nCubic Water\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Slash→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n68\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1990% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] Inflict Frostbite (Stack 1) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5500% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Increases attack against enemies with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite). +1% for every Stack 1./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Silica's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n- Duration\nFebruary 23, 2026 (Mon) 0:00 - March 4, 2026 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Koharu\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Koharu\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
