    "news_date": 1771772400,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "小春生日祭！ 「花節」即將開幕！打敗活動限定怪物“花豬籠草”，收集花手鐲並用它們交換各種物品！  獎勵 您可以獲得精美的 10 張小春郵票來慶祝她的生日！更重要的是，變換...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Koharu Birthday Festival \"Flower Fest\" is here! Get chat stamps and a transformation item that lets you transform into Koharu!\nEVENT\n2026-02-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKoharu Birthday Festival!\nThe \"Flower Fest\" is on now!\nDefeat the event-limited monsters Flower Nepenthes in each field where they appear to collect Flower Bracelets and trade them for various items!\nRewards\nYou can get a stunning 10 Koharu stamps celebrating her birthday!\nWhat's more, the transformation item \"Koharu's hand-mirror\", which lets you transform into Koharu is available as a reward!\nYou can even get fireworks, so be sure to use them to celebrate Koharu!\nYou can also get other items such as Memoria Niter S, and Awakening Stars.\nEvent Limited Transformation Item\nIcon\nItem Name\nKoharu's hand-mirror\nA buff item that lets you transform into Koharu for a limited time.\nYou will transform into one of 8 different forms at random.\n* The chances for transforming into each form are different.\nThey are effective for 180 seconds.\nMovement, the evasion button, and some items can be used while transformed. However, other actions such as attacking cannot be performed.\n* Using another transformation item while transformed will transform you into a newly drawn form.\n* You can use the Awakening button while transformed.\nTransformation will end in the following cases:\nTransformation buff effect time ends.\nThe player moves between areas (including entering/exiting dungeons, etc.).\nCancel Transformation button is tapped (the Attack button will turn into the Cancel Transformation button while transformed).\nChat Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nKoharu Stamp 11\nKoharu Stamp 12\nKoharu Stamp 13\nKoharu Stamp 14\nKoharu Stamp 15\nKoharu Stamp 16\nKoharu Stamp 17\nKoharu Stamp 18\nKoharu Stamp 22\nKoharu Stamp 23\nFlower Fest Trader\nGo to the Koharu character panel placed in Teleport Gate Plaza to exchange your Flower Bracelets for rewards.\nHowever, for more info, go to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the Flower Fest Trader banner.\nTrader\nEvent Period\nFebruary 23, 2026 (Mon) 0:00 - Before the March 11, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nTrader Period\nFebruary 23, 2026 (Mon) 0:00 - Before the March 18, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nEvent Monsters\nFlower Nepenthes\nDuring the event, Flower Nepenthes will appear in the fields of every floor.\n* Does not appear in Labyrinths or floor dungeons.\nImportant\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nFlower Bracelets and Koharu's hand-mirrors will be deleted on March 18, 2026 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2026-02-22T15:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2026-03-17T19:00:00+00:00"
