    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Ordinal Scale: Rushing Toward the Future Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2026-02-18 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuna, Eiji, Kirito, and Agil from Sword Art Online the Movie -Ordinal Scale- are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nOrdinal Scale: Rushing Toward the Future Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Supporting Song] Yuna\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nFlame Asterisk Burst\nSkill Name\nFlame Asterisk\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→Blunt→\nFire\n→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n57\nSwitch Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n96\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2350% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5700% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark)./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%./[Bonus] Fire element damage increases x 0.5% the number of burn stacks when the player is inflicted with the burn status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Dark Revenger] Eiji\nSkill Name\nBloody Battle Strike/Flame Conversion\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2800\nSkill Effect\n[Bloody Battle Strike 3] Attack +35% when attacking with blunt element./[Flame Conversion 4]Water element's damage to enemies -10% and fire element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Memory-Seeking Swordsman] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHeat Creep\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n41\nSkill Effect\n2800% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Flame Force 4/Buff] Fire element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Slash 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to Slash +20% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Fire element damage +50%.\nLLv100：Your own attack increases by defense x 1.\nLLv250: Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Mighty Axe Master] Agil\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nShadow Double Down Burst\nSkill Name\nShadow Double Down\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Blunt→(\nDark\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n96\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2460% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n6000% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP x 200%./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%./[Bonus] Dark element damage increases x 0.5% the number of Curse stacks when the player is inflicted with the Curse status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Supporting Song] Yuna\", \"[Memory-Seeking Swordsman] Kirito\" and \"[Mighty Axe Master] Agil\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter the February 18, 2026 (Wed) maintenance - March 20, 2026 (Fri) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
