    "snippet": "登入《刀劍神域積分因子》的用戶須知。維護將在以下日期期間生效。  ▼預定維護日期2026年2月18日12:00至17:00（暫定）（JST/UTC+9）▼新實施和新活動“公會公會”第68季開始增加獎勵和高難度...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(2/18)\nMAINT.\n2026-02-17 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 2/18, 2026, 12:00, was completed on 2/18, 2026, 18:00(JST/UTC+9).\nWe will be sending out token of apology for the maintenance.\n50 Arcana Gems\nAvailable until:2/25/2026(Wed) at 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 68 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Valentine Boss Rush\"\n\"Ordinal Scale Immortal Fragments\" is back\n\"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n\"Ordinal Scale: Rushing Toward the Future Order\" begins\n\"Ordinal Scale Avatar Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAdded limited time only emote\nCheer\n* limited emotions are scheduled to be removed during maintenance on 3/11, 2026.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Upcoming Update\nAs of the next scheduled maintenance on 2/25, 2026, the guild room will no longer be themed for winter.\nIf you haven't visited yet, please go see the autumn theme while you still can and enjoy taking pictures with your guild members.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n2/18, 2026 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 68 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Valentine Boss Rush\"\n\"Ordinal Scale Immortal Fragments\" is back\n\"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nNew Order begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 2/18 Maintenance\n\"Fortune Ogre Hunt\"\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
