    "full_details": "Notices\nPlease Reconfirm Your \"Bandai Namco ID\" Transfer Registration\nIMPORTANT\n2026-02-13 10:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThank you for playing Sword Art Online: Integral Factor.\nAn issue occurred in which transfer registrations using a Bandai Namco ID were unintentionally removed.\nThis issue has already been resolved. However, we kindly ask all players who previously completed the registration to please check that they are linked once again.\nIf you find that your account is not linked or unlinked as you intended, we would appreciate it if you could reconfigure your settings via \"Transfer Registration\" or \"Unlink.\"\nWe sincerely ask your cooperation in helping us protect your important data.\nWe deeply apologize for the inconvenience and trouble this issue may have caused our players.\nThank you for your continued support of Sword Art Online: Integral Factor.\nGo to Notice List"
