    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(2/4)\nMAINT.\n2026-02-03 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 2/4, 2026, 13:00, was completed on 2/4, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Fortune Ogre Hunt\"\n\"Female Swordsman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\" is back\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n\"Match Made In Heaven Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where Night Rabbit Meat could not be exchanged for Awakening Stars at the Wonder Animal Trader\nFixed issues with certain boss emotions at the Fortune Ogre Hunt\nFixed an issue where the activation conditions for [Protection Detail 5] of [Serenade of Gratitude] Yuna were incorrect\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n2/4, 2026 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Fortune Ogre Hunt\"\n\"Female Swordsman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\" is back\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nNew Order begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 2/4 Maintenance\nThe 12th \"Squad Jumble\"\n\"Wonder Animal Assault 2026\"\n\"Guild Support Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
