    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Mythical Scroll Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2026-01-30 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne ★4 Skill Record featuring a mythical outfit is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nThe \"\nMythical Scroll Selection Order\n\" is on now!\n- Duration\nJanuary 30, 2026 (Fri) 17:00 - February 14, 2026 (Sat) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Orders for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Turning Point of Destiny] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWind Whirlpool\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n132\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n2250% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Orderly Judgement] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nDemolishing Shadow\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n2060% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Oracle from the Halo] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWind Bump\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n1430% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Wishing for A Good Harvest] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nBurning Smash\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n65\nBreak Gauge\n45\nSkill Effect\n1630% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[PT Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Party's attack +15% for 15 sec./[Flame Force 5/Buff (PT)] Fire element damage +20% for you and your party for 5 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Princess of Sea Storms] Leafa\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/High Battle Healing\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 4] Attack +400./[High Battle Healing 4] Recovers a max of 1.5% HP per 3 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Ocean Princess] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nBlaze Cinque\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nBreak Gauge\n20\nSkill Effect\n1330% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Find Weakness 3/Debuff] Finds the enemy's weakeness for 15 sec at a specific rate. The critical rate +15% to enemy that has their weakness found.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Dragon God's Leap] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHatchet Ground\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, the damage you receive decreases at 50%.(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated)./[Celebration4/Buff] Your HP recovers for 30 sec.(1.5%/3sec)Effect will be removed with damage.\n* Collecting aggro from enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Watchful Eyes] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nWide Dark Fencer\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n28\nSkill Effect\n1000% damage (4x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +150% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] Recovers 10% of your own Max HP when this skill is used and when you hit.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[On Track to the End] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nHoly Stitch\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n1280% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
