    "snippet": "我們於2026年1月29日15:00開始進行維護，已於2026年1月29日15:50(JST/UTC+9)完成。  - 維護內容修復了小隊混亂中殺手怪物的攻擊不會立即導致玩家無法戰鬥的問題修復了...的要求的問題",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(1/29)\nMAINT.\n2026-01-29 15:50:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nMaintenance we have implemented from 1/29, 2026 15:00, was completed on 1/29, 2026 15:50(JST/UTC+9).\n- Maintenance Contents\nFixed an issue where attacks from Killer Monsters in the Squad Jumble would not immediately cause players to become unable to fight\nFixed an issue where the requirements for Squad Jumble Achievements were incorrect\nTargeted Achievements:\n・Obtain the Skull Reaper Class.\n・Let's collect a total of 2000 Squad Symbol αs in the time period\n・Let's collect a total of 2000 Squad Symbol βs in the time period\n*If an issue occurs where the new Record cannot be obtained even after meeting the requirments, it will be distributed during a future maintenance.\nPlease note that Achievements and Records earned during the period when the issue occurrs will be changed to the following.\nRecord obtained from \"Obtain the Colossus Class 4\": \"SJ12 Colossus Class\"\nRecord obtained from \"Obtain the Samurai Lord Class 4\": \"SJ12 Samurai Lord Class4\"\nRecord obtained from \"Obtain the Samurai Lord Class 1\": \"SJ12 Samurai Lord Class1\"\n- Apology for Issues & Maintenance Compensation Details\n50 Arcana Gems\n- Pick up period\n2/4, 2026 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nOnce again, we apologize for any inconvenience and trouble that this issue has caused.\nWe hope that you continue to enjoy Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\n--------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n- Scheduled maintenance dates\n1/29, 2026 15:00 to 16:00 (JST/UTC+9)\n* There may be changes with the date.\n- Maintenance Contents\nAdjusting server equipment.\nPlease note that the game can not be played during maintenance.\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\nGo to Notice List"
