    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(1/28)\nMAINT.\n2026-01-28 16:59:59\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 1/28, 2026, 12:00, was completed on 1/28, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 12th \"Squad Jumble\" begins\n\"Fortune Ogre Hunt\" begins\nAdded \"Wonder Animal Assault 2026\" Event rewards\n\"Bitter Chocolate Road\" is back\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAdded login notification settings for Guild Members and Mutual Followers\nAdded login display settings to the Guild Members / Mutual Followers list screens\nAdded a shortcut function from the Daily Missions screen\n⇒ For details on these updates, please check here.\nTeleport Gate Plaza have been changed to Valentine themed maps\nEnd of the \"Daily 250 Arcana Gems Campaign\"\nThe bonus Arcana Gem A campaign will now be held in conjunction with the \"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\".\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where the Limit Break and Enhancement values shown on Skill Record icons in the Trader were incorrect\nFixed an issue where the mini-map did not display correctly after a Squad Jumble battle ended\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n1/28, 2026 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 12th \"Squad Jumble\" begins\n\"Fortune Ogre Hunt\" begins\nAdded \"Wonder Animal Assault 2026\" Event rewards\n\"Bitter Chocolate Road\" is back\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 1/28 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 67\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
