    "full_details": "Notices\n[That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime] Collab Order Vol. 2 is here! Adding one new full illustration with background! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2026-01-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNew ★4 Skill Records with full illustrations of Asuna, Lisbeth, Silica, and Yuuki as depicted in the collab with characters from\nThat Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime\n!\n\"\nThat Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime Collab Order VOL. 2\n\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Flash and Maiden] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHope you like it.\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n70\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n2500% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Shine Force 4/Buff] Holy element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +20% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Holy element damage +50%.\nLLv100：While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 100%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Ruler of Black Flame] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nYou guys ready?\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n59\nBreak Gauge\n60\nSkill Effect\n2340% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)/[Enhance Blunt 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +20% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Dark element damage +50%.\nLLv100：Attack +100% against enemies with the debuff (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Double Twintail] Silica\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Out of Sorts\nAttack\n51\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Out of Sorts 4] Defense -30% and during the buff effect for increased max HP, the attack and damage -99% when using normal attack.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nDeals +5% fire element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Evil Demon and Legendary Sword] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nMy blade severs anything!\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n86\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWater damage +50% when using water skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise water damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Evil Demon and Legendary Sword] Yuuki\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter the January 15, 2026 (Thu) maintenance - January 30, 2026 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
