    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Stardust Maker Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-12-24 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSilica and Yuuki gather all their strength in their right hands to deliver the final blow in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nStardust Maker Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Girl with the Dragon] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nWind Loiter\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n2640% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Wind Force 4/Buff] Wind element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Slash 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to Slash +20% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Wind element damage +50%.\nLLv100： Increases attack against enemies with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite). +0.50% for every Stack 1.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Honed Heart and Blade] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nCombination/Poisonous Blow/Hold the Front/Frontal Attack\nAttack\n61\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n●[Combination 3] Skill's power is added +75% when used in switch./[Poisonous Blow 4] Attack +24% when the enemy is poisoned./[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Frontal Attack 5] Aggro increase -50% when attack hits.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Girl with the Dragon] Silica\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the December 24, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 21, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
