    "snippet": "假期活動！在此活動期間，在多輪角色任務中獲得 8 倍經驗！這是您輕鬆提升玩家等級的機會！  活動開始從商業區的公告欄接受角色任務。  參與要求透過...完成1F主線任務",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 8x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" is here!\nCampaign\n2025-12-03 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nDuring this campaign, get\n8x\nthe experience in Multiple Rounds Character Quests!\nThis is your chance to easily raise your player level!\nEvent Start\nAccept the Character Quest from the Bulletin Board in the Merchant District.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 1F Main Quest through the end\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the December 3, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the December 10, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nImportant\nDoes not include First-time Character Quests.\nThe EXP displayed in the Quest Details is the 8x value.\n8x EXP not included when a monster is defeated.\nIf the event finishes while you are in the middle of the Character Quest, you will gain the normal amount of EXP.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2025-12-02T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2025-12-09T19:00:00+00:00"
