    "full_details": "Notices\nThe scenario event \"Christmas Opus\" is back! Get a ★4 Yui Skill Record and stamps!\nEVENT\n2025-12-03 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nScenario Event \"Christmas Opus\" is back!\nIn search of a Christmas tree, your group arrives in Snowood Forest.\nThere, you meet the mysterious girl, Yui.\nRewards\nGet the event-limited Skill Record \"★4[Let the Party Begin] Yui\", Memory Stamps, and more!\nExchange the \"Xmas Ornament\" you obtain from the event at the exclusive Trader to get items.\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Star\"\n, up to 25\n\"Medal of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 300\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\n\"Star Fragment\" may drop on certain difficulty levels!\nFor this returning event, acquisition status of Total Score Rewards, Challenge Rewards and Trader Rewards from last time will be reset, allowing players to acquire these rewards once more.\nSkill Record\n★4[Let the Party Begin] Yui\nSkill Name\nReduced Battle Wounds/Dark Invitation\nAttack\n32\nDefense\n30\nHP\n1975\nSkill Effect\n●[Reduced Battle Wounds 3] Reduces damage from slash, thrust, and blunt element monsters and status ailment damage by 3%./[Dark Invitation 3] Deals +15% Dark element's damage to enemy.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMemory Stamp 258\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nLovely Present\nEvent-limited item\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nFluffy Mashed Potatoes\nMelts in your mouth.\nInstantly recovers 2,000 HP.\nTrade \"Red Xmas Ornament\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n50\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n25\n★4[Let the Party Begin] Yui\n400\n1\nMemory Stamp 258\n100\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTrade \"Gold Xmas Ornament\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n25\n★4[Let the Party Begin] Yui\n400\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Starting Point\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\" and \"Gaining Ground\", difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nThe score earned in \"Extreme\" difficulty is not added to the \"Total Score Reward\", but you will receive rewards based on your score.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score\nStarting Point\nBasic Clear Bonus:74P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n80\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:170P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n200\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:420P＋Survival Bonus:10P per surviving player\n480\nGaining Ground\nBasic Clear Bonus:1680P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n1800\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus:1000P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n1120\n\"\nGaining Ground\n\"\nYou can get a high score in the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" difficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" one time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nHigh difficulty \"\nExtreme\n\"\nThe high-difficulty dungeon \"\nExtreme\n\", has a recommended Total Power of 120,000. The boss has weaknesses that are different from those on other difficulty levels.\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join Gaining Ground and Extreme difficulty Quick Parties.\nGaining Ground: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nExtreme: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\n★4[Let the Party Begin] Yui×7\nArcana Gems×600\nMemoria Niter S×120\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nAwakening Star×40\nGreat Red Jewel×4\nGreat Green Jewel×4\nGreat Yellow Jewel×4\nGreat Blue Jewel×4\nSpecial items that can be received from \"Extreme\" Score Rewards\n[Let the Party Begin] Yui×2\nMemoria Niter S×70\nMedal of Combat Arts×9\nAwakening Star×10\nGreat Yellow Jewel×6\nGreat Green Jewel×6\nGreat Blue Jewel×6\nGreat Red Jewel×6\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nSentimental Xmas\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Red Xmas Ornaments in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nTrial & Error\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Red Xmas Ornaments in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nA Luxurious Moment\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Gold Xmas Ornaments in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nEvent Period\nStarts after the December 3, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 7, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the December 3, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 15, 2026 (Thu) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Xmas event 2023\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 6 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nStory Replay\nAfter completing the scenario quest, you can replay it via the dungeon NPC for the event.\nStory Replay is displayed beneath the dungeon.\nBoss Monster\nNicholas Chaos\nDetails\nYou can perform breaks.\nOn DANGER, Gaining Ground, and Extreme difficulties, the enemy uses a Chaos Recollection buff and a Seal Items debuff.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nDark Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Extreme\"difficulty\nBlunt Element\nEarth Element\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Curse\" and \"Frostbite\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf the ★4 Skill Records you acquire as rewards for this event have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Record Kit M\".\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nAfter you clear the Gaining Ground dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nIf you have previously played the \"Christmas Opus\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nAchievements and achievement progress\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\n\"Red Xmas Ornament\", \"Gold Xmas Ornament\", and \"Fluffy Mashed Potatoes\" will be deleted on January 15, 2026 (Thu) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nScenario quests cannot be attempted with an Assist Party.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
