    "full_details": "Notices\nThe scenario event \"Ringlings for Christmas\" is back! Get the ★4 Koharu Skill Record, festive chat stamps, and more!\nEVENT\n2025-12-03 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nScenario Event \"Ringlings for Christmas\" is back!\nA pair of rings that deepen the love between \\ntheir wearers?\nHearing the rumor from Silica, Koharu approaches you with a proposal...\nRewards\nGet the event-limited Skill Record \"★4[Christmas Wish] Koharu\", Memory Stamps, and more!\nExchange the \"Crystal Globe\" you obtain from the event at the exclusive Trader to get items.\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Star\"\n, up to 25\n\"Medal of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 300\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\n\"Star Fragment\" may drop on certain difficulty levels!\nFor this returning event, acquisition status of Total Score Rewards, Challenge Rewards and Trader Rewards from last time will be reset, allowing players to acquire these rewards once more.\nSkill Record\n★4[Christmas Wish] Koharu\nSkill Name\nEnhance Antidote\nAttack\n36\nDefense\n22\nHP\n1975\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Antidote 4]Poison damage -50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChat Stamps\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nItems for Acquisition\nSanta Lisbeth\nMemory Stamp 310\nHow embarrassing…\nMemory Stamp 311\nNot bad, eh\nMemory Stamp 312\nEvent-limited item\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nMince Pie\nPie filled with mince meat\nInstantly recover 2000 HP and status ailment.\nTrade \"Silver Crystal Globe\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n50\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n25\n★4[Christmas Wish] Koharu\n400\n1\nMemory Stamp 310\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 311\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 312\n100\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTrade \"Gold Crystal Globe\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n25\n★4[Christmas Wish] Koharu\n400\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Starting Point\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\", \"Gaining Ground\", and \"Unknown\" difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score\nStarting Point\nBasic Clear Bonus:74P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n80\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:170P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n200\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:420P＋Survival Bonus:10P per surviving player\n480\nGaining Ground\nBasic Clear Bonus:1680P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n1800\nUnknown\nBasic Clear Bonus:11000P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n11120\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join \"Gaining Ground\", \"Unknown\" and \"Exile\" difficulty Quick Parties.\nGaining Ground: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nUnknown: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 200,000 or higher\nExile: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 200,000 or higher\n\"\nGaining Ground\n\"\nYou can get a high score in this bonus dungeon.\nIt can be cleared up to once per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\n\"\nUnknown\n\"\nThis is a \"Field with some unusable items\" where certain items cannot be used and players cannot revive.\nOf all the difficulties eligible for a Total Score Reward, these dungeons award the highest scores.\nHigh-difficulty dungeon, \"\nExile\n\"\nThis is a \"Field with some unusable items\" where certain items cannot be used and players cannot revive.\nThe recommended Total Power is 600,000.\nThe score earned is not added to the Total Score Reward, but you will receive rewards based on your score.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\n★4[Christmas Wish] Koharu×7\nArcana Gems×600\nMemoria Niter S×120\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nAwakening Star×40\nGreat Red Jewel×4\nGreat Green Jewel×4\nGreat Yellow Jewel×4\nGreat Blue Jewel×4\nSpecial items that can be received from \"Exile\" Score Rewards\nMemoria Niter S×70\nMedal of Combat Arts×9\nAwakening Star×10\nGreat Yellow Jewel×6\nGreat Green Jewel×6\nGreat Blue Jewel×6\nGreat Red Jewel×6\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nA Ring for Christmas\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Silver Crystal Globes in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nA Journey for Love\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Silver Crystal Globes in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nGolem Slayer\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Gold Crystal Globes in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nEvent Period\nStarts after the December 3, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 7, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the December 3, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 15, 2026 (Thu) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Xmas event 2024\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 4 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nStory Replay\nAfter completing the scenario quest, you can replay it via the dungeon NPC for the event.\nStory Replay is displayed beneath the dungeon.\nBoss Monster\nBrilliant Golem\nDetails\nYou can perform breaks.\nWhen a break happens, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all its buffs will be removed.\nIn addition, when a Break happens, it will receive a stack debuff that increases the damage it takes.\nOn Unknown and Exile difficulties, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nOn DANGER, Gaining Ground, Unknown and Exile difficulty levels, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nExcept Exile\nThrust Element\nDark Element\nExile\nSlash Element\nFire Element\nResistance\nUnknown\nSlash Element\nBlunt Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nCritical\nDamage\nExile\nThrust Element\nBlunt Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nCritical\nDamage\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Bloodshed\", \"Curse\" and \"Paralysis\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nFor details on the effects of \"Status Ailments\", please check in-game via \"Menu\" > \"System\" > \"Help\" > \"Buff, Debuff, and Status Ailments\".\nAlternatively, please refer to the\n\"Status Ailments\"\nsection of the Play Guide.\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf the ★4 Skill Records you acquire as rewards for this event have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Record Kit M\".\nAfter you clear the Gaining Ground dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nIf you have previously played the \"Ringlings for Christmas\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nAchievements and achievement progress\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\n\"Silver Crystal Globe\", \"Gold Crystal Globe\", and \"Mince Pie\" will be deleted on January 15, 2026 (Thu) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nScenario quests cannot be attempted with an Assist Party.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
