    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] The \"Holiday Campaign! Panel Mission\" is here! Get up to 1,000 Arcana Gems by clearing missions!\nEVENT\n2025-11-28 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nThe\nHoliday Campaign! Panel Mission\nwhere you can get up to 1,000 Arcana Gems by clearing missions is here!\nRewards\nGet Arcana Gems by clearing each individual mission, then get 500 Arcana Gems as a completion reward for clearing all the missions listed on the panel!\nPeriod\nStarts after the November 28, 2025 (Fri) maintenance and ends before the December 31, 2025 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n* This Panel Mission Reward is available until January 7, 2026 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nMission Details\nMission\nRewards\nAmount\nClear Aincrad 75F\nArcana Gems\n50\nClear Aincrad 100F\nArcana Gems\n100\nClear a Labyrinth dungeon on 13F or above 15 times\nArcana Gems\n50\nClear the Chaos Showdown 15 times.\nArcana Gems\n50\nClear Underground Labyrinth: B1F Trial\nArcana Gems\n50\nClear Heapin' 50M EXP Event\nArcana Gems\n50\nClear The Knowledge of Equipment Refinement\nArcana Gems\n50\nClear About the Ring Gem Temple & Rings\nArcana Gems\n50\nClear the Ring Gem Temple 1 time\nArcana Gems\n50\n* All Out Battle [The Skull Reaper] and [Aincrad] will also be included in \"Clear a Labyrinth dungeon on 13F or above 15 times\".\nComplete Reward\nAmount\nArcana Gems\n500\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
