    "full_details": "Notices\n【Raising Dungeon】\"Happy Dungeon with Klein\" is here! Get the Klein stamp and Arcana Gems!\nEVENT\n2025-11-28 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\n\"Happy Dungeon with Klein\" is here! Get the Klein stamp and Arcana Gems in celebration of this character's birthday!\nRewards\n\"Arcana Gems\" and a\nlimited-edition \"Klein\" stamp\nare available as rewards.\nClear the dungeon every day during the event to get up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n.\nPeriod\nNovember 28, 2025 (Fri) 4:00 - December 5, 2025 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nVictorious Klein\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nArcana Gem\n50\n200\nArcana Gem\n50\n300\nArcana Gem\n50\n400\nArcana Gem\n100\n500\nArcana Gem\n50\n600\nArcana Gem\n50\n700\nArcana Gem\n50\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nMemory Stamp 354\nUse to obtain the \"Victorious Klein\" stamp.\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nArcana Gem\n50\nCompleted within 1 minutes\nArcana Gem\n50\nImportant\nCleared dungeons will be reset the following day at 4:00am (JST/UTC+9) and can be re-attempted after that.\nThis is a solo event that you can challenge with Klein as your partner.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
