    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(11/19)\nMAINT.\n2025-11-18 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 11/19, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 11/19, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 10th \"Squad Jumble\" begins\n[Aincrad Day] \"Core Metal+++ Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begin\nAdded [Aincrad Day] \"LafCof Assault 2025\" Event rewards\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Violet Glider Hunt\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begin\n\"Chaos Revolution Order\" begin\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Upcoming Update\nAs of the next scheduled maintenance on 11/28, 2025, the guild room will no longer be themed for autumn.\nIf you haven't visited yet, please go see the autumn theme while you still can and enjoy taking pictures with your guild members.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n11/19, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 10th \"Squad Jumble\" begins\n[Aincrad Day] \"Core Metal+++ Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begin\nAdded [Aincrad Day] \"LafCof Assault 2025\" Event rewards\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Violet Glider Hunt\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begin\nNew Order begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 11/19 Maintenance\n\"Goddesses of Judgment Order\"\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 65\n[30 Million Downloads Celebration] \"IF Halloween Party Trick or Treasure!\"\n[Aincrad Day] \"Chaos Crystal Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\n\"Attack of the Cactus Trio! 2025\"\n\"Aria of a Starless Night IF\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
