    "snippet": "[11/13 14:00 (JST/UTC+9) 更新] 排位獎勵已發放。請從禮品盒中領取。  更多獎勵詳情請參閱下文「排位獎勵」。  -------------------------------- 艾恩葛朗特之日特別活動！釣魚排行榜活動「2025秋季釣魚大賽」在...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[11/13 14:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] [Aincrad Day] Fishing Ranking Event, \"2025 Fall Fishing Competition\" is here!\nEVENT\n2025-11-13 14:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[11/13 14:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nRanking Rewards have been distributed. Please collect them from the present box.\nFor more details about the rewards, see \"Ranking Rewards\" below.\n--------------------------------\nAn Aincrad Day special event!\nFishing Ranking Event \"2025 Fall Fishing Competition\" is on now.\nIn the \"2025 Fall Fishing Competition\", you fight for the best rank based on your catch scores.\nThe \"Seashell Bread\", \"Ikura Turtle\", \"Blue Beater\", and \"Pineapple Fish\" were selected from user submissions and appear on this Event Map!\nCatch them to get a\nhigh score\n!\n- Event Period\nEvent Maps \"Underwater Lab\" Period: Starts after the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 28, 2025 (Fri) maintenance.\nRanking Period: Starts after the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 12, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nTo check your current ranking or score, go to Menu > Community > Ranking > 2025 Fall Fishing Competition ranking banner.\nRewards\nPlace at the top of the rankings to get limited-edition Fishing Competition records, rare fishing bait, and\nMemoria Niter L\n, a Skill Record Limit Break material, as a present!\nExchange for up to 1,000\nArcana Gems\n, up to 15\nMedals of Combat Arts\n, as well as other items such as\nCore Metals\nand Release Crystals at the Fall Fish Trader.\nEach fish likes different bait.\nTry different things and challenge the event.\nFall Fish Trader Period\nStarts after the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the December 10, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nRecord\nYou will also be able to receive a record via achievement rewards by finishing in the top ranking.\nRecord Acquisition\nAchievement Rewards\nFall Fishing King 2025\nRevive Crystal×1\nFall Fishing Elite 2025\nRevive Crystal×1\nFall Fishing Mania 2025\nRevive Crystal×1\nEvent Locations\nRankings will be based on fish caught on the \"Underwater Lab\" event maps, as well as the 22nd Floor's \"Serene Shore\" and \"Peaceful Forest Path\" during both day and night.\nHead to the \"Underwater Lab\" event maps by talking to the \"Underwater Lab Guide\" NPC at the Teleport Gate Plaza.\nYou can return to Teleport Gate Plaza by talking to the \"Exit Guide\".\nGo to the \"Serene Shore\" or \"Peaceful Forest Path\" on the 22F by talking to \"Nishida\" in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\".\nTalk to the \"Night Map Guide\" NPC on the \"Serene Shore\" to go to the night map.\nFishing Spot\nRecommended Fishing Lv\nUnderwater Lab\nAll level ranges\nSerene Shore (Day)\n1～10\nPeaceful Forest Path (Day)\n11～15\nSerene Shore (Night)\n16～20\nPeaceful Forest Path (Night)\n21～\nUnderwater Lab\nSome characters in this area will only appear when certain conditions are met, such as when certain main quests are completed.\nRanking Reward\nRanking\nRewards\nAmount\n#1\nRecord:Fall Fishing King 2025\n1\nRecord:Fall Fishing Elite 2025\n1\nRecord:Fall Fishing Mania 2025\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n30\nRelease Crystal (L)\n20\n#2～#20\nRecord:Fall Fishing Elite 2025\n1\nRecord:Fall Fishing Mania 2025\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n5\nRelease Crystal (L)\n3\n#21～#100\nRecord:Fall Fishing Mania 2025\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n20\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n20\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n20\nMemoria Niter L\n1\nRelease Crystal (L)\n1\n#101～#300\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n15\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n15\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n15\nMemoria Niter M\n3\n#301～#500\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n5\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n5\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n5\nMemoria Niter M\n1\n#501～#10000\nMemoria Niter S\n1\nRanking rewards will be distributed from November 13, 2025 (Thu) 14:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nReward Acceptance Period: Until November 28, 2025 (Fri) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\nItems with record names will be removed on November 28, 2025 (Fri) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
