    "snippet": "11月6日是刀劍神​​域正式上線的日子！我們決定將這個重要的日子稱為艾恩葛朗特日，我們將在《刀劍神域積分因子》中舉辦各種大型活動來慶祝！ 11月6日（週四）維護後開始的活動如下…",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNovember 6 is Aincrad Day! Enjoy all kinds of events to celebrate the day Sword Art Online officially launched!\nEVENT\n2025-11-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNovember 6 is the day Sword Art Online officially launched!\nWe have decided that this momentous date shall be known as\nAincrad Day\n, and we're holding a variety of huge events to celebrate in Sword Art Online Integral Factor!\nThe event beginning after maintenance on November 6 (Thu) will be followed by even more events kicking off in the following days, so keep an eye out for regular maintenance days throughout November!\nList of Events\nStarts after the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 28, 2025 (Fri) maintenance.\nStarts after the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 28, 2025 (Fri) maintenance.\nStarts after the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 12, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nStarts after the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 28, 2025 (Fri) maintenance.\nStarts after the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 12, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nStarts after the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 28, 2025 (Fri) maintenance.\nStarts after the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 12, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nImportant\nplease note that event periods are different for each.\nFor more details, check the announcements for each event.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
