    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Strea's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Strea!\nShop\n2025-11-06 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Strea's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Reminiscent Smile] Strea\n(Chain Skill)\" and \"\n[With Roaring Thunder] Strea\n(Connect Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nStrea's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Strea guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Strea\" is guaranteed!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Reminiscent Smile] Strea\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Dark Conversion/Contradiction\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Dark Conversion 5] Holy element's damage to enemies -15% and dark element's damage to enemies +30%./[Contradiction 3] Attack +20% when equipping no Heathcliff Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nIncrease in break gauge to enemy by +10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[With Roaring Thunder] Strea\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShadow Whirlpool\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n2070% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRaises 5 → 10 → 15 stacks for buffs that increase defense that are on yourself when hitting with skills.\n\"[With Roaring Thunder] Strea\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nNovember 6, 2025 (Thu) 0:00 - November 15, 2025 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Strea\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Strea\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nThere is no voice production when ★4 \"Strea\" Skill Records are drawn.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
