    "news_date": 1761724800,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "新增boss怪物「阿達瑪斯蛇混沌」和Lv.275暗黑裝備系列「暗黑阿達瑪斯蛇」！獲得強大的“深黑色系列”鎧甲！  地下城持續時間2025年10月29日（週三）14:00 - 2025年11月12日（週三）13:59（JST/UTC+9）新Boss怪物阿達瑪斯蛇混沌偵查...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Lv. 275 Dark Black Series \"Dark Black Adamas Snake\" is here! New boss monster added to the \"Chaos Showdown\"!\nEVENT\n2025-10-29 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe boss monster \"Adamas Snake Chaos\" and the Lv.275 Dark Black equipment series \"Dark Black Adamas Snake\" have been added!\nGet the powerful \"Dark Black Series\" armor!\nDungeon Duration\nOctober 29, 2025 (Wed) 14:00 - November 12, 2025 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nNew Boss monster\nAdamas Snake Chaos\nDetails\nSince this is a field with unusable items, some items cannot be used.\nThe beginning of battle, it uses a \"Critical resistance\" buff.\nYou can break it with 2H Axe skills.\nOnce a Break happens, the Break requirements change to 1H Club skills.\nWhen a Break can be performed with 1H Club skills, and a Break is performed, it receives a stack debuff that increases the damage it takes.\nSkill Breaks can be performed with skills that are both Blunt Element and Earth Element.\nWhen preparing the Skill Breakable attack, it gains a buff that \"Reduce Damage\".\nWhen a Skill Break happens, it will receive a stack debuff that increases the damage it takes.\nWhen its HP falls beneath a certain amount, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nSome attacks will remove buffs from the players.\nThe Awakening Gauge decreases with some attacks.\nWeakness\nBlunt Element\nEarth Element\nResistance\nSlash Element\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nCritical\nDamage\nCounter Switch Targeted Attacks\nYes\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Critical resistance\", \"Reduces Damage\" and \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Old Grudge\", \"Fatal Poison\" and \"Paralysis\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Skill Break: By completely lowering the Skill Break Gauge, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all of its buff effects will be removed.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nFor details on the effects of \"Status Ailments\", please check in-game via \"Menu\" > \"System\" > \"Help\" > \"Buff, Debuff, and Status Ailments\".\nAlternatively, please refer to the\n\"Status Ailments\"\nsection of the Play Guide.\nBoss Appearing\nDifficulty\nBoss Name\nWeakness\nObtainable Chaos Crystals\nChallenge with party\nChaos Showdown 90\nDark Black Spirit Tree\nSlash Element\n・\nFire Element\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 95\nDark Black Beast\nSlash Element\n・\nWater Element\nAmber Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 110\nDark Black Evil Spirit\nBlunt Element\n・\nEarth Element\nTopaz Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 135\nDark Black Sturdy Crab\nBlunt Element\n・\nHoly Element\n→\nThrust Element\n・\nHoly Element\n→\nBlunt Element\n・\nHoly Element\nEmerald Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 155\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast\nBlunt Element\n・\nFire Element\nSapphire Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 175\nDark Black Sticky Thing\nThrust Element\n・\nWind Element\nIndigo Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 195\nDark Black Last Number\nSlash Element\n・\nEarth Element\nAmethyst Chaos Crystal\nNO\nChaos Showdown 215\nDark Black Gleam Eyes\nThrust Element\n・\nFire Element\nQuartz Chaos Crystal\nNO\nChaos Showdown 235\nDark Black Chaos Drake\nSlash Element\n・\nFire Element\nRose Quartz Chaos Crystal\nNO\nChaos Showdown 255\nDark Black Teaser Tentacles\nThrust Element\n・\nWind Element\nSky Chaos Crystal\nNO\nChaos Showdown 275\nDark Black Adamas Snake\nBlunt Element\n・\nEarth Element\nDeep Emerald Chaos Crystal\nNO\n\"Dark Black Series\" equipment can be produced at the Workshop using Chaos Crystals and production materials dropped from the boss.\nEach \"Chaos Crystal\" can be obtained by collecting the correlating \"Crystal Shards\" and using them for production.\nDark Black Series List\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black Spirit Tree Armor\n816\n12210\nLv.90\nDark Black Spirit Tree Greaves\n670\n8547\nLv.90\nDark Black Beast Armor\n866\n12810\nLv.95\nDark Black Beast Greaves\n710\n8967\nLv.95\nDark Black Evil Spirit Armor\n917\n14010\nLv.110\nDark Black Evil Spirit Greaves\n752\n9807\nLv.110\nDark Black Sturdy Crab Armor\n1257\n20190\nLv.135\nDark Black Sturdy Crab Greaves\n1031\n14133\nLv.135\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast Armor\n1358\n21990\nLv.155\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast Greaves\n1114\n15393\nLv.155\nDark Black Sticky Thing Armor\n1460\n24400\nLv.175\nDark Black Sticky Thing Greaves\n1197\n16303\nLv.175\nDark Black Last Number Armor\n1563\n26850\nLv.195\nDark Black Last Number Greaves\n1282\n17253\nLv.195\nDark Black Gleam Eyes Armor\n1667\n29350\nLv.215\nDark Black Gleam Eyes Greaves\n1367\n18253\nLv.215\nDark Black Chaos Drake Armor\n1772\n31900\nLv.235\nDark Black Chaos Drake Greaves\n1453\n19303\nLv.235\nDark Black Teaser Tentacles Armor\n1878\n34500\nLv.255\nDark Black Teaser Tentacles Greaves\n1540\n20403\nLv.255\nDark Black Adamas Snake Armor[NEW!]\n1985\n37150\nLv.275\nDark Black Adamas Snake Greaves[NEW!]\n1628\n21553\nLv.275\nRandom Bonus\nThe value and type of the Dark Black Series bonus are random.\nExample: Equippable Lv. 275 Dark Black Series\nStatus\nUpper\nLower\nAttack\n30\n30\nDefense\n110\n50\nHP\n2500\n5500\nExample: If three types of defenses are given to Dark Black Adamas Snake Armor, defense will increase by 330 total.\n* Succession cannot be used for the Dark Black Series.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end\nAccept it from the \"Chaos Showdown\" NPC at the \"Blackiron Palace\".\nImportant\nChaos Showdown is a permanent dungeon where the boss changes approximately every two weeks. The rotation will start over again after six weeks.\nYour score reward and challenge reward information will not reset when each dungeon returns.\nCheck the game for details about the rewards of each dungeon.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
