    "name": "地下迷宮B7F已安裝！ ★盾牌「Nox Fermat」5變身已解鎖！還添加了許多新的技能釋放器！",
    "image": "https://saoif-com.akamaized.net/web/shop_login/en/img/other/20251029ul.png",
    "news_url": "https://saoif.nayu.fun/shop_information/detail/4767.html",
    "news_date": 1761724800,
    "news_category": "UPDATE",
    "snippet": "地下迷宮B7F於2025年10月29日（週三）維護後開放。  主要更新 地下迷宮 B7F、新任務和成就已新增。 Nox Integral 系列護盾「Nox Fermat」的變形已解鎖。地下有許多可用的技能釋放器...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nUnderground Labyrinth B7F installed! ★5 Transformation for the shield \"Nox Fermat\" has been unlocked! Lots of new Skill Releasers also added!\nUPDATE\n2025-10-29 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nUnderground Labyrinth B7F was released after the October 29, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nMajor Updates\nUnderground Labyrinth B7F, new quests, and achievements have been added.\nTransformation for the Nox Integral Series shield \"Nox Fermat\" has been unlocked.\nMany Skill Releasers available in Underground Labyrinth B7F have been added.\nUnderground Labyrinth B7F Floor Installed!\nCompleting Underground Labyrinth B6F's Underground Labyrinth main quest will allow you to enter Underground Labyrinth B7F.\nOnce you reach Underground Labyrinth B7F, the scenario for the Underground Labyrinth main quest will automatically begin.\nSimilar to other floors, Underground Labyrinth subquests have been added to the Underground Labyrinth B7F.\n* These can be accepted by completely clearing Underground Labyrinth B7F's Underground Labyrinth main quest.\nAdded Achievements!\nAdded an achievement that awards 500 Arcana Gems when you completely clear Underground Labyrinth B7F's Underground Labyrinth main quest.\nTransformation of the Nox Integral Series Shield \"Nox Fermat\"!\nNox Fermat can now be transformed into a ★5!\nYou can now use 2 \"Enraged Eyes Protection Stone\" and 4 \"Core Metal+++\" obtainable from the Underground Labyrinth B7F to transform the Nox Integral Series shield, Nox Fermat.\nYou can get \"Enraged Eyes Protection Stone\" in Underground Labyrinth B7F in the following ways.\n・Get an extremely rare drop from the Eckard : Rotsehen Augen boss monster when dealing damage that's over 0.1% of the Max HP\n・Drops with a low probability when you damage the Eckard : Rotsehen Augen boss monster, or produce from 200 \"Enraged Eyes Protection Stone Piece\" that you can get from treasure boxes as an rare drop.\n*The drop rate or number of each item increases with the amount of damage dealt on the boss monster.\n*Excluding reflected damage.\n\"Damp Purple Mushroom\" have a chance of dropping from monsters (excluding bosses) in Underground Labyrinth B7F.\n★5 Nox Fermat's Specs\nEquippable from Lv. 121 and up.\nItem Icon\nHP\nDefense\n5775\n430\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv.100.\nRandom Bonus\nThree types of one of the following will be randomly selected when producing Nox Fermat.\nStatus\nvalue\nHP\n2500\nHP\n2250\nHP\n2000\nDefense\n50\nDefense\n45\nDefense\n40\nAttack\n25\nAttack\n23\nAttack\n20\nExample: If you receive three types of HP 2500, the total HP will increase by 7500.\n* Succession cannot be used.\n★3 Nox Fermat can be produced with either of the following methods.\n・Spit Spider Protection Stone x2 and Sinister Skeleton Crystal x200\n・Green Flame Protection Stone x2 and Pale Grass x200\n・Enraged Eyes Protection Stone x2 and Damp Purple Mushroom x200\nNew Skill Releasers Added!\nNew Skill Releasers that can be acquired in Underground Labyrinth B7F have been added.\nItem Name\nEffect\nMax amount\nSquare Releaser\nAdds 800% power to 1H Sword Skills with \"Square\" in the name\n500\nPierce Releaser\nAdds 900% power to 1H Sword Skills with \"Pierce\" in the name\n500\nStarburst Releaser\nAdds 1100% power to 1H Sword Skills with \"Starburst\" in the name\n300\nBetting Releaser\nAdds 1100% power to 1H Sword Skills with \"Betting\" in the name\n300\nPain Releaser\nAdds 800% power to 1H Rapier Skills with \"Pain\" in the name\n500\nGap Releaser\nAdds 800% power to 1H Rapier Skills with \"Gap\" in the name\n500\nBrush Releaser\nAdds 800% power to 1H Rapier Skills with \"Brush\" in the name\n500\nDemolishing Releaser\nAdds 800% power to 1H Club Skills with \"Demolishing\" in the name\n500\nDisorder Releaser\nAdds 900% power to 1H Club Skills with \"Disorder\" in the name\n500\nBuster Releaser\nAdds 800% power to 2H Axe Skills with \"Buster\" in the name\n500\nDivide Releaser\nAdds 900% power to 2H Axe Skills with \"Divide\" in the name\n500\nCharge Releaser\nAdds 1000% power to 2H Spear Skills with \"Charge\" in the name\n500\nSweep Releaser\nAdds 900% power to 2H Spear Skills with \"Sweep\" in the name\n500\nNeedle Releaser\nAdds 1000% power to Bow Skills with \"Needle\" in the name\n500\nImpact Releaser\nAdds 800% power to Bow Skills with \"Impact\" in the name\n500\nCutter Releaser\nAdds 900% power to Dagger Skills with \"Cutter\" in the name\n500\nLoiter Releaser\nAdds 900% power to Dagger Skills with \"Loiter\" in the name\n500\n\"Skill Releaser\" Details Here.\nBoss Monster\nEckard : Rotsehen Augen\nDetails\nBreak with Dark Element.\nSkill Breaks can be performed with skills that are both Slash Element and Dark Element.\nWith each Break or Skill Break, it will be weakened by a stack debuff that increases damage dealt from players.\nWhen its HP falls beneath a certain amount, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nBy defeating monsters, many Skill Releasers will be dropped at a fixed rate.\nEnemies appearing in the \"Underground Labyrinth B7F\" all have resistances to the same weapon elements and natural elements.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nDark Element\nResistance\nThrust Element\nBlunt Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nCritical\nDamage\nStatus Ailments\nCounter Switch Targeted Attacks\nYes\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Bloodshed\" and \"Stun\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\", \"Decrease Non-Elemental Damage\" and \"Decrease Defense\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Skill Break: By completely lowering the Skill Break Gauge, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all of its buff effects will be removed.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nFor details on the effects of \"Status Ailments\", please check in-game via \"Menu\" > \"System\" > \"Help\" > \"Buff, Debuff, and Status Ailments\".\nAlternatively, please refer to the\n\"Status Ailments\"\nsection of the Play Guide.\nImportant\nThe return destination from the \"Underground Labyrinth\" is the Blackiron Palace.\nCannot be challenged with an Assist Party.\nSee here for more details on the Underground Labyrinth.\nUnderground Labyrinth B6F Installed\nUnderground Labyrinth B5F Installed\nUnderground Labyrinth B4F Installed\nUnderground Labyrinth B3F Installed\nUnderground Labyrinth B2F Installed\nUnderground Labyrinth B1F Installed\nGo to Notice List"
