    "snippet": "登入《刀劍神域積分因子》的用戶須知。  我們於2025年10月29日12:00開始進行維護，於2025年10月29日17:00(JST/UTC+9)完成。以下是新的更新。  ▼新實施的新活動「地下迷宮B7F」安裝了「混沌對決」...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(10/29)\nMAINT.\n2025-10-29 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 10/29, 2025, 12:00, was completed on 10/29, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Underground Labyrinth B7F\" Installed\n\"Chaos Showdown\" New Boss and Dark Black Armor Added\n\"Attack of the Cactus Trio! 2025\" begins\nAdded [30 Million Downloads Celebration] \"Halloween Assault 2025\" Event rewards\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nChanged the display so that weapon avatars in equipment sets that have been registered to favorites will now show the Favorite icon\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where the \"Fishing Guide\", which can be displayed while fishing, did not display the contents correctly\nFixed an issue where the \"[Happy Bond] Asuna\" and \"Thrust Releaser\" icons did not display correctly\nWe fixed an issue where the \"Join a guild\" part of the \"30 Million Downloads Celebration Panel Mission\" could not be cleared, even if you joined a guild\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Official Live Stream Rewards\nAs a reward for the correct answers to the quiz portion of the official live stream on 10/24, 2025, 400 Arcana Gems have been sent to all players.\nReceive by: Until 11/6, 2025, 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n10/29, 2025 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Underground Labyrinth B7F\" Installed\n\"Chaos Showdown\" New Boss and Dark Black Armor Added\n\"Attack of the Cactus Trio! 2025\" begins\nAdded [30 Million Downloads Celebration] \"Halloween Assault 2025\" Event rewards\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 10/29 Maintenance\nThe 9th \"Squad Jumble\"\n\"Guild Support Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
