    "full_details": "Notices\n[10/22 13:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] [30 Million Downloads Celebration] Get event-limited party goods and monster transformation items! \"IF Halloween Party Trick or Treasure!\" is on!\nEVENT\n2025-10-22 13:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[10/22 13:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nFixed an issue where players appear to behave abnormally to other players when transforming into a monster.\nExtended the IF Halloween Party Trick or Treasure! event period until maintenance on November 19, 2025 (Fri).\nChanged the removal date for the IF Halloween Party Trader and the following items to November 28, 2025 (Fri) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Miracle Candy\n- Ghost Figure\n-----------------------------\n30 Million Downloads Worldwide! Thank You Campaign\n\"IF Halloween Party Trick or Treasure!\" is on!\nDefeat the event-limited monsters Halloween Walker and Halloween Hopper in each field where they appear to collect Ghost Figures and trade them for various items!\nEat Miracle Candy, an event-only item that lets you transform into different monsters!\n* Miracle Candy can be obtained by trading with the Ghost Figure, or is dropped directly by event-only monsters.\nRewards\nGet the event-limited items Halloween Party Favor and Miracle Candy!\nYou can also get other items such as Awakening Stars, Release Crystals (M), and Martial Arts Texts.\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nMiracle Candy\nA strange candy that makes you transform.\nWhat will you turn into? Let's see!\nHalloween Party Favor A\nMysterious tube that sends bats\ndancing in the air when used.\nHalloween Party Favor B\nMysterious tube that pops out\npumpkins when used.\nMiracle Candies expire, so please use them as soon as possible.\n* They will expire on November 19, 2025 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nEffect of \"Miracle Candy\"\nAn item that lets you transform into a monster for a limited time.\nYou will transform into one of 12 different monsters at random.\n* The chances for transforming into each monster are different.\nThey are effective for 180 seconds.\nMovement, the evasion button, and some items can be used while transformed. However, other actions such as attacking cannot be performed.\nTransformation will end in the following cases:\nTransformation buff effect time ends.\nThe player moves between areas (including entering/exiting dungeons, etc.).\nCancel Transformation button is tapped (the Attack button will turn into the Cancel Transformation button while transformed).\n* Using another transformation item while transformed will transform you into the monster you drew again.\n* You can use the Awakening button while transformed.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the October 16, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 12, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the October 16, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 19, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nEvent Monsters\nHalloween Walker\nHalloween Hopper\nField with Event Monsters\nThe fields that are covered are as follows.\n* Floors are listed in main quest unlock order.\n1F\n2F\n3F\n4F\n5F\n10F\n20F\n35F\n47F\n50F\n61F\n74F\n81F\n91F\n【Chapter 2】\n63F\n79F\n26F\n*38F\n51F\n17F\n69F\n23F\n72F\n19F\n96F\n33F\n44F\n24F\n58F\n* Vampkin Walkers and Vampkin Hoppers are the special monsters for the event on 38F.\nVampkin Walkers and Vampkin Hoppers will appear in the 38F dungeon.\nHalloween Walkers and Halloween Hoppers will not appear in Labyrinths or floor dungeons.\nImportant\nGhost Figures will be deleted on November 19, 2025 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
