    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(10/22)\nMAINT.\n2025-10-21 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 10/22, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 10/22, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 9th \"Squad Jumble\" begins\n\"Aria of a Starless Night IF\" is back\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [30 Million Downloads Celebration] \"Halloween Assault 2025\"\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where the voice did not play correctly when the [A Burst of Halloween Power] Klein burst skill was activated\nFixed an issue where [Break out of the Shell] Diavel could not be equipped to the EX Ability slot\nFixed an issue where players appear to behave abnormally to other players when transforming into a monster\nExtended the IF Halloween Party Trick or Treasure! event period until maintenance on 11/19, 2025 (Wed).\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\n▼Added rewards and high difficulty\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n10/22, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 9th \"Squad Jumble\" begins\n\"Aria of a Starless Night IF\" is back\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [30 Million Downloads Celebration] \"Halloween Assault 2025\"\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 10/22 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 64\n\"Icefog Wolf Hunt\"\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
