    "snippet": "10月7日是桐人的生日！為了慶祝桐人的生日，我們舉辦桐人生日報到獎勵！  這是一項特殊的登入獎勵，每天登入 10 天內累計最多 1,000 顆阿卡納寶石，即可獲得 100 顆阿卡納寶石！  期間2025年10月7日（星期二）4:00 - 10月17日，...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Happy Birthday, Kirito!] The Kirito Birthday Login Bonus is here! Receive up to a total of 1,000 Arcana Gems!\nCampaign\n2025-10-07 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOctober 7 is Kirito's birthday!\nTo celebrate Kirito's birthday, we're holding the Kirito Birthday Login Bonus!\nThis is a special login bonus where you can get\n100 Arcana Gems each day\nby logging in for a total of\nup to 1,000 Arcana Gems\nover 10 days!\nPeriod\nOctober 7, 2025 (Tue) 4:00 - October 17, 2025 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nReward Details\nNumber of Days Logged In\nReward\nIcon\nDay1\nArcana Gems×100\nDay2\nArcana Gems×100\nDay3\nArcana Gems×100\nDay4\nArcana Gems×100\nDay5\nArcana Gems×100\nDay6\nArcana Gems×100\nDay7\nArcana Gems×100\nDay8\nArcana Gems×100\nDay9\nArcana Gems×100\nDay10\nArcana Gems×100\nImportant\nLogin Bonuses can be claimed after completing the 1F main quest.\nDaily distribution time will be from 4:00 AM to 3:59 AM of the next day. (JST/UTC+9)\nPlease note that the distribution date does not switch when the date changes.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
