    "full_details": "Notices\nThe player level cap has been raised! Now you can reach up to level 280!\nUPDATE\n2025-10-02 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nThe player level cap was raised from Lv. 270 to\nLv. 280\nas of the maintenance on October 2, 2025 (Thu).\nThe new Dark Black series equipment has also been added.\nIt can be equipped from Lv.275, so make sure you're at a high enough level!\nThe Lv.275 Dark Black series \"Dark Black Metal Reaper\" is here! New boss monster added to the \"Chaos Showdown\"!\nGo to Notice List"
