    "full_details": "Notices\nSeptember 30 is Asuna's birthday! Tons of events and Orders! You've gotta check out this announcement!\nEVENT\n2025-09-30 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSeptember 30 is Asuna's birthday!\nWe're holding various campaigns in SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor to celebrate Asuna's birthday!\nLet's all celebrate this wonderful day together!\nFor more details, check the announcements for each event and Order.\nAlso, please note that event periods are different for each.\n* There are some events and Orders that have yet to begin at the time of this announcement's posting.\nAsuna's Hairstyle Added\nAs of midnight on September 30, 2025 (Tue) (JST/UTC+9), Asuna's hairstyle has been added to player hairstyle choices!\nYou can now select Asuna's hairstyle from Makeup or when creating a new character.\n* If this hairstyle does not appear on the list, please try rebooting the app.\nThis hairstyle is only for female characters.\nAsuna Birthday Login Bonus\nTo celebrate Asuna's birthday, we're holding a login bonus where you can get 100 Arcana Gems each day by logging in for a total of up to 1,000 Arcana Gems over 10 days!\nPeriod\nSeptember 30, 2025 (Tue) 4:00 - October 10, 2025 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nRaising Assisting Character Campaign for Kirito, Asuna, and Silica\nWe're holding a campaign where you can get Kirito, Asuna and Silica chat stamps, items that increase your Friendship, and more!\nPeriod\nSeptember 26, 2025 (Fri) 4:00 - October 10, 2025 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Battle Rush\nHeated battles with birthday characters!\nCome out victorious, and get tons of items from rewards and drops to increase your weapon proficiency and acquire proficiency skills!\nPeriod\nStarts after the September 25, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the October 16, 2025 (Thu) maintenance.\nAsuna's Birthday Order\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Asuna!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nAsuna's Birthday Order is here!\nDuration\nSeptember 30, 2025 (Tue) 0:00 - October 9, 2025 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Asuna Guaranteed Free Once Daily Order\nIt's a ★4 Asuna only free Order to celebrate Asuna's birthday!\nIt's available once per day during the event period, so don't forget!\nPeriod\nSeptember 30, 2025 (Tue) 4:00 - October 9, 2025 (Thu) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Panels\nPanels featuring illustrations of Asuna have been placed in four in-game locations!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nSeptember 30, 2025 (Tue) 0:00 - October 9, 2025 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nArcana Gem Gift\nLog in on the day of Asuna's birthday to get a gift of 250 Arcana Gems!\nTime Limit\nAvailable until September 30, 2025 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
