    "snippet": "桐人、尤吉歐、小春和幸在這些新的★4技能記錄中勇敢地對抗強大的敵人！ 「勢不可擋的武力令」來了！保證在步驟 5 獲得一項新的 ★4 技能記錄！ 6%的總掉率不包括保證的★4技能記錄，新的★4技能記錄特色...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Unstoppable Force Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2025-09-18 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Eugeo, Koharu, and Sachi stand bravely against a massive foe in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nUnstoppable Force Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Firece Fighting Swordsman] Kirito\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Spring/Back Up/Frontal Attack\nAttack\n57\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Spring 3] Adds a buff (Aqua Pile) where water damage +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec when using Switch. (Invalid when equipped by partner)/[Back Up 4] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records: Attack +25%.When equipping 3 or more of Kirito's Skill Records: Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +15%.When equipping 1 or more of Agil's Skill Records: Skill's power is added +200% when used in switch.When equipping 2 or more of Agil's Skill Records: Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +15%.When equipping 1 or more of Klein's Skill Records: Max HP increase 10%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Frontal Attack 4] Aggro increase -40% when attack hits\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Power to Cleave the Forest] Eugeo\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHydro Scrap Burst\nSkill Name\nHydro Scrap\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Blunt→\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nBreak Gauge\n51\nBreak Gauge\n102\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2530% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n6200% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP x 200%./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%./[Bonus] Water element damage increases x 0.5% the number of frostbite stacks when the player is inflicted with the frostbite status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Strike of Conviction] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nHydro Ruination\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n130\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n2060% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWater damage +50% when using water skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise water damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Pierce the Wind] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nEarth Bouncer\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n76\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n2150% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec./[Slash Destruction Mark/Debuff] For slash element enemies, the next attack the enemy receives will induce 2.5x damage. (Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n\"[Power to Cleave the Forest] Eugeo\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the September 18, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the October 16, 2025 (Thu) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
