    "snippet": "《刀劍神域 Integral Factor》全球上線 7.5 週年！ 「強化訓練活動VS桐人」開始囉！  每天和桐人一起通關強化訓練，獲得大量技能紀錄！週年紀念活動還可以獲得大量技能紀錄！這還不是全部！電子...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] The \"Intensive Training Event VS Kirito\" is here! This is your chance to get tons of long-running commemorative Skill Records! And earn lots of Medals of Combat Arts in Serious Matches!\nEVENT\n2025-08-27 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary!\nThe \"\nIntensive Training Event VS Kirito\n\" is on now!\nClear the intensive training with Kirito every day and get a lot of Skill Records!\nYou can also get lots of Skill Records in the yearly anniversary event!\nAnd that's not all! The extremely difficult\nSerious Match\n, where you can fight a dual-wielding Kirito, is on now! The recommended Total Power is 250,000!\nTake him on if you think you're up to the challenge!\nThis event is a Raising Dungeon.\nRewards\nA huge lineup of Skill Records from the 2nd through 7th anniversaries!\nAdditionally, Skill Records that were rewards in past events or as quest rewards are now obtainable!\nYou can also get up to 25 Medals of Combat Arts in the extremely difficult Serious Match!\nAvailable Skill Records (Partial)\nIllustration\nSkill Record Name\nSkill Types\n★4[Leader Through Peril] Griselda\nAppearing in the 7-Year Anniversary\nChain Skill\n★4[Swinging Blade] Kirito\nAppearing in the 6-Year Anniversary\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Dark Elf Leader] Kizmel\nAppearing in the 5-Year Anniversary\nAccele Skill\n★3[Unshakable Conviction] Heathcliff\nAppearing in the 4-Year Anniversary\nConnect Skill\n★4[Man of the Day] Kirito\nAppearing in the 3-Year Anniversary\nMOD Skill\n★3[Peaceful Smile] Yui\nAppearing in the 2-Year Anniversary\nAwakening Skill\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Mr. Kirito\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the August 27, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the October 2, 2025 (Thu) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nScore Rewards\nRegular Dungeon\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n100\n★4[Leader Through Peril] Griselda\n1\n200\n★4[Swinging Blade] Kirito\n1\n300\n★4[Dark Elf Leader] Kizmel\n1\n400\n★3[Unshakable Conviction] Heathcliff\n1\n500\n★4[Man of the Day] Kirito\n1\n600\n★3[Peaceful Smile] Yui\n1\n700\n★3[Dashing Sword-Point] Yuuki\n1\n800\n★1[Cool Strike] Kirito\n1\n900\n★3[Fishing Master] Nishida\n1\n1000\n★1[Tough Girl] Leafa\n1\n1100\n★3[Sleeping In] Alice\n1\n1200\n★1[Charismatic] Diavel\n1\n1300\n★3[Brave Fight] Kirito\n1\n1400\n★1[Craftsman's Pride] Lisbeth\n1\n1500\n★3[Girl on the Run] Yuuki\n1\n1600\n★1[Spear Girl] Sachi\n1\n1800\n★3[Scarlet Loyalty] Asuna\n1\n2000\n★1[Passionate Smith] Agil\n1\n2200\n★1[Pure and Naive] Koharu\n1\n2400\n★4[Chef in Love] Asuna\n1\n2600\n★3[Silent Archer] Sinon\n1\n2800\n★4[Sweet Affection] Yuuki\n1\n3000\n★4[Swordsman's Pride] Kirito\n1\n3200\n★4[Straight-forward Will] Eugeo\n1\n3400\n★4[Azure Swordsman's Memory] Eugeo\n1\n3600\n★4[Black Swordsman's Memory] Kirito\n1\n3800\n★3[Madder Red] Sanya\n1\n4000\n★4[Unexpected Potential] Stilla\n1\n4200\nRecord Kit S\n80\n4400\nRed Jewel\n40\n4600\nGreen Jewel\n40\n4800\nYellow Jewel\n40\n5000\nBlue Jewel\n80\n5200\nRecord Kit M\n40\n5400\nHigh Red Jewel\n20\n5600\nHigh Green Jewel\n20\n5800\nHigh Yellow Jewel\n20\n6000\nHigh Blue Jewel\n40\nSerious Match\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n1800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n2000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n2200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n2400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n2600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n2800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n3\n3000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n3\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nThe dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\nKoharu will not join for Serious Matches.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
