    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"★4 Sinon Guaranteed Free Once Daily Order\" is here! A free Order consisting only of ★4 Sinon!\nShop\n2025-08-21 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCelebrating Sinon's birthday!\nThe \"★4 Sinon Guaranteed Free Once Daily Order\" is here, where you're guaranteed a ★4 Sinon Skill Record!\nIt's a special Order where you can enjoy Sinon and all her different expressions!\n- Period\nAugust 21, 2025 (Thu) 4:00 - August 30, 2025 (Sat) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Ice Sniper] Sinon\nSkill Name\nIcy Blade/Marksmanship/Encircle Break/Pierce\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Icy Blade 4] Deals +20% Water element's damage to enemy./[Marksmanship 3] When equipping 2 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%./[Encircle Break 3] Increase in break gauge to enemy by +27.5%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Pierce 4] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Rainbow Omen] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nWind Impact\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n31\nSkill Effect\n1640% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRaises 3 → 6 → 9 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself when hitting with skills.\nRaises 1 → 2 → 3 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself when hitting with skills and equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set.\n★4[Sweet Temptation] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nHeart Shot\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n22\nSkill Effect\n1600% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using fire skills\nWhen equipping 2 or more of  Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, fire element damage +50% → 100% → 150%.\n★4[Unleashed Arrow] Sinon\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nAqua Meteoroid Burst\nSkill Name\nAqua Meteoroid\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Thrust→\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n28\nBreak Gauge\n56\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1660% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 1/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +15% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4570% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Bonus] The lower your own HP, attack increases.(max 200%)/[Bonus] Water element damage increases by number of frostbite stacks x 0.5% when the player is inflicted with the frostbite status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Handle With Caution] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nEarth Volt\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n94\nBreak Gauge\n47\nSkill Effect\n2140% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Poison/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Poison (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Risk Taker 4/Buff] The lower your own HP, attack increases for 20 sec. (Stack 9)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
