    "snippet": "Yuuki、Leafa、Sanya 和Koharu 穿著浴衣在夏日祭攤上微笑，創下新的★4 技能記錄！ 「微笑夏夜祭令」來了！保證在步驟 5 獲得一項新的 ★4 技能記錄！ 6%的總掉率不包含保證的★4技能記錄，以及新增的★4技能…",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Smiling Summer Night Festival Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2025-08-08 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki, Leafa, Sanya, and Koharu wear yukata as they grin at the summer festival stalls as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nSmiling Summer Night Festival Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[A Summer Together] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWhistle Shower\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n105\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n1970% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Bleed/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Bleed (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Bonus] Raises 3 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Festival Night] Leafa\nSkill Name\nVital Assention/Light Magic/Purifying Flame\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Vital Assention 3] Defense +400./[Light Magic 4] DEF increase with own level ×0.17%. (max 34%)/[Purifying Flame 4] Deals +20% Fire element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Fireworks of Joy] Sanya\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nIgnition Square\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nFire damage +50% when using fire skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise fire damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Twilight Smile] Koharu\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nIgnition Fang Burst\nSkill Name\nIgnition Fang\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Slash→\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n54\nSwitch Gauge\n54\nBreak Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n88\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2060% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Burn/Status Ailments] Make it burn (Stack 1) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5700% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Increases attack against enemies with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite). +1% for every Stack 1./[Bonus] Fire element damage increases x 0.5% the number of burn stacks when the player is inflicted with the burn status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Fireworks of Joy] Sanya\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAugust 8, 2025 (Fri) 17:00 - Before the September 3, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
