    "full_details": "Notices\nJuly 25 is Kibaou's birthday! To celebrate, Kibaou's hairstyle has been added to player hairstyle choices! Lots of other campaigns are being held too!\nEVENT\n2025-07-25 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nJuly 25 is Kibaou's birthday!\nWe're holding various campaigns in SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor to celebrate Kibaou's birthday!\nLet's all celebrate this wonderful day together!\nKibaou's Hairstyle Added\nAs of midnight on July 25, 2025 (Fri) (JST/UTC+9), Kibaou's hairstyle has been added to player hairstyle choices!\nYou can now select Kibaou's hairstyle from Makeup or when creating a new character.\n* If this hairstyle does not appear on the list, please try rebooting the app.\nThis hairstyle is only for male characters.\nOpening of the Kibaou Memorial Park\nThe Kibaou memorial park will be opened for a limited time only to celebrate his birthday.\nVisit the park with your friends and feast your eyes on the majestic statue of Kibaou in the center.\nAccess here:\nPeriod\nJuly 25, 2025 (Fri) 0:00 - August 3, 2025 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Panels\nA panel of Kibaou has been installed in one spot of Lord Kibaou Memorial Park.\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nJuly 25, 2025 (Fri) 0:00 - August 3, 2025 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nStamp Gift\nGet a Kibaou stamp for logging in!\nDon't forget to collect yours!\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nItems for Acquisition\nHandsome Kibaou\nMemory Stamp 340\nTime Limit\nAvailable until August 3, 2025 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
