    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(7/16)\nMAINT.\n2025-07-15 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 7/16, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 7/16, 2025, 17:30(JST/UTC+9).\nWe will be sending out token of apology for the maintenance.\n50 Arcana Gems\nAvailable until:7/24/2025(Thu) at 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 61 begins\n\"Fenrir Attack! 2025\" begins\nAdded \"Wandering Elven Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n\"Sand Blade Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nChanged the icon design of the skill releaser \"Whirl Releaser\".\nAs a temporary measure, the Trader and time-limited items from the 7th Squad Jumble have been changed to have an unlimited duration until the event resumes.\n*A new expiration date will be set when the event resumes.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n7/16, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 61 begins\n\"Fenrir Attack! 2025\" begins\nAdded \"Wandering Elven Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\nNew Order begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 7/16 Maintenance\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
