    "full_details": "Notices\nAbout modifications to some skill names\nNOTICES\n2025-06-25 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nDuring June 25, 2025 (Wed) maintenance, the names of some skills were modified.\nModified content\nWith the addition of new Skill Releasers, we have adjusted certain skill names that differed from what was originally intended.\nNo changes have been made to the effects of modified skills.\nRelevant Skill Records\nSkill name before modification\nSkill name after modification\n[A Thousand Years With You] Asuna\nCycron\nCyclone\n[Blossoming Lancer] Yuuki\nMoon Assult\nMoon Assault\n[Harvest of Nature's Mountain] Silica\nSpinning Earth Dive\nEarth Spinning Dive\n[Instant Battle] Silica\nSpinning Air Dive\nAir Spinning Dive\nWe will continue to  make modifications while considering the circumstances of our customers.\nWe hope you continue to enjoy \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nGo to Notice List"
