    "snippet": "[5/14 13:00 (JST/UTC+9)更新] 成就獎勵已發放。  -------------------------------------- [5/9 19:10 (JST/UTC+9) 更新] 總勝利數為 675,936，達成所有目標！  感謝大家的參與！成就獎勵將按照以下方式分配...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[5/14 13:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] Achievement rewards have been distributed! [Unital King Joint Event] Receive fantastic rewards based on the total number of event boss victories! The Unital King Joint Event is here!\nEVENT\n2025-05-14 13:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[5/14 13:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nAchievement rewards have been distributed.\n-----------------------------\n[5/9 19:10 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nThe total victory count was 675,936, meeting all goals!\nThank you all for your participation!\nAchievement rewards will be distributed according to the following schedule.\nReward Distribution Period\nStarts after the May 14, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 11, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nRewards\nVictory Count\nRewards\nIcon\n[Achieved!]\n100,000\nUnital King Joint Event\nKey visual SD stamp\nKoharu\n[Achieved!]\n200,000\nUnital King Joint Event\nKey visual SD stamp\nLayla\n[Achieved!]\n300,000\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n[Achieved!]\n400,000\nUnital King Joint Event\nKey visual SD stamp\nLayla dressed as Koharu and Koharu dressed as Layla\n-----------------------------\n[5/2 18:10 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nAs players have managed to reach the impressive 300,000 victory count, an even higher goal and additional rewards have been added!\nPlease continue to enjoy the event as you aim for these rewards!\nVictory Count\nRewards\nIcon\n[Achieved!]\n100,000\nUnital King Joint Event\nKey visual SD stamp\nKoharu\n[Achieved!]\n200,000\nUnital King Joint Event\nKey visual SD stamp\nLayla\n[Achieved!]\n300,000\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n[NEW!] 450,000\nUnital King Joint Event\nKey visual SD stamp\nLayla dressed as Koharu and Koharu dressed as Layla\n-----------------------------\nCelebrating the Unital King Joint Event!\nWe're holding an\nSAOIF x SAOVS joint event\nto celebrate the release of author Reki Kawahara's new short story, \"Unital King\"!\nPlayers will defeat specific monsters in both games and receive fantastic rewards based on the total number of victories!\nGive the event a try and aim to get all of the rewards, including 2,500 Arcana Gems and special chat stamps!\nIn SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor, the target monster is the\nIncredible Giant\nthat appears in the\nUnital King Incredible Foreigner\ndungeon.\n* Multiple victories by a single player will count toward the total number of victories.\n* All players worldwide will contribute to the total number of victories.\nRewards\nVictory Count\nRewards\nIcon\n100,000\nUnital King Joint Event\nKey visual SD stamp\nKoharu\n200,000\nUnital King Joint Event\nKey visual SD stamp\nLayla\n300,000\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nEvent Period\nAfter the April 23, 2025 (Wed) maintenance - May 8, 2025 (Thu) 13:00 (JST/UTC+9)\nAn interim report on the victory count is scheduled.\nPlease check out the SAOIF official X (formerly Twitter) account at @saoif_gameinfo!\nAnnouncement of Final Results\nScheduled for May 9, 2025 (Fri)\nReward Distribution Period\nStarts after the May 14, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 11, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nSee here for details on the event where the target monster appears.\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2025-04-22T19:00:00+00:00",
