    "full_details": "Notices\n[5/1 8:00 (JST/UTC+9) Edit]The \"Miracle Shot Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2025-05-01 08:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nWe have fixed an issue where \"Miracle Shot Order\" was not displaying properly in the shop as of 5/1 7:49 (JST/GMT+9).\nEugeo, Lisbeth, Alice, and Koharu are dazzlingly dressed as they head to the billiards tables in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nMiracle Shot Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Pocket Guide] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHoly Ravage\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n27\nSkill Effect\n1790% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[The Winning Shot] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Shine Conversion/More Deban\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Shine Conversion 5] Dark element's damage to enemies -15% and holy element's damage to enemies +30%./[More Deban 4] When equipping 1 or more of Silica's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Match Invitation] Alice\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nPrism Bump Burst\nSkill Name\nPrism Bump\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→Slash→\nHoly\n→(\nFire\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nBreak Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n114\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2020% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Holy Element Enhance4/Buff] Holy element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5600% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +100%./[Bonus] Holy element damage increases x 0.5% the number of Debility stacks when the player is inflicted with the Debility status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[The Table Illusionist] Koharu\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nWide Aqua Fencer Burst\nSkill Name\nWide Aqua Fencer\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Thrust→\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n28\nBreak Gauge\n56\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2170% damage (4x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Water Element Weak 4/Debuff] Water element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec./[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n6000% damage (4x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Splashing Water Demon 5/Buff] Water element damage +65% for 8 sec./[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with debuff status./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Sachi's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nMay 1, 2025 (Thu) 0:00 - May 31, 2025 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
