    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Eugeo's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Eugeo!\nShop\n2025-04-10 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Eugeo's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Flame Breaker Blade] Eugeo\n(Accele Skill)\" and \"\n[Relentless Effort] Eugeo\n(Full Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nEugeo's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Eugeo guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Eugeo\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Flame Breaker Blade] Eugeo\nSkill Name\nEarth Suction/Enhance Antidote/Everyone Is Different/Ground Pulse\nAttack\n62\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Earth Suction 4] When the player is Status Ailments (Poison), Attack +50%./●[Enhance Antidote 3] Poison damage -30%./[Everyone Is Different 3] Adds Fatal Poison effect on yourself for 30 sec when you hit using Switch (Stack 50). 2.2% + (number of stacks x 0.2%) damage\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Ground Pulse 4] Deals +15% Earth element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Relentless Effort] Eugeo\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nResonate Nature Burst\nSkill Name\nResonate Nature\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nSlash\nElement\nSlash\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→Slash→Slash→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n18.0\nSkill Cool Time\n36.0\nSwitch Gauge\n87\nSwitch Gauge\n87\nBreak Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n90\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2290% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5510% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping 2 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Relentless Effort] Eugeo\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nApril 10, 2025 (Thu) 0:00 - April 19, 2025 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Eugeo\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Eugeo\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
