    "snippet": "4月9日是愛麗絲的生日，4月10日是優吉歐的生日！我們在《SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor》中舉辦了各種活動來慶祝他們的生日！讓我們一起慶祝這美好的一天吧！  如欲了解更多詳情，請查看各活動及訂單的公告。另外，請...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nApril 9 is Alice's birthday, and April 10 is Eugeo's birthday! Tons of events and Orders! You've gotta check out this announcement!\nEVENT\n2025-04-09 13:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nApril 9 is Alice's birthday, and April 10 is Eugeo's birthday!\nWe're holding various campaigns in SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor to celebrate both of their birthdays!\nLet's all celebrate this wonderful day together!\nFor more details, check the announcements for each event and Order.\nAlso, please note that event periods are different for each.\n* There are some events and Orders that have yet to begin at the time of this announcement's posting.\nAlice and Eugeo's Hairstyles Added\nAs of midnight on April 9, 2025 (Wed) (JST/UTC+9), Alice's hairstyle has been added to player hairstyle choices!\nAlso, Eugeo's hairstyle will be added at midnight on April 10, 2025 (Thu) (JST/UTC+9)!\nYou can now select Alice or Eugeo's hairstyle from Makeup or when creating a new character.\n* If this hairstyle does not appear on the list, please try rebooting the app.\nThis hairstyle is only for female characters.\nThis hairstyle is only for male characters.\nRaising Assisting Character Campaign for Alice and Eugeo\nWe're holding a campaign where you can get Alice and Eugeo chat stamps, items that increase your Friendship, and more!\nPeriod\nApril 4, 2025 (Fri) 4:00 - April 11, 2025 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Battle Rush: Otherworldy Bonds\nSerious battles with Alice and Eugeo?!\nAlice's armor avatar, the Golden Yellow Knight Armor, is available as a reward!\nIf you don't have it yet, don't miss the comeback!\nPeriod\nStarts after the April 2, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 8, 2025 (Thu) maintenance.\nAlice's Birthday Order\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Alice!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nAlice's Birthday Order is here!\nDuration\nApril 9, 2025 (Wed) 0:00 - April 18, 2025 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Alice or Eugeo Guaranteed Free Once Daily Order\nA free Order that guarantees a ★4 Alice or Eugeo is here to celebrate Alice and Eugeo's birthdays!\nIt's available once per day during the event period, so don't forget!\nPeriod\nApril 9, 2025 (Wed) 4:00 - April 16, 2025 (Wed) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nEugeo's Birthday Order\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Eugeo!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nEugeo's Birthday Order is here!\nDuration\nApril 10, 2025 (Thu) 0:00 - April 19, 2025 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Panels\nPanels featuring illustrations of Alice and Eugeo have been placed in four in-game locations for each character!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nAlice: April 9, 2025 (Wed) 0:00 - April 18, 2025 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nEugeo: April 10, 2025 (Thu) 0:00 - April 19, 2025 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nArcana Gem Gift\nLog in on each of their birthdays to get a gift of 250 Arcana Gems!\nTime Limit\nAlice: April 9, 2025 (Wed) 0:00 - April 9, 2025 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nEugeo: April 10, 2025 (Thu) 0:00 - April 10, 2025 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
