    "full_details": "Notices\n[4/4 10:45 (JST/UTC+9) Edit] Notice for maintenance(4/2)\nMAINT.\n2025-04-04 10:45:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[4/4 10:45 (JST/UTC+9) Edit]\nAs a part of the 4/2 app update, we implemented updates related to map and model textures, which may cause map data and other files to re-download.\n*Once the data is downloaded after starting up the latest app version, they will not be downloaded again.\nWe deeply apologize for this inconvenience.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 4/2, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 4/2, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Jumping Kibaou\" is back\n\"Advanced Notice Full of Dreams\" is back\n\"Kiritoland is Open!\" is back\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nYou will now return directly to the starting NPC when escaping from any of the Chaos Boss Dungeon Depths\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Official Live Stream Rewards\nAs a reward for the correct answers to the quiz portion of the official live stream on 3/28, 2025, 500 Arcana Gems have been sent to all players.\nReceive by: Until 4/9, 2025 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n4/2, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Jumping Kibaou\" is back\n\"Advanced Notice Full of Dreams\" is back\n\"Kiritoland is Open!\" is back\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 4/2 Maintenance\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Brilliant Order\"\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt 2025\"\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Kibaou and the Secret Deal\"\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\"\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Armament Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
