    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Philia's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Philia!\nShop\n2025-03-31 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Philia's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Epic Getaway] Philia\n(Full Burst Skill)\" and \"\n[Jackpot Fever] Philia\n(Chain Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nPhilia's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Philia guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Philia\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Epic Getaway] Philia\nSkill Name\nSuper Enhance Heal/Battle with Ease/Dagger Support\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n44\nHP\n2875\nSkill Effect\n[Super Enhance Heal] Effect of healing items and field objects +100%./[Battle with Ease 4] Attack +25% while the buff that gradually recovers HP depending on the Skill Record is in effect./[Dagger Support 2] Switch gauge amount +15%, when using daggers.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Jackpot Fever] Philia\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nHoly Spinning Dive\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n110\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n2470% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nHoly damage +50% when using Holy skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Holy damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Jackpot Fever] Philia\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nMarch 31, 2025 (Mon) 0:00 - April 9, 2025 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Philia\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Philia\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nThere is no voice production when ★4 \"Philia\" Skill Records are drawn.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
