    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(3/19)\nMAINT.\n2025-03-18 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 3/19, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 3/19, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 5th \"Squad Jumble\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt 2025\"\nAdded [Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"White Day Assault 2025\" Event rewards\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] The \"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n\"Youth in Panorama Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nMade modifications so that the production of rings, avatars, and various items will now be included in the \"Watch List\"\nMade modifications so that item descriptions of production materials will now include where to obtain them\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where players could not be revived if they were defeated while a Connect Skill was activated\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n3/19, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 5th \"Squad Jumble\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt 2025\"\nAdded [Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"White Day Assault 2025\" Event rewards\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] The \"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 3/19 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 57\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 4x Experience Subquest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
