    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Accele Step-Up Order\" is here! One ★4 Accele Skill is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-03-12 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"Accele Skills\"!\nThe \"\nAccele Step-Up Order\n\" is here!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nAdditionally, on Step 3, one\n★4 Accele Skill is guaranteed!\nMore Accele Skill Details Here\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Whirlwind of Blades] Mito\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHydro Swatter\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n82\nBreak Gauge\n38\nSkill Effect\n2320% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Small]/[Anticlimax 4/Buff] The greater your remaining HP ratio, attack increases (Stack 3) for 20 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Frostbite (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Anticlimax 4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, the greater your remaining HP ratio, attack increases (Stack 9) for 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Two Whirlwinds] Silica\nSkill Name\nEnhance HP/Flame Boost/Tailwind/Bisect\nAttack\n44\nDefense\n52\nHP\n2875\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance HP 3] Max HP +10%./[Flame Boost 4] Elemental damage other than fire dealt to enemies -50%, and fire element's damage to enemies +40%./[Tailwind 6] Switch gauge amount +15%, when equipping no Yui Skill Records in the same set.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Bisect 4] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Handle With Caution] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nEarth Volt\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n94\nBreak Gauge\n47\nSkill Effect\n2140% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Poison/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Poison (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Risk Taker 4/Buff] The lower your own HP, attack increases for 20 sec. (Stack 9)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Duration\nStarts after the March 12, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends on March 21, 2025 (Fri) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Accele Skill!\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Accele Skill!\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Accele Skill!\nOne ★4 Accele Skill guaranteed!!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nCertain characters do not have voice effects when obtaining their Skill Records.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
