    "full_details": "Notices\n[3/7 15:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]【Raising Dungeon】\"Happy Dungeon with Agil\" is here! Get the Agil stamp and Arcana Gems!\nEVENT\n2025-03-07 15:00:01\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[3/7 15:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nThe event period will be extended.\nEvent Period\nMarch 7, 2025 (Fri) 4:00 - March 14, 2025 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nMarch 7, 2025 (Fri) 4:00 - March 15, 2025 (Sat) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n*You will no longer receive rewards for clearing the dungeon after you obtain all total score rewards.\n-----------------------------\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\n\"Happy Dungeon with Agil\" is here! Get the Agil stamp and Arcana Gems in celebration of this character's birthday!\nRewards\n\"Arcana Gems\"\nand a\nlimited-edition \"Agil\" stamp\nare available as rewards.\nClear the dungeon every day during the event to\nget up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\".\nPeriod\nMarch 7, 2025 (Fri) 4:00 - March 14, 2025 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nMarch 7, 2025 (Fri) 4:00 - March 15, 2025 (Sat) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nShining Shopkeeper\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nArcana Gem\n50\n200\nArcana Gem\n50\n300\nArcana Gem\n50\n400\nArcana Gem\n100\n500\nArcana Gem\n50\n600\nArcana Gem\n50\n700\nArcana Gem\n50\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nMemory Stamp 317\nUse to obtain the \"Shining Shopkeeper\" stamp.\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nArcana Gem\n50\nCompleted within 1 minutes\nArcana Gem\n50\nImportant\nCleared dungeons will be reset the following day at 4:00am (JST/UTC+9) and can be re-attempted after that.\nThis is a solo event that you can challenge with Agil as your partner.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
