    "snippet": "《刀劍神域 Integral Factor》全球發售 7 週年！牙王與秘密交易來了！  秘密獎章可以在其他正在進行的活動中獲得。收集起來帶到牙王，最多可以兌換30枚解脫水晶（大）、250枚解脫水晶（小）、以及100本武學典籍！  使用該...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] Get Secret Medals and exchange them for Release Crystals and Martial Arts Texts! Kibaou and the Secret Deal is here!\nEVENT\n2025-03-05 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary!\nKibaou and the Secret Deal is here!\nSecret Medals\ncan be acquired in other ongoing events.\nGather them and bring them to Kibaou to exchange for up to 30 Release Crystal (L), 250 Release Crystal (S), and 100 Martial Arts Texts!\nUse the Martial Arts Texts you get to earn proficiency skill experience and raise your proficiency level, and use Release Crystals to learn weapon proficiency skills!\nWeapon proficiency level isn't just needed in order to learn weapon proficiency skills, it also increases player attack.\nWeapon proficiency skills have a wide variety of uses, from unique effects for each weapon type to general-purpose effects.\n* Check weapon proficiency levels and skills by going to Menu > Status > Weapon Proficiency.\nCurrent Event Where Secret Medals Can Be Acquired\n・\n\"White Day Assault 2025\"\n* We plan to add other applicable events in the future.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to Kibaou at the Teleport Gate Plaza to use the Secret Medal Trader.\nOr go to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the \"Secret Medal Trader\" banner.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the March 5, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 2, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the March 5, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 9, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nSecret Medal\nSecret Medal Trader\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nRelease Crystal (L)\n1\n30\nRelease Crystal (M)\n1\n50\nRelease Crystal (S)×5\n1\n50\nMartial Arts Text\n1\n100\n10,000Col\n1\n40\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nSecret Medals will be deleted on April 9, 2025 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
