    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Flower Fest\" Koharu Birthday Festival is here! Exchange items dropped by event monsters for stamps and awakening materials!\nEVENT\n2025-02-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKoharu Birthday Festival!\nThe \"Flower Fest\" is on now!\nDefeat the event-limited monsters Flower Nepenthes in each field where they appear to collect Flower Bracelets and trade them for various items!\nRewards\nYou can get a stunning 8 Koharu stamps celebrating her birthday!\nYou can even get fireworks, so be sure to use them to celebrate Koharu!\nYou can also get other items such as Memoria Niter S, and Awakening Stars.\nStamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nKoharu Stamp 11\nKoharu Stamp 12\nKoharu Stamp 13\nKoharu Stamp 14\nKoharu Stamp 15\nKoharu Stamp 16\nKoharu Stamp 17\nKoharu Stamp 18\nFlower Fest Trader\nGo to the Koharu character panel placed in Teleport Gate Plaza to exchange your Flower Bracelets for rewards.\nHowever, for more info, go to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the Flower Fest Trader banner.\nTrader\nTrader Period\nFebruary 23, 2025 (Sun) 0:00 - Before the March 19, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nEvent Period\nFebruary 23, 2025 (Sun) 0:00 - Before the March 12, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nEvent Monsters\nFlower Nepenthes\nField with Event Monsters\nThe fields that are\ncovered\nare as follows.\n* Floors are listed in main quest unlock order.\n1F\n2F\n3F\n4F\n5F\n10F\n20F\n35F\n47F\n50F\n61F\n74F\n81F\n91F\n63F\n79F\n26F\nFlower Nepenthes will not appear in Labyrinths or floor dungeons.\nImportant\nFlower Bracelets will be deleted on March 19, 2025 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
