    "full_details": "Notices\n250 Arcana Gems! An Koharu Birthday Present Campaign!\nCampaign\n2025-02-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nToday (2/23) is Koharu's birthday!\nIn celebration of Koharu's birthday, we have sent 《250 Arcana Gems》 and a 《Memory Stamp》 to your present box.\nLet's all celebrate Koharu's birthday together!\n▼Receive by date (Arcana Gems)\n2/23 until 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n▼Receive by date (Memory Stamp)\n3/12 until 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n▼Notes\n・Please note that the schedule and the content of the present are subject to change without notice.\nGo to Notice List"
