    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(2/19)\nMAINT.\n2025-02-18 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 2/19, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 2/19, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Chocolate Meiolania Hunt 2025\"\n\"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nChanged the clear time displayed on the the results screen after completing a dungeon to appear in larger text\nAdded limited time only emote\nCheer\n* limited emotions are scheduled to be removed during maintenance on 3/12/2025 (Wed).\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Upcoming Update\nAs of the next scheduled maintenance on 2/27, 2025, the guild room will no longer be themed for winter.\nIf you haven't visited yet, please go see the autumn theme while you still can and enjoy taking pictures with your guild members.\n▼New Events\n▼Added rewards and high difficulty\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n2/19, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Chocolate Meiolania Hunt 2025\"\n\"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 2/19 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 56\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
