    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Nobles at Play Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2025-01-08 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Asuna, Sinon, and Sachi enjoy kemari, a traditional Japanese ball game played by ancient nobles, as they appear in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nNobles at Play Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Graceful Pass] Kirito\nSkill Name\nBleed Counter/Wind Indemnity/Retribution\nAttack\n57\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Bleed Counter 4] When the player is Status Ailments (Bleed), Attack +1500./[Wind Indemnity 3] When the player is Status Ailments (Bleed), Wind element damage +40%./[Retribution 1] Adds Bloodshed effect on yourself for 30 sec when you hit using Switch (Stack 30). 2.2%＋(number of stacks x 0.2%) damage and 4.4%＋(number of stacks x 0.4%) evasion rate decrease.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nReduce Ailments\n[When Rush Activates] Reduces status ailment stacks by -10 on yourself (Will not be below 1).\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Looking for Players] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWind Gap\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n27\nBreak Gauge\n21\nSkill Effect\n1610% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces all skill's cool times by 3 → 6 → 9 sec when hitting with skills.\nReduces all skill's cool times by 2 → 4 → 6 sec when hitting with wind skills.\n★4[Fantastic Footwork] Sinon\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nAir Meteoroid Burst\nSkill Name\nAir Meteoroid\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→\nWind\n→Thrust→(\nHoly\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n28\nBreak Gauge\n56\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1550% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 1/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +15% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4260% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Bonus] The lower your own HP, attack increases.(max 200%)/[Bonus] Wind element damage increases x 0.5% the number of bleed stacks when the player is inflicted with the bleed status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[After a Refined Game] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nGust Brandish\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n120\nBreak Gauge\n61\nSkill Effect\n2660% damage (4x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 when using wind skills while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[After a Refined Game] Sachi\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the January 8, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the February 5, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
