    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Thoughts on a Holy Night\" is back! Get your hands on an event-limited ★3 Klein Skill Record, and Memory Stamps!\nEVENT\n2024-12-05 20:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"Thoughts on a Holy Night\" is back!\nYou and Koharu want to give Christmas presents to everyone to show them how much you appreciate all they do.\nAfter getting information about gifts from Argo, the two of you take on a quest that drops the items needed to create those presents.\nRewards\nGet your hands on an event-limited ★3 Klein Skill Record, and Memory Stamps!\nExchange the Xmas Stocking and Twin Xmas Bells you obtain from the event at the exclusive Trader to get items.\nGet up to 1,000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, and up to 25\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\nfrom the entire event.\nOn certain difficulties, there's a chance that the boss monster \"Lively Holy Treant\" will drop Star Fragments.\nFor this returning event, acquisition status of Total Score Rewards, Challenge Rewards and Trader Rewards from last time will be reset, allowing players to acquire these rewards once more.\nSkill Record\n★3[Bold Stance] Klein\nSkill Name\nEnhance Stun Res./Enhance Debility Res.\nAttack\n35\nDefense\n18\nHP\n2000\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Stun Res. 3] Stun resistance +29%./●[Enhance Debility Res. 2] Debility resistance +19%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nYui\nI'm back\nHehe :P\nExactly!\nSee you!\nUnderstood\nEvent-limited recovery item\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nBuche de Noel\nHeavenly sweetness...♪\nRecovers 1200 HP of players within a 50m radius.\nTrade \"Xmas Stocking\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\n★3[Bold Stance] Klein\n400\n1\nMemory Stamp 219\nUse to obtain the \"Yui\" stamp.\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 220\nUse to obtain the \"I'm back\" stamp.\n100\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n300\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nMemoria Niter S\n500\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nTrade \"Twin Xmas Bells\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\n★3[Bold Stance] Klein\n400\n1\nMemory Stamp 98\nUse to obtain the \"Hehe :P\" stamp.\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 166\nUse to obtain the \"Exactly!\"stamp.\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 3\nUse to obtain the \"See you!\" stamp.\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 2\nUse to obtain the \"Understood\" stamp.\n100\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n300\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nMemoria Niter S\n500\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nTrader Period\nStarts after the December 5, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the January 15, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Starting Point\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\" and \"Gaining Ground\", difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nThe score earned in \"Extreme\" difficulty is not added to the \"Total Score Reward\", but you will receive rewards based on your score.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score\nStarting Point\nBasic Clear Bonus:74P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n80\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:170P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n200\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:420P＋Survival Bonus:10P per surviving player\n480\nGaining Ground\nBasic Clear Bonus:1680P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n1800\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus:1000P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n1120\n\"\nGaining Ground\n\"\nYou can get a high score in the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" difficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" one time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nHigh difficulty \"\nExtreme\n\"\nThe high-difficulty dungeon \"\nExtreme\n\", has a recommended Total Power of 120,000. The boss has weaknesses that are different from those on other difficulty levels.\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join Gaining Ground and Extreme difficulty Quick Parties.\nGaining Ground: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nExtreme: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×600\n★3[Bold Stance] Klein×9\nMedal of Combat Arts×11\nMemoria Niter S×70\nAwakening Star×35\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nSpecial items that can be received from \"Extreme\" Score Rewards\nMedal of Combat Arts×8\nMemoria Niter S×20\nAwakening Star×15\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nA Little Miracle\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Xmas Stockings in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nA Holy Night\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Xmas Stockings in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHappy Days\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Twin Xmas Bells in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Xmas event 2022\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 4 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the December 5, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the January 8, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nLively Holy Treant\nDetails\nOn \"DANGER\", \"Gaining Ground\", and \"Extreme\" difficulties, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nDark Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Extreme\"difficulty\nThrust Element\nHoly Element\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Frostbite\", \"Curse\" and \"Stun\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nIf you have previously played the \"Thoughts on a Holy Night\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nAchievements and achievement progress\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\nIf the ★3 Skill Records you acquire as rewards for this event have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Record Kit M\".\nAfter you clear the Gaining Ground dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\n\"Xmas Stockings\", \"Twin Xmas Bells\", and \"Buche de Noels\" will be deleted on January 15, 2025 (Wed) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
