    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(11/20)\nMAINT.\n2024-11-19 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 11/20, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 11/20, 2024, 18:00(JST/UTC+9).\nWe will be sending out token of apology for the maintenance.\n50 Arcana Gems\nAvailable until:11/29/2024(Fri) at 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 2nd \"Squad Jumble\" begins\n\"The Way of the Swordsmen\" is back\n\"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n\"GGO Squad Jumble Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Upcoming Update\nAs of the next scheduled maintenance on 11/29, 2024, the guild room will no longer be themed for autumn.\nIf you haven't visited yet, please go see the autumn theme while you still can and enjoy taking pictures with your guild members.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n11/20, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 2nd \"Squad Jumble\" begins\n\"The Way of the Swordsmen\" is back\n\"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 11/20 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 53\n\"Fatal Scythe Hunt\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
