    "full_details": "Notices\nSummon up your might for a Starburst Stream! The \"Aincrad Conquest Anniversary: Final Battle Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-11-07 14:55:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIn the original story of Sword Art Online, November 7, 2024 is the very special day when Kirito and friends free those trapped inside Aincrad!\nOn this day, Kirito and Heathcliff, who faced off in a final battle on the 75th floor, are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nAincrad Conquest Anniversary: Final Battle Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nWhat's more, ★4 [Battle of Life and Death] Kirito's skill is Starburst Stream!\nThe skill also has an animation modeled after Starburst Stream!\nAlso, by Transforming \"★4[Pride of the Creator] Heathcliff\" to ★5, not only will you get the usual Memoria Niter L from Achievements, you can also get the \"Heathcliff Armor\" costume Avatar!\nBe sure to Transform him if you get him!\n* Two different Achievements have been prepared for the \"Heathcliff Armor\" and the Memoria Niter L.\nYou can get the \"Heathcliff Armor\" via the \"Transform [Pride of the Creator] Heathcliff\" Achievement.\nAcquiring the \"Heathcliff Armor\" will complete the \"Obtain the Heathcliff Armor.\" Achievement, allowing you to get the Memoria Niter L.\nAvatar Images\nItem Name\nType\nHeathcliff Armor\nFull Body Avatar\nMale Only\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Battle of Life and Death] Kirito\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nStarburst Stream\nSkill Name\nStarburst Stream\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nSlash\nElement\nSlash\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nFire\n→\nWind\n→Slash\nSkill Cool Time\n20.0\nSkill Cool Time\n40.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n62\nBreak Gauge\n124\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2290% damage (16x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5510% damage (16x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping no Heathcliff Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Critical rate +500%./[Bonus] When HP is under 25%, Critical damage +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Pride of the Creator] Heathcliff\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Holy Sword Offensive/Blockade/Forbidden Gate/Remarkable Reaction\nAttack\n41\nDefense\n60\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Holy Sword Offensive] Attack rises 10% x the number of Heathcliff Skill Records in the same set./[Blockade1] All elemental damage decreases by 100% x the number of Asuna Skill Records in the same set (Non-elemental included)./[Forbidden Gate 1] Hit rate decreases by 50% x the number of Kirito Skill Records in the same set.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Remarkable Reaction] Evasion rate +16%. *It will not be activated with focus attack.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Battle of Life and Death] Kirito\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nNovember 7, 2024 (Thu) 14:55 - December 3, 2024 (STue) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
