    "snippet": "在《刀劍神域》原作故事中，2024年11月7日是非常特別的一天，桐人和朋友們解救了被困在艾恩葛朗特里的人們！為了紀念這一天，我們舉辦艾恩葛朗特征服週年紀念登入獎勵！  這是一項特殊的登入獎勵，您每天可以獲得 250 顆奧秘寶石...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Aincrad Conquest Anniversary] Receive 250 Arcana Gems daily for 7 days! Receive up to a total of 1,750 Arcana Gems in the \"Aincrad Conquest Anniversary Login Bonus\"!\nCampaign\n2024-11-07 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIn the original story of Sword Art Online, November 7, 2024 is the very special day when Kirito and friends free those trapped inside Aincrad!\nTo commemorate this day, we're holding the Aincrad Conquest Anniversary Login Bonus!\nThis is a special login bonus where you can get\n250 Arcana Gems each day\nby logging in for a total of\nup to 1,750 Arcana Gems\nover 7 days!\nPeriod\nNovember 7, 2024 (Thu) 4:00 - November 29, 2024 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nReward Details\nNumber of Days Logged In\nReward\nIcon\nDay1\nArcana Gems×250\nDay2\nArcana Gems×250\nDay3\nArcana Gems×250\nDay4\nArcana Gems×250\nDay5\nArcana Gems×250\nDay6\nArcana Gems×250\nDay7\nArcana Gems×250\nImportant\nYou can receive the login bonus after completing the quest \"Labyrinth Strategy\".\nDaily distribution time will be from 4:00 AM to 3:59 AM of the next day. (JST/UTC+9)\nPlease note that the distribution date does not switch when the date changes.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
