    "full_details": "Notices\n[7 Huge Campaigns!] Presents on the 7th of each month! Decided by votes on X! This time, get 1,000 Arcana Gems!\nCampaign\n2024-11-07 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n7 huge campaigns!\nWe're holding a campaign based on voting results of a poll posted by @saoif_gameinfo on X (formerly Twitter)!\nThis time, the\npresent will be 1,000 Arcana Gems\n!\n- Pick up period\nNovember 7, 2024 (Thu) 0:00 - November 27, 2024 (Wed) 11:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\nThe schedule and content may change without prior notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
