    "full_details": "Notices\nGet event-limited party goods and items! \"IF Halloween Party Trick or Treasure!\" is on!\nEVENT\n2024-10-30 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n\"IF Halloween Party Trick or Treasure!\" is on!\nDefeat the event-limited monsters Halloween Walker and Halloween Hopper in each field where they appear to collect Pumpkin Plates and trade them for various items!\nRewards\nGet the event-limited items Halloween Party Favor and Colorful Candy!\nYou can also get other items such as Awakening Stars, Release Crystals (M), and Martial Arts Texts.\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nHalloween Party Favor A\nMysterious tube that sends bats\ndancing in the air when used.\nHalloween Party Favor B\nMysterious tube that pops out\npumpkins when used.\nYellow Colorful Candy\nMysterious candy that instantly\nrecovers 2,500 HP.\nGreen Colorful Candy\nMysterious candy that increases the\namount of Exp acquired for 5 min\nby 1.5 when used.\nColorful Candies expire, so please use them as soon as possible.\n* They will expire on November 20, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nEffect of \"Green Colorful Candy\"\nThe effect of \"Green Colorful Candy\" can be gained when defeating monsters.\n* EXP gained during quests will not be boosted.\nIf you use Guild Skills with the same effect at the same time, the effect rates will be added together.\nExample:\nOnly \"Green Colorful Candy\"\nEXP earned:\n50%\nincrease (\n1.5x\nincrease)\n\"Green Colorful Candy\" + Guild Skill (Player EXP UP I)\nEXP earned: 50% + 10% =\n60%\nincrease (\n1.6x\nincrease)\nBoost Mode\n+ \"Green Colorful Candy\"\nEXP earned: 300% + 50% =\n350%\nincrease (\n4.5x increase\n)\nSee here for more details on Boost Mode.\nPumpkin Plate Trader\nTrade with the Trader NPC in the Teleport Gate Plaza.\nHowever, for more info, go to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the Pumpkin Plate Trader banner.\nTrader\nTrader Period\nStarts after the October 30, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the November 20, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nEvent Period\nStarts after the October 30, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the November 13, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nEvent Monsters\nHalloween Walker\nHalloween Hopper\nField with Event Monsters\nThe fields that are\ncovered\nare as follows.\n* Floors are listed in main quest unlock order.\n1F\n2F\n3F\n4F\n5F\n10F\n20F\n35F\n47F\n50F\n61F\n74F\n81F\n91F\n63F\n79F\n26F\n*38F\n* Vampkin Walkers and Vampkin Hoppers are the special monsters for the event on 38F.\nVampkin Walkers and Vampkin Hoppers will appear in the 38F dungeon.\nHalloween Walkers and Halloween Hoppers will not appear in Labyrinths or floor dungeons.\nImportant\nPumpkin Plates will be deleted on November 20, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
