    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Kirito's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Kirito!\nShop\n2024-10-07 00:00:02\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Kirito's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[A Wish-Granted Miracle] Kirito\n(Burst Skill)\" and \"\n[Guided By Moonlight] Kirito\n\" are now available!\n\"\nKirito's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Kirito guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Kirito\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[A Wish-Granted Miracle] Kirito\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFlame Sins Burst\nSkill Name\nFlame Sins\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Slash→\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nBreak Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n114\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2050% damage (7x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4840% damage (7x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Fire damage against enemies with burn increases by burn stacks x 0.2%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Guided By Moonlight] Kirito\nSkill Name\nSuper Enhance Heal/Veteran Sword Technique/Six Paths\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Super Enhance Heal] Effect of healing items and field objects +100%./[Veteran Sword Technique 4] Attack power increase with own level×0.17%. (max 34%)/[Six Paths 4] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 2 of Kirito's Skill Records: Deals +40% Earth element's damage to enemy.When equipping 3 of Kirito's Skill Records: Deals +40% Wind element's damage to enemy.When equipping 4 of Kirito's Skill Records: Deals +40% Fire element's damage to enemy.When equipping 5 of Kirito's Skill Records: Deals +40% Water element's damage to enemy.When equipping 6 of Kirito's Skill Records: Deals +50% Holy element's damage to enemy.When equipping 7 of Kirito's Skill Records: Deals +50% Dark element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[A Wish-Granted Miracle] Kirito\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nOctober 7, 2024 (Mon) 0:00 - October 16, 2024 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Kirito\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Kirito\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
