    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3! Get ★4 Skill Records with backgrounds! The \"Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary! Brilliant Order\" is here!\nShop\n2024-09-25 18:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary!\nThe \"\nWorldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary! Brilliant Order\n\" is here, featuring ★4 Skill Records with seasonal backgrounds!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn all Steps, the\ntotal drop rate for ★4 Skill Records is 8.0%\n!\nAdditionally, on Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Rainbow Omen] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nWind Impact\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n31\nSkill Effect\n1640% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRaises 3 → 6 → 9 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself when hitting with skills.\nRaises 1 → 2 → 3 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself when hitting with skills and equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set.\n★4[Commander in the Storm] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nSand Brush\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n60\nBreak Gauge\n24\nSkill Effect\n1800% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Blaze 4/Buff] Attack +20 per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Poison/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Poison (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Blaze 4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Attack +20 per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Bonus] Raises 3 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Have a Bite] Leafa\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHeart Judgement Burst\nSkill Name\nHeart Judgement\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nHoly\n→Blunt→(\nHoly\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nBreak Gauge\n49\nBreak Gauge\n98\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1680% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Holy Element Enhance4/Buff] Holy element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4620% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP x 200%./[Bonus] Critical rate +400% towards enemies on break.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Calculating Smile] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShadow Bump\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n1860% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Shining New Year Smile] Yuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nRefuge Crops\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1380% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[PT Enhance Blunt 4/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +30% for your party for 20 sec./[Enhance Blunt 3/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +25% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[It Feels a Bit Heavy...] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHydro Cinque\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n20\nSkill Effect\n1350% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the September 25, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends on October 4, 2024 (Fri) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n11 Order for 1,250 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP2\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP3\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
