    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(9/25)\nMAINT.\n2024-09-24 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 9/25, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 9/25, 2024, 18:30(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad 72F\"\n\"72F Start Dash Event\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Boss Rush VS Taurus King\"\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\n\"Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary! Brilliant Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\"\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed part of the design of the pathway connecting Teleport Gate Plaza and the Merchant District\nFixed an issue where progress would become impossible during the boss appearance cutscene in the 3F main quest\nFixed an issue with the display of default stamps\n* Some stamps set as \"Favorites\" may be removed from your Favorites as a result of these changes.\nWe apologize for the inconvenience, but please set them up again as necessary.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Official Live Stream Rewards\nWe have sent out rewards for correct answers to the quiz corner on the official livestream on 9/20, 2024.\nArcana Gems×600\nMemoria Niter L×10\nReceive by: Until 10/2, 2024 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n9/25, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad 72F\"\n\"72F Start Dash Event\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Boss Rush VS Taurus King\"\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 9/25 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 51\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Gourmand Macaque Hunt\"\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
