    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Holiday Campaign! Up to 110 Free Avatar Orders\" is here!\nShop\n2024-09-21 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary!\n\"\nWorldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary! Up to 110 Free Avatar Orders\n\" is here! Get up to 110 Avatars!\nDuring the \"\nWorldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary! Up to 110 Free Avatar Orders\n\", one free 11x Order will be available every day.\nPlayers can take advantage of this for up to 10 days!\n【Lineup】\n‧Pirate Avatar\n‧Wonderland Avatar\n‧Fluffy Cat Avatar\n‧New Year Dress Avatar\n‧Priestess and Priest Avatar\n‧Fox Avatar\n‧French Maid/Butler Avatar\n‧Idol Avatar\n‧Knight Avatar\n‧Musketeer Avatar\n‧Assassin Avatar\n‧Samurai Spirit Avatar\n‧Flower Power Avatar\n‧Candy Avatar\n‧Demonic Swordsman Avatar\n- Period\nSeptember 21, 2024 (Sat) 4:00 - Before the November 29, 2024 (Fri) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n【Avatar Images】\nPirate Avatar\nWonderland Avatar\nFluffy Cat Avatar\nNew Year Dress Avatar\nPriestess and Priest Avatar\nFox Avatar\nFrench Maid/Butler Avatar\nIdol Avatar\nKnight Avatar\nMusketeer Avatar\nAssassin Avatar\nSamurai Spirit Avatar\nFlower Power Avatar\nCandy Avatar\nDemonic Swordsman Avatar\n-\n- Important\nDuring this event, players will receive one free 11x Order per day for up to 10 days total.\nThere is no single Order.\nKoharu can also equip female avatars and accessories.\nSome of the avatars available in this Order have equip conditions that depend on the equipped character's gender.\nKirito's and Asuna's faces and hairstyles are not included in this Order.\nAll avatars, both female and male, are available in the Order regardless of your own character's gender.\nNew days begin at 4:00 am every day (JST/UTC+9).\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 avatars.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
