    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(9/11)\nMAINT.\n2024-09-10 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 9/11, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 9/11, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 51 begins\n\"[Returning] Search for the Phantom Mushroom\" is back\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Gourmand Macaque Hunt\"\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 3x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] The \"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n\"影なる討士オーダー\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAdded emotes to some NPCs\n* Further adjustments will be made as needed.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n9/11, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 51 begins\n\"[Returning] Search for the Phantom Mushroom\" is back\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Gourmand Macaque Hunt\"\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 3x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] The \"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 9/11 Maintenance\n\"Future Meeting Key Visual Order\"\n\"Heapin' 30M EXP Event\"\n\"Guild Support Campaign\"\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 6x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
