    "full_details": "Notices\n[9/10 10:40 Update] September 4, 2024 (Wed) update information! Increased chances of obtaining Release Crystals & additional EXP rewarded in low-floor subquests!\nUPDATE\n2024-09-10 10:40:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nThe following updates have been implemented following the maintenance on September 4, 2024 (Wed).\n- Release Crystal drop settings adjusted\nThe drop rates for Release Crystal (M) and Release Crystal (L) in labyrinths on the 13th floor and beyond have been increased.\nRelease Crystal (M) and Release Crystal (L) now drop in dungeons on the 13th floor and beyond.\nLabyrinths and dungeons in more recent floors will have larger drop rate increases.\n* The 23rd floor currently has the highest drop rate.\n* The drop rates will not change in Character Quests.\n[9/10 10:40 Update]\nThe drop rates for Release Crystal (M) and Release Crystal (L) for 75F All Out Battle [The Skull Reaper] and 100F All Out Battle [Aincrad] have been increased.\nWe apologize for any infomation lacking from the description.\n- Experience granted by subquests from floors 1 to 7 increased\nThe experience granted by subquests for both the first and multiple rounds has been increased.\nAs compensation for first-time subquests, the following EXP items have been distributed to all users:\nExp Crystal S x15 (grants a total of 150,000 experience if all are used)\nAvailable until: September 30, 2024 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nWe will continue to make modifications while considering the circumstances of our customers.\nWe hope you continue to enjoy \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nGo to Notice List"
