    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Wild Hunter Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-09-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSinon, Leafa, Yui, and Sachi tough it out in the wilderness as hunters in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nWild Hunter Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Cunning Hunter] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nTerror Needle\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n58\nSkill Effect\n1470% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Wide]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] When equipping 4 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[The Power of Nature] Leafa\nSkill Name\nCurse Counter/Shadow Indemnity/Resentment/Onslaught\nAttack\n63\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Curse Counter 4] When the player is Status Ailments (Curse), Attack +1500./[Shadow Indemnity 3] When you are cursed, dark element damage +40%./[Resentment] Adds Curse effect on yourself for 30 sec when you hit using Switch.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Onslaught 4] Attack +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Today's Harvest Bite] Yui\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nFlame Spinning Dive\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n110\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1790% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Burn/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Argo's Skill Records in the same set, Burn (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Muscle Atrophy 4/Debuff] Enemy's attack -0.3% per stack (Stack 9) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Majestic Tiger Robe] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nTerror Charge\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n47\nSkill Effect\n1740% damage (All Foes)[Motion Range]/[Dark Shadow Demon 3/Buff] Dark element damage +45% for 8 sec./[Paralysis Res. 4/Buff] Paralysis resist +80% for 15 sec./▲▲▲[Bonus]  Raises 12 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nOde to Home\n[When Rush Activates]Extends the effect of Rush by 5 sec.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nSeptember 6, 2024 (Fri) 17:00 - October 3, 2024 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
