    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Eydis's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Eydis!\nShop\n2024-09-04 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Eydis's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Concentrated Ambition] Eydis\n\" and \"\n[The Flash of a Sword] Eydis\n(Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nEydis's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Eydis guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Eydis\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Concentrated Ambition] Eydis\nSkill Name\nSpirit Unity/Enhance Defense/Frost Accumulation\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n44\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Spirit Unity 3] + 5 increase to Awakening rate./[Enhance Defense 4] Defense +15%./[Frost Accumulation 4] Water element's damage rises by the number of Eydis Skill Records in the same set x 12.5%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[The Flash of a Sword] Eydis\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWater Raid Burst\nSkill Name\nWater Raid\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Slash→\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n39\nSwitch Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n84\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2050% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4840% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Water damage against enemies with frostbite increases by frostbite stacks x 0.2%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[The Flash of a Sword] Eydis\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nSeptember 4, 2024 (Wed) 0:00 - September 13, 2024 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Eydis\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Eydis\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nThere is no voice production when ★4 \"Eydis\" Skill Records are drawn.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
