    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(9/4)\nMAINT.\n2024-09-03 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 9/4, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 9/4, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Gourmand Macaque Hunt\" begins\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 6x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAdjusted the opportunity to obtain Release Crystals upwards\nIncreased EXP rewards for subquests on floors 1F–7F\nThe Guild Room will be changed to the usual theme.\nAdded emotes to some NPCs\n* Further adjustments will be made as needed.\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed the field gimmick for 23F \"Ougahara\"\nFixed the issue where the effect duration of \"[Humorous Principal] Kibaou\" [Resentment] was set to 20 seconds instead of the duration stated in the description.\nFixed the performance when using [Impeccable Service] Yuna with switch\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n9/4, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Gourmand Macaque Hunt\" begins\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 6x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 9/4 Maintenance\n\"Elegant Summer Night Order\"\n\"LafCof Assault\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
