    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Vow at the Bridge Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-08-24 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki, Leafa, Sachi, and Agil dressed as heroes from tales of yore are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nVow at the Bridge Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Heavenly Leap] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nSomersault Flame\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n1460% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Burn Boost 4/Debuff] Lowers enemy's burn resistance 50% for 30 sec (easier to inflict Burn) and burn damage +100%./▲[Bonus] Increases attack against enemies with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite). +0.3% for every Stack 1./[Bonus] When an enemy with Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite) was hit, increase status ailment stacks by 3 on enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Melody Under the Moon] Leafa\nSkill Name\nFrost Suction/Enhance Frostbite/Composure/Freezing Point\nAttack\n61\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Frost Suction 4] When the player is Status Ailments (Frostbite), Attack +50%./●[Enhance Frostbite 3] Frostbite damage -30%./[Composure 3] Hit rate +30% when you are frostbitten./[Freezing Point 3] Adds iceburn effect on yourself for 30 sec when hitting using Switch (Stack 50). 2.2%＋(number of stacks x 0.2%) damage and 4.4%+(number of stacks x 0.3%) hit rate decrease.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nReduce Ailments\n[When Rush Activates] Reduces status ailment stacks by -10 on yourself (Will not be below 1).\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[One Away From the Goal] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nHoly Orbit\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n84\nBreak Gauge\n32\nSkill Effect\n1990% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Armor Decay 4/Debuff] Enemy's defense -0.5% per stack (Stack 9) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Drop Your Weapon] Agil\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHydro Fan Burst\nSkill Name\nHydro Fan\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Blunt→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n88\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2090% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4960% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 250%./[Bonus] Water element damage increases by number of frostbite stacks x 0.5% when the player is inflicted with the frostbite status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Drop Your Weapon] Agil\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAugust 24, 2024 (Sat) 17:00 - Before the September 18, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
