    "full_details": "Notices\nAbout \"Argo's Mission Report\" panel mission contents\nNOTICES\n2024-08-21 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nFollowing maintenance on August 28, 2024 (Wed), the contents on the \"Argo's Mission Report\" panel mission will be changed.\nYou will no longer be able to make progress or claim rewards on the current \"Argo's Mission Report\", so please claim your rewards by maintenance on August 28, 2024 (Wed).\nAll customers will be able to progress on the new \"Argo's Mission Report\" following maintenance on August 28, 2024 (Wed).\n* The panel mission will now appear after you have completed the 1F main quest.\nWe will continue to make modifications while considering the circumstances of our customers.\nWe hope you continue to enjoy \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nGo to Notice List"
