    "snippet": "登入《刀劍神域積分因子》的用戶須知。維護將在以下日期期間生效。  預定維護日期2024年8月15日14:00至17:00（暫定）（JST/UTC+9）▼新實施和新活動“Guild of Guilds”季前賽第50場開始“LafCof Assault”開始...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(8/15)\nMAINT.\n2024-08-14 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 8/15, 2024, 14:00, was completed on 8/15, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 50 begins\n\"LafCof Assault\" begins\nAdded \"Agil Summer Festival 2024\" Event rewards\n\"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Future Meeting Key Visual Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n8/15, 2024 14:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 50 begins\n\"LafCof Assault\" begins\nAdded \"Agil Summer Festival 2024\" Event rewards\n\"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 8/15 Maintenance\n\"Fatal Battle: Prison Warden\"\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\n\"Explore the Dungeon with Yui\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
