    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(8/7)\nMAINT.\n2024-08-06 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 8/7, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 8/7, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild Battle Challenge VS Executioner\" begins\n\"2024 Midsummer Fishing Competition\" begins\n\"Klein's Test of Courage Operation [Returning]\" is back\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Agil Summer Festival 2024\"\nAdded \"Squad Jam: Insane Fiend\" Event rewards\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n\"Elegant Summer Night Order\" begins\n\"★4 Guaranteed Free 11x Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAdjusted the volume balance of Koharu's phrases in the 26F main quest\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n8/7, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild Battle Challenge VS Executioner\" begins\n\"2024 Midsummer Fishing Competition\" begins\n\"Klein's Test of Courage Operation [Returning]\" is back\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Agil Summer Festival 2024\"\nAdded \"Squad Jam: Insane Fiend\" Event rewards\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 8/7 Maintenance\n\"Memory Defrag World Order\"\n\"Stage Takeover Order\"\n\"Boss Rush VS Storm Griffin\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
