    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Mito's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Mito!\nShop\n2024-08-03 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Mito's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Midnight Duel] Mito\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[Whirlwind of Blades] Mito\n(Accele Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nMito's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Mito guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Mito\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Midnight Duel] Mito\nSkill Name\nEnhance Blunt/Icy Blade/Prosper\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Blunt 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +24%./[Icy Blade 4] Deals +20% Water element's damage to enemy./[Prosper 5] Attack +25% when HP is above 50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Whirlwind of Blades] Mito\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHydro Swatter\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n82\nBreak Gauge\n38\nSkill Effect\n2320% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Small]/[Anticlimax 4/Buff] The greater your remaining HP ratio, attack increases (Stack 3) for 20 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Frostbite (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Anticlimax 4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, the greater your remaining HP ratio, attack increases (Stack 9) for 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n\"[Whirlwind of Blades] Mito\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAugust 3, 2024 (Sat) 0:00 - August 12, 2024 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Mito\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Mito\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nThere is no voice production when ★4 \"Mito\" Skill Records are drawn.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
