    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Yuna's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Yuna!\nShop\n2024-07-29 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Yuna's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Night Sky Concert Stage] Yuna\n(Full Burst Skill)\" and \"\n[Lit-Up Star] Yuna\n(MOD Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nYuna's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Yuna guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Yuna\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Night Sky Concert Stage] Yuna\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nWind Flip Burst\nSkill Name\nWind Flip\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→\nWind\n→Blunt→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n25\nBreak Gauge\n50\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1860% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4390% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark)./[Bonus] Wind element damage increases x 0.5% the number of bleed stacks when the player is inflicted with the bleed status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Lit-Up Star] Yuna\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nHoly Thrust\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n51\nBreak Gauge\n42\nSkill Effect\n1720% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Sachi's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200./[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using holy skills while the buff to raise Holy element's damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n\"[Night Sky Concert Stage] Yuna\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nJuly 29, 2024 (Mon) 0:00 - August 7, 2024 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Yuna\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Yuna\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
