    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(7/17)\nMAINT.\n2024-07-16 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 7/17, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 7/17, 2024, 18:30(JST/UTC+9).\nWe will be sending out token of apology for the maintenance.\n50 Arcana Gems\nAvailable until:7/24/2024(Wed) at 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 49 begins\n\"Boss Rush VS Storm Griffin\" begins\nAdded \"GGO Anime Rebroadcast Celebration Selfish Ossa Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n\"Unleash Blading World Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nChanged displayed conditions for Daily and Weekly Missions to become available after the main quest is completed through the end\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed the issue where special effects on some maps were not working correctly\nFixed an issue where characters of different heights did not look at each other properly\nFixed an issue where quest details were not displayed in rare cases when holding down \"Quest Navi\"\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n7/17, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 49 begins\n\"Boss Rush VS Storm Griffin\" begins\nAdded \"GGO Anime Rebroadcast Celebration Selfish Ossa Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 7/17 Maintenance\n\"Thunderstorm Order\"\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
