    "full_details": "Notices\nAbout changes to displayed conditions for Daily and Weekly Missions\nNOTICES\n2024-07-10 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nAfter the maintenance on July 17, 2024 (Wed), the displayed conditions for Daily and Weekly Missions will be changed.\nContent to be changed\nBefore the change: Complete Main Quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nAfter the change: Complete the 1F Main Quest\nImportant\nPlease be aware of the following if you began playing the game before the July 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and have not completed the 1F Main Quest:\nDaily Missions accepted before maintenance can be attempted and completed during that day, but attempts and obtaining rewards will not be possible the following day.\nWeekly Missions accepted before maintenance can be attempted and completed during that week, but attempts and obtaining rewards will not be possible the following week.\nWe will continue to make modifications while considering the circumstances of our customers.\nWe hope you continue to enjoy \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nGo to Notice List"
