    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(7/10)\nMAINT.\n2024-07-09 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 7/10, 2024, 14:00, was completed on 7/10, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 49 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"GGO Anime Rebroadcast Celebration Selfish Ossa Hunt\"\n\"Heapin' 30M EXP Event\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n\"Memory Defrag World Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nChanged the buff icon for the \"Ultimate Light\" skill effect\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed the issue preventing the fireworks on the night beach at 19:00\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n7/10, 2024 14:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 49 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"GGO Anime Rebroadcast Celebration Selfish Ossa Hunt\"\n\"Heapin' 30M EXP Event\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 7/10 Maintenance\n\"Night Roamer Order\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Kibaou and the Secret Deal\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
