    "full_details": "Notices\nThe GGO Anime Rebroadcast Celebration Login Bonus is here! Get LLENN and Pitohui avatars, as well as up to 1,500 Arcana Gems!\nCampaign\n2024-07-05 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nWe're offering a login bonus to celebrate the rebroadcast of the TV anime series Sword Art Online Alternative: Gun Gale Online!\nLog in during the period to get\nLLENN\nand\nPitohui\navatars, as well as\nup to an incredible 1,500 Arcana Gems\nin this special login bonus!\nPeriod\nJuly 5, 2024 (Fri) 4:00 - September 28, 2024 (Sat) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nReward Details\nNumber of Days Logged In\nReward\nType\nItem Icon\nDay1\nLLENN Avatar Costume Cap\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nDay2\nArcana Gem×500\nArcana Gems\nDay3\nLLENN Avatar Costume Pouch\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nDay4\nLLENN Avatar Costume Scarf\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nDay5\nLLENN Avatar Costume Bottoms\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nDay6\nLLENN Avatar Costume Top\nTop Avatar/Female Only\nDay7\nArcana Gem×1000\nArcana Gems\nDay8\nPitohui Costume Tattoo\nAccessory Avatar\nDay9\nPitohui Costume Pouch\nAccessory Avatar\nDay10\nPitohui Costume Set\nFull Body Avatar/For both Male Female\nImmerse yourself in the world of SAOIF as \"LLENN\" and \"Pitohui\"!\nImportant\nSome of the avatars available have equip conditions that depend on the equipped character's gender.\nKoharu can also equip female avatars and accessories.\nYou can receive the login bonus after completing the quest \"Labyrinth Strategy\".\nDaily distribution time will be from 4:00 AM to 3:59 AM of the next day. (JST/UTC+9)\nPlease note that the distribution date does not switch when the date changes.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
