    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Rain's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Rain!\nShop\n2024-06-21 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Rain's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Sweet Time by the Window] Rain\n(Accele Skill)\" and \"\n[Countless Swordlight] Rain\n(MOD Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nRain's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Rain guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Rain\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sweet Time by the Window] Rain\nSkill Name\nBurning Blow/Dark Accumulation/Flame Accumulation/Accelerated Healing\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n44\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Burning Blow 4] Attack against burned enemies increases 24%./[Dark Accumulation 3] Dark element's damage rises by the number of Sanya Skill Records in the same set x 10%./[Flame Accumulation 4] Fire element's damage rises by the number of Rain Skill Records in the same set x 12.5%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Accelerated Healing 4] Recovers a max of 4% HP per 3 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Countless Swordlight] Rain\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nRaged Destruction\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1600% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Sanya's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nJune 21, 2024 (Fri) 0:00 - June 30, 2024 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Rain\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Rain\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nThere is no voice production when ★4 \"Rain\" Skill Records are drawn.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
