    "news_date": 1718784000,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "假期活動！  新活動連擊：咆哮的岩石來了！在此活動中，您將嘗試透過路由大量出現在專門為此活動而製作的場地中的低級怪物來在時限內清除階段。擊敗所有低級怪物將會導致Boss怪物出現。 ……",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] Get tons of Medals of Combat Arts! Successive Strike: Roaring Rocks, where you hunt monsters to clear a giant field, is here!\nEVENT\n2024-06-19 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nThe new event Successive Strike: Roaring Rocks is here!\nIn this event, you'll try to clear stages within the time limit by routing tons of low-level monsters that appear in a field made just for this event.\nDefeating all the low-level monsters will cause a boss monster to appear.\nThe stage will be completed if you reach the time limit or defeat the boss monster.\nThe less time it takes for you to clear the stage, the more points you'll get, allowing you to more rapidly earn total score rewards!\nYou can also get even more Successive Strike Plates required for exchange by defeating the boss monster. On certain difficulties, there's also a chance that the boss monster will drop Star Fragments.\nThe treasure boxes you find on the path will provide useful effects, so go get them as needed!\nFinally, this event can be played with groups of up to 12 members.\nTake it on with the biggest group you can to gain an advantage on the battlefield!\nRewards\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\nare easier to get here than in other events, making it an opportunity to earn tons of Medals.\nAdditionally,\nSecret Medals\ncan also be obtained as Total Score Rewards during this event.\nSecret Medals can be exchanged in Kibaou and the Secret Deal for proficiency items like Release Crystals and Martial Arts Texts, so make sure to go get them!\nSee here for more details on Kibaou and the Secret Deal.\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 50\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, up to 200\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\n, and up to 200\n\"Secret Medals\"\nfrom the event.\nTrader Rewards\nExchange the \"Y. Successive Strike Plates\" you obtain from the event at the exclusive Trader to get items.\n\"G. Successive Strike Plates\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the June 26, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on July 3, 2024 (Wed).\nTrade \"Y. Successive Strike Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n20\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n5\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n4\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n4\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n4\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n4\nTrade \"G. Successive Strike Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n10\n30\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n20\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n5\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n4\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n4\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n4\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n4\nTrader Period\nY. Successive Strike Plate: Starts after the June 19, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nG. Successive Strike Plate: Starts after the June 26, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in  count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nClear bonus\nBeginner\nNormal\nAdvanced\nPremium\nManiac\nSurvival Bonus\n1 person 1P\n1 person 1P\n1 person 1P\n1 person 1P\n1 person 1P\nTime Bonus\n1 second 1P\n1 person 2P\n1 person 4P\n1 person 12P\n1 person 12P\nFirst Attack, Last Attack Bonus\n1P\n1P\n6P\n6P\n12P\n\"Premium\"\nYou can get a high score in the\n\"Premium\"\ndifficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the\n\"Premium\"\n1 time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×700\nMedal of Combat Arts×27\nAwakening Star×40\nGreat Red Jewel×8\nGreat Green Jewel×8\nGreat Yellow Jewel×8\nGreat Blue Jewel×8\nMemoria Niter S×110\nSecret Medal×200\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nKeep On Fighting\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Y. Successive Strike Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nCoral Pegasus Tresses\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Y. Successive Strike Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Successive Strike Event\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the June 19, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 10, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n* The high-difficulty dungeon Expert will be implemented after the June 26, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nMargaret the Naughty Mermaid\nDetails\nBreaks can be performed.\nOn \"Maniac\" and \"Expert\" difficulties, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nOn \"Advanced\", \"Premium\", \"Maniac\" and \"Expert\" difficulties, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nEarth Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Expert\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nDark Element\nResistance\n* Only \"Expert\"difficulty\nThrust Element\nBlunt Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Fatal Poison\",\"Curse\" and \"Paralysis\"\nDebuff \"Seal Item\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nGroups\nSuccessive Strike Event allows you to form groups of up to 12 players.\nHow to Join Groups\nYou can create and join a group by talking to the NPC \"Successive Strike Event\" and selecting the difficulty level and \"Challenge with a group (12)\".\nThe \"12\" on the button indicates the maximum number of group members.\nWhen you create or join a group, you will move to the Standby Map.\nDisplay the Standby Member List by tapping the action button at the bottom right of the Standby Map.\nOnce the group is formed, you will automatically be moved from the Standby Map to the dungeon.\nIf you have a party, only the party leader will be able to create or join a group.\nPlayers who aren't in a party will be automatically joined together to form one when making a group.\nFor players looking to easily jump into a group, we recommend a \"Quick Group\".\n\"Quick Group\" will automatically add you into a group that is in need of members.\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nThe specs of the boss monsters appearing in the game are different from the original monsters. See this announcement and in-game dungeon information for details.\nAfter you clear a \"Premium\" difficulty dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nAfter time runs out, you can skip the monster hunt log wait time by tapping the screen.\n\"Y. Successive Strike Plates\" and \"G. Successive Strike Plates\" will be deleted on July 17, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
