    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(6/12)\nMAINT.\n2024-06-11 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 6/12, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 6/12, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 48 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Holiday Campaign] \"Golden Colossus Hunt 2024\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 6x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n\"Night Roamer Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAdjusted the help displayed during the main quest progression up to 3F\nAdjusted Col gained from rare monsters appearing in \"35F Labyrinth – Entry\" and \"35F Labyrinth - Interior\"\nAdjusted the behavior of monster's charge attacks\nAdded \"Rock,\" \"Paper,\" and \"Scissors\" to default stamps\nList of Added Memory Stamps\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n6/12, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 48 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Holiday Campaign] \"Golden Colossus Hunt 2024\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 6x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 6/12 Maintenance\n\"Attack of the Giant Boar! 2024\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Heapin' 30M EXP Event\"\n\"Silent Prayer Order\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
