    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(5/22)\nMAINT.\n2024-05-21 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 5/22, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 5/22, 2024, 17:30(JST/UTC+9).\nWe will be sending out token of apology for the maintenance.\n50 Arcana Gems\nAvailable until:5/29/2024(Wed) at 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Attack of the Giant Boar! 2024\" begins\nAdded \"Heavy Samurai Lord Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n▼Compensated Items\nAn issue has occurred for some customers in which items that were obtained were not correctly reflected in the game.\nWe have sent those items to the customers who were unable to obtain them.\nDuration of issue :\n5/9, 2024 (Thu) 17:00 - 5/10, 2024 (Fri) 10:30 (JST/UTC+9)\nPlease contact us again if you have further inquiries about the issue.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n5/22, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Attack of the Giant Boar! 2024\" begins\nAdded \"Heavy Samurai Lord Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 5/22 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 47\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
