    "snippet": "狂野可愛的獸人形態桐人和小春全新★4技能記錄登場！ 「靈人令」來了！保證在步驟 3 獲得一項 ★4 技能記錄！全新特色★4技能紀錄的費率提升！  在第 1 步，您可以獲得 11 個訂單，價值 1,250 顆奧秘寶石！一項★4技能記錄是保證...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Spirithrope Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-05-09 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito and Koharu in wild and cute werebeast forms are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nSpirithrope Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Blade of the Beast] Kirito\nSkill Name\nBloody Battle Strike/Dark Conversion\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Bloody Battle Strike 3] Attack +35% when attacking with blunt element./[Dark Conversion 4] Holy element's damage to enemies -10% and dark element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Flowery Beast Girl] Koharu\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nExtreme Prism Burst\nSkill Name\nExtreme Prism\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→Thrust→\nHoly\n→(\nHoly\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nBreak Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n76\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1680% damage (10x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Holy Element Weak 4/Debuff] Holy element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Attack increase effect will be removed from enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4620% damage (10x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Holy Light Demon 5/Buff] Holy element damage +65% for 8 sec./[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with debuff status.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n- Duration\nAfter the May 9, 2024 (Thu) maintenance - June 4, 2024 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
