    "full_details": "Notices\nFishing Ranking Event, \"2024 Early Summer Fishing Competition\" is here!\nEVENT\n2024-04-27 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nFishing Ranking Event \"2024 Early Summer Fishing Competition\" is on now.\nIn the \"2024 Early Summer Fishing Competition\", you fight for the best rank based on your catch scores.\nThis time, fish thought up by voice actors at the SAO Games 10th Anniversary Special Stage in KPF2023 will appear on the event map!\nCatch them to get a\nhigh score\n!\nIntroducing fish\nName\nImage\nKiss Fish\nTaiyaki Fish (Sweet Bean)\nBig Yasumoto\nMerdude\nMega Shark\n- Event Period and Ranking Period\nApril 27, 2024 (Sat) 12:00 - Before the May 9, 2024 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nThe \"On Board: Day\" and \"On Board: Night\" event maps will also be available during this period.\nTo check your current ranking or score, go to Menu > Community > Ranking > 2024 Early Summer Fishing Competition ranking banner.\nRewards\nPlace at the top of the rankings to get limited-edition Fishing Competition records, rare fishing bait, and\nMemoria Niter L\n, a Skill Record Limit Break material, as a present!\nExchange for up to 1,000\nArcana Gems\n, up to 20\nMedals of Combat Arts\n, as well as other items such as\nCore Metals\nand Release Crystals at the Early Summer Fishing Competition Trader.\nEach fish likes different bait.\nTry different things and challenge the event.\nEarly Summer Fishing Competition Trader Period\nApril 27, 2024 (Sat) 12:00 - May 31, 2024 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nRecord\nYou will also be able to receive a record via achievement rewards by finishing in the top ranking.\nRecord Acquisition\nAchievement Rewards\nES Fishing King 2024\nRevive Crystal×1\nES Fishing Elite 2024\nRevive Crystal×1\nES Fishing Mania 2024\nRevive Crystal×1\nEvent Locations\nRankings will be based on fish caught on the \"On Board: Day\" and \"On Board: Night\" event maps, as well as the 22nd Floor's \"Serene Shore\" and \"Peaceful Forest Path\" during both day and night.\nHead to the On Board: Day and On Board: Night event maps by talking to the Boarding Guide NPC at the Teleport Gate Plaza.\nThere are Guide NPCs that can take you to and from the ships in both On Board: Day and On Board: Night.\nYou can return to Teleport Gate Plaza by talking to the Disembarkment Guide.\nGo to the \"Serene Shore\" or \"Peaceful Forest Path\" on the 22F by talking to \"Nishida\" in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\".\nTalk to the \"Night Map Guide\" NPC on the \"Serene Shore\" to go to the night map.\nFishing Spot\nRecommended Fishing Lv\nOn Board: Day\n1～15\nOn Board: Night\n16～\nSerene Shore (Day)\n1～10\nPeaceful Forest Path (Day)\n11～15\nSerene Shore (Night)\n16～20\nPeaceful Forest Path (Night)\n21～\nRanking Reward\nRanking\nRewards\nAmount\n#1\nRecord:ES Fishing King 2024\n1\nRecord:ES Fishing Elite 2024\n1\nRecord:ES Fishing Mania 2024\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n30\nRelease Crystal (L)\n20\n#2～#20\nRecord:ES Fishing Elite 2024\n1\nRecord:ES Fishing Mania 2024\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n5\nRelease Crystal (L)\n3\n#21～#100\nRecord:ES Fishing Mania 2024\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n20\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n20\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n20\nMemoria Niter L\n1\nRelease Crystal (L)\n1\n#101～#300\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n15\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n15\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n15\nMemoria Niter M\n3\n#301～#500\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n5\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n5\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n5\nMemoria Niter M\n1\n#501～#10000\nMemoria Niter S\n1\nRanking rewards will be distributed from May 10, 2024 (Fri) 14:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nReward Acceptance Period: Until May 31, 2024 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\nItems with record names will be removed on May 31, 2024 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
