    "full_details": "Notices\n[4/24 18:30 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] Notice for maintenance(4/24)\nMAINT.\n2024-04-23 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 4/24, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 4/24, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] \"Underworld Boss Rush\" begins\n\"Advanced Notice Full of Dreams\" is back\n\"Kiritoland is Open!\" is back\nAdded \"Wild Seahorse Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Heapin' 30M EXP Event\" begins\n\"Charmthrope Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n[4/24 18:30 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nAs an apology for not being able to play easily with players on other platforms, we have distributed 100 Arcana Gems.\nAvailable until:4/30/2024(Tue) at 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nSupport for story replays of the \"Yui, Glow of the Heart\" scenario quest\nThe Guild Room will be changed to the usual theme.\nChanged the \"About Sword Skill [Bonus]es\" description under Help\nModified to allow producing multiples of Ring III at once\n* Rings that are locked will not be used for production materials. Please protect any rings you do not want to be included in production materials by locking them.\n▼Fixed Issues\nThe issue where a white effect sometimes remained when using a Full Burst Skill after switch\nIssue where some avatars do not display accurately when canceling transformation\nIssue with incorrect motions when using transformation items during quick change or while falling\nThe issue where the switch gauge did not increase properly in some cases\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n4/24, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] \"Underworld Boss Rush\" begins\n\"Advanced Notice Full of Dreams\" is back\n\"Kiritoland is Open!\" is back\nAdded \"Wild Seahorse Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Heapin' 30M EXP Event\" begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 4/24 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 46\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
