    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Lv. 235 Dark Black Series \"Dark Black Chaos Drake\" is here! New boss monster added to the \"Chaos Showdown\"!\nEVENT\n2024-04-17 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe boss monster \"Chaos Drake Chaos\" and the Lv.235 Dark Black equipment series \"Dark Black Chaos Drake\" have been added!\nGet the powerful \"Dark Black Series\" armor!\nThe following difficulty levels are open to parties!\nTake on Chaos Showdown 90 difficulty to get Dark Black Spirit Tree, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 90.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 95 difficulty to get Dark Black Beast, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 95.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 110 difficulty to get Dark Black Evil Spirit, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 110.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 135 difficulty to get Dark Black Sturdy Crab, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 135.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 155 difficulty to get Dark Black One-Eyed Beast, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 155.\nDungeon Duration\nApril 17, 2024 (Wed) 14:00 - May 1, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nNew Boss monster\nChaos Drake Chaos\nDetails\nSince this is a field with unusable items, some items cannot be used.\nThe beginning of battle, it uses a \"Critical resistance\" buff.\nHigh defense.\nEvery time a player is attacked, it gains a stack buff that increases its defense.\nThe damage it takes increases according to the number of its Bleed and Frostbite status ailment stacks.\nSome attacks will remove buffs from the players.\nYou can break it with Dagger skills.\nSkill Breaks can be performed with skills that are both Slash Element and Fire Element.\nWith each Break or Skill Break, it will be weakened by a stack debuff that increases damage dealt from players.\nWhen its HP falls beneath a certain amount, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nFire Element\nResistance\nThrust Element\nBlunt Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nCritical\nDamage\nPoison\nBurn\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Critical resistance\" and \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStack Buff \"Increase Decrease\"\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Curse\" and \"Scorch\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Skill Break: By completely lowering the Skill Break Gauge, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all of its buff effects will be removed.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nBoss Appearing\nDifficulty\nBoss Name\nWeakness\nObtainable Chaos Crystals\nChaos Showdown 90\nDark Black Spirit Tree\nSlash Element\n・\nFire Element\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 95\nDark Black Beast\nSlash Element\n・\nWater Element\nAmber Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 110\nDark Black Evil Spirit\nBlunt Element\n・\nEarth Element\nTopaz Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 135\nDark Black Sturdy Crab\nBlunt Element\n・\nHoly Element\n→\nThrust Element\n・\nHoly Element\n→\nBlunt Element\n・\nHoly Element\nEmerald Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 155\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast\nBlunt Element\n・\nFire Element\nSapphire Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 175\nDark Black Sticky Thing\nThrust Element\n・\nWind Element\nIndigo Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 195\nDark Black Last Number\nSlash Element\n・\nEarth Element\nAmethyst Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 215\nDark Black Gleam Eyes\nThrust Element\n・\nFire Element\nQuartz Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 235\nDark Black Chaos Drake\nSlash Element\n・\nFire Element\nRose Quartz Chaos Crystal\n\"Dark Black Series\" equipment can be produced at the Workshop using Chaos Crystals and production materials dropped from the boss.\nEach \"Chaos Crystal\" can be obtained by collecting the correlating \"Crystal Shards\" and using them for production.\nDark Black Series List\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black Spirit Tree Armor\n816\n12210\nLv.90\nDark Black Spirit Tree Greaves\n670\n8547\nLv.90\nDark Black Beast Armor\n866\n12810\nLv.95\nDark Black Beast Greaves\n710\n8967\nLv.95\nDark Black Evil Spirit Armor\n917\n14010\nLv.110\nDark Black Evil Spirit Greaves\n752\n9807\nLv.110\nDark Black Sturdy Crab Armor\n1257\n20190\nLv.135\nDark Black Sturdy Crab Greaves\n1031\n14133\nLv.135\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast Armor\n1358\n21990\nLv.155\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast Greaves\n1114\n15393\nLv.155\nDark Black Sticky Thing Armor\n1460\n24400\nLv.175\nDark Black Sticky Thing Greaves\n1197\n16303\nLv.175\nDark Black Last Number Armor\n1563\n26850\nLv.195\nDark Black Last Number Greaves\n1282\n17253\nLv.195\nDark Black Gleam Eyes Armor\n1667\n29350\nLv.215\nDark Black Gleam Eyes Greaves\n1367\n18253\nLv.215\nDark Black Chaos Drake Armor[NEW！]\n1772\n31900\nLv.235\nDark Black Chaos Drake Greaves[NEW！]\n1453\n19303\nLv.235\nRandom Bonus\nThe value and type of the Dark Black Series bonus are random.\nExample: Equippable Lv. 235 Dark Black Series\nStatus\nUpper\nLower\nAttack\n30\n30\nDefense\n90\n50\nHP\n2500\n4500\nExample: If three types of defenses are given to Dark Black Chaos Drake Armor, defense will increase by 270 total.\n* Succession cannot be used for the Dark Black Series.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end\nAccept it from the \"Chaos Showdown\" NPC at the \"Blackiron Palace\".\nImportant\n\"Chaos Showdown\" 175, 195, 215, and 235 difficulties are solo only.\nChaos Showdown is a permanent dungeon where the boss changes approximately every two weeks. The rotation will start over again after six weeks.\nYour score reward and challenge reward information will not reset when each dungeon returns.\nCheck the game for details about the rewards of each dungeon.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
