    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(4/17)\nMAINT.\n2024-04-16 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 4/17, 2024, 14:00, was completed on 4/17, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 46 begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" New Boss and Dark Black Armor Added\n\"Jumping Kibaou\" is back\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Wild Seahorse Hunt\"\nAdded \"Fluffy Bunny Panic\" Event rewards\n\"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\n▼Fixed Issues\nMade fireworks items unusable while transformed\nThe following items will be sent as an apology and compensation for this issue.\n300 Fireworks\n100 Halloween Party Favor A\n100 Halloween Party Favor B\nReceive by: Until 5/17, 2024 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Upcoming Update\nAs of the next scheduled maintenance on 4/24, 2024, the guild room will no longer be themed for spring.\nIf you haven't visited yet, please go see the autumn theme while you still can and enjoy taking pictures with your guild members.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n4/17, 2024 14:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 46 begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" New Boss and Dark Black Armor Added\n\"Jumping Kibaou\" is back\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Wild Seahorse Hunt\"\nAdded \"Fluffy Bunny Panic\" Event rewards\n\"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 4/17 Maintenance\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Guild Strategy Event Witch's Manor 2024\"\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
