    "full_details": "Notices\n[Edited]Notice for maintenance completed(4/12)\nMAINT.\n2024-04-12 17:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nMaintenance we have implemented from April 12, 2024 18:00, was completed on April 12, 2024 19:10(JST/UTC+9).\n- Maintenance Contents\nFixing an issue with logging in and progression due to progressing through the \"Fluffy Bunny Panic!\" and \"All Together! IF Kindergarten\" quests in a certain order\n* The quest data of players experiencing this issue has been adjusted. We ask that those who were unable to log in before please log in again.\n- Apology for Issues & Maintenance Compensation Details\n250 Arcana Gems\n- Pick up period\nApril 19, 2024 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nOnce again, we apologize for any inconvenience and trouble that this issue has caused.\nWe hope that you continue to enjoy Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\n--------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n- Scheduled maintenance dates\nApril 12, 2024 18:00 to 20:00 (JST/UTC+9)\n* There may be changes with the date.\n- Maintenance Contents\nAdjusting server equipment.\nPlease note that the game can not be played during maintenance.\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\nGo to Notice List"
