    "snippet": "成長地牢可以幫助促進角色成長！  與莉茲貝斯一起，挑戰充滿大量裝備強化和改造材料的地下城！收集大量材料來增強你的設備。  獎勵 裝備強化、煉化哈…可獲得耀龍石",
    "full_details": "Notices\n【Raising Dungeon】Get equipment enhancement and transformation materials in \"Build Up Equipment with Lisbeth\"!\nEVENT\n2024-04-12 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\nJoin Lisbeth and take on a dungeon filled with tons of equipment enhancement and transformation materials!\nGather lots of materials to power up your equipment.\nRewards\nYou can get\nGlare Dragon Stones\nfor equipment enhancement,\nRefining Hammers and Refining Hammers+\nfor transformation, and each kind of\nstone for transformation\nfrom dungeon rewards.\nYou can get the equipment refinement items Red Hot Ore and Common Metal Scrap from score rewards.\nMonster Drop Items\nRefining Hammer,Refining Hammer+\nSlicing Stone,Slicing Stone+,Piercing Stone,Piercing Stone+,Striking Stone,Striking Stone+,Blocking Stone,Blocking Stone+\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Lisbeth\" at the Teleport Gate Plaza to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nApril 12, 2024 (Fri) 4:00 - April 19, 2024 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nScore Rewards\nBuild Up Equipment with Lisbeth\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n30\nRefining Hammer\n15\n60\nRefining Hammer+\n12\n90\nCommon Metal Scrap\n3\n130\nStriking Stone\n15\n160\nStriking Stone+\n10\n190\nRed Hot Ore\n1\n230\nPiercing Stone\n15\n260\nPiercing Stone+\n10\n290\nCommon Metal Scrap\n3\n330\nRefining Hammer\n15\n360\nRefining Hammer+\n12\n390\nRed Hot Ore\n1\n430\nSlicing Stone\n15\n460\nSlicing Stone+\n10\n490\nCommon Metal Scrap\n4\n530\nBlocking Stone\n30\n560\nBlocking Stone+\n20\n590\nRed Hot Ore\n1\n630\nRefining Hammer\n20\n660\nRefining Hammer+\n15\n690\nCommon Metal Scrap\n5\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nRewards\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nCol\n20000\nCompleted without any tumble (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRefining Hammer\n4\nCompleted within 3 minutes (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nGlare Dragon Stone\n5\nImportant\nThe dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis is a solo event that you can challenge with Lisbeth as your partner.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
