    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Lv.235 Dark Black series \"Dark Black Hundred Arms\" is here! New boss monster added to the \"Chaos Showdown\"!\nEVENT\n2024-04-03 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe boss monster \"Hundred Arms Chaos\" and the Lv. 235 Dark Black Series \"Dark Black Hundred Arms\" equipment have been added to the \"Chaos Showdown\"!\nGet the powerful \"Dark Black Series\" armor!\nThe following difficulty levels are open to parties!\nTake on Chaos Showdown 90 difficulty to get Dark Black Thunder Bull, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 90.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 95 difficulty to get Dark Black False Statue, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 95.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 110 difficulty to get Dark Black Frozen Evil, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 110.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 135 difficulty to get Dark Black Griffin, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 135.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 155 difficulty to get Dark Black Half Beast, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 155.\nDungeon Duration\nApril 3, 2024 (Wed) 14:00 - April 17, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nNew Boss monster\nHundred Arms Chaos\nDetails\nSince this is a field with unusable items, some items cannot be used.\nAt the start of battle, it gains a buff for critical resistance and a stack buff that reduces damage taken.\nEvery time a player is attacked, it gains a stack buff that \"Increase Attack\".\nYou can break it with 2H Spear skills.\nSkill Breaks can be performed with skills that are both Thrust Element and Water Element.\nWith each Break or Skill Break, it will be weakened by a stack debuff that increases damage dealt from players.\nWhen HP falls below a certain amount, attack increases and defense decreases.\nWhen its HP falls beneath a certain amount, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nWater Element\nResistance\nSlash Element\nBlunt Element\nFire Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nCritical\nDamage\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Increase Attack\", \"Critical resistance\",\"Reduces damage\" and \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Debility\", \"Frostbite\" and \"Petrify\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Skill Break: By completely lowering the Skill Break Gauge, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all of its buff effects will be removed.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nBoss Appearing\nDifficulty\nBoss Name\nWeakness\nObtainable Chaos Crystals\nChaos Showdown 90\nDark Black Thunder Bull\nSlash Element\n・\nWind Element\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 95\nDark Black False Statue\nThrust Element\n・\nFire Element\nAmber Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 110\nDark Black Frozen Evil\nBlunt Element\n・\nDark Element\nTopaz Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 135\nDark Black Griffin\nThrust Element\n・\nWater Element\nEmerald Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 155\nDark Black Half Beast\nThrust Element\n・\nEarth Element\nSapphire Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 175\nDark Black Crossgigas\nSlash Element\n・\nHoly Element\nIndigo Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 195\nDark Black Butterfly\nBlunt Element\n・\nWind Element\nAmethyst Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 215\nDark Black Sea Snake\nBlunt Element\n・\nHoly Element\nQuartz Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 235\nDark Black Hundred Arms\nThrust Element\n・\nWater Element\nRose Quartz Chaos Crystal\n\"Dark Black Series\" equipment can be produced at the Workshop using Chaos Crystals and production materials dropped from the boss.\nEach \"Chaos Crystal\" can be obtained by collecting the correlating \"Crystal Shards\" and using them for production.\nDark Black Series List\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black Thunder Bull Armor\n816\n12210\nLv.90\nDark Black Thunder Bull Greaves\n670\n8547\nLv.90\nDark Black False Statue Armor\n866\n12810\nLv.95\nDark Black False Statue Greaves\n710\n8967\nLv.95\nDark Black Frozen Evil Armor\n917\n14010\nLv.110\nDark Black Frozen Evil Greaves\n752\n9807\nLv.110\nDark Black Griffin Armor\n1257\n20190\nLv.135\nDark Black Griffin Greaves\n1031\n14133\nLv.135\nDark Black Half Beast Armor\n1358\n21990\nLv.155\nDark Black Half Beast Greaves\n1114\n15393\nLv.155\nDark Black Crossgigas Armor\n1460\n24400\nLv.175\nDark Black Crossgigas Greaves\n1197\n16303\nLv.175\nDark Black Butterfly Armor\n1563\n26850\nLv.195\nDark Black Butterfly Greaves\n1282\n17253\nLv.195\nDark Black Sea Snake Armor\n1667\n29350\nLv.215\nDark Black Sea Snake Greaves\n1367\n18253\nLv.215\nDark Black Hundred Arms Armor[NEW!]\n1772\n31900\nLv.235\nDark Black Hundred Arms Greaves[NEW!]\n1453\n19303\nLv.235\nRandom Bonus\nThe value and type of the Dark Black Series bonus are random.\nExample: Equippable Lv. 235 Dark Black Series\nStatus\nUpper\nLower\nAttack\n30\n30\nDefense\n90\n50\nHP\n2500\n4500\nExample: If three types of defenses are given to Dark Black Hundred Arms Armor, defense will increase by 270 total.\n* Succession cannot be used for the Dark Black Series.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end\nAccept it from the \"Chaos Showdown\" NPC at the \"Blackiron Palace\".\nImportant\n\"Chaos Showdown\" 175, 195, 215 and 235 difficulties are solo only.\nChaos Showdown is a permanent dungeon where the boss changes approximately every two weeks. The rotation will start over again after six weeks.\nYour score reward and challenge reward information will not reset when each dungeon returns.\nCheck the game for details about the rewards of each dungeon.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
