    "full_details": "Notices\n[3/14 15:45 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] Notice for maintenance(3/13)\nMAINT.\n2024-03-14 15:45:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 3/13, 2024, 12:00, was completed on 3/13, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Alicization Boss Rush\" begins\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 45 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"White Day Assault 2024\"\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 6x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary Stage Takeover Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n\"A Head Start Step-Up Order\" update\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nModified to allow for multiple Skill Record Limit Breaks at once.\nModified to allow producing multiple rings at once.\n* Rings that are locked will not be used for production materials. Please protect any rings you do not want to be included in production materials by locking them.\n[3/14 15:45 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nThis function will target Ring I, which is necessary material for the production of Ring II, in a batch.\nBatch production for Ring III is scheduled for the end of April 2024.\n* Please note that this schedule is subject to change.\nChanged the color of marks indicating NPCs in the minimap to white.\nAdded 1 new hairstyle and 1 new hair color.\n* The hairstyle is only for female characters.\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where a white effect sometimes remained when using a Full Burst Skill after switch.\nFixed an issue where production results were not being displayed.\nFixed an issue where characters were unable to move on some 17F fields.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n3/13, 2024 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 45 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"White Day Assault 2024\"\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 6x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\nNew Event begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 3/13 Maintenance\n\"Ordinal Scale Immortal Fragments\"\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Heapin' 30M EXP Event\"\n\"Mythical Style Selection Order\"\n\"Ordinal Scale Avatar Order\"\n\"A Head Start Order\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
