    "full_details": "Notices\nOnly available for 72 hours after starting the game! The \"A Head Start Step-Up Order\" is here!\nShop\n2024-03-13 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOnly available for 72 hours after starting the game!\nGet ★4 Skill Records guaranteed at the \"\nA Head Start Step-Up Order\n\"!\nAll ★4 Skills are 1H Sword Sword Skills, highly usable from the very start of the game!\nSTEP1: Get 1 ★4 Skill Record guaranteed for\n250 Arcana Gems!\nSTEP2:\nGet 1 ★4 Kirito guaranteed\nfor\n1,250 Arcana Gems!\nSTEP3:\nGet 1 ★4 Alice guaranteed!\nSTEP4:\nGet 1 ★4 Yuuki guaranteed!\nAnd STEP5:\nGet\n2\n★4 Kirito guaranteed!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Confronting the Subspace] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nBurning Square\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1650% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Blaze 4/Buff] Attack +20 per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Blaze 4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Attack +20 per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Unmatched Domain] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSP Cost\n14\nElement\nSlash\nSkill Cool Time\n26.0\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n98\nSkill Effect\n1510% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Toukou 5/Buff] -50% damage taken for 4 sec.(Invalid when equipped by Partner)/▲▲[Bonus] Attack rises 150 x the number of Yuuki Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] Damage +30% to enemies when using a non-elemental skill.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Unstoppable Drive] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFragrant Olive Blast\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n13.0\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n17\nSkill Effect\n1040% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Holy Light Demon 3/Buff] Holy element damage +45% for 8 sec./[Weak Defense 4/Debuff] Enemy defense -30% for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n250 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\nSTEP2\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nGet 1 ★4 Kirito guaranteed!\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nGet 1 ★4 Alice guaranteed!\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nGet 1 ★4 Yuuki guaranteed!\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nGet\n2\n★4 Kirito guaranteed!\n- Important\nThe \"A Head Start Step-Up Order\" is only available for 72 hours after starting the game (after creating the account).\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe lineup has been renewed as of the March 13, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n* The Step number from before the renewal has been reset.\nGo to Notice List"
