    "snippet": "培養地下城來幫助促進角色成長！ 「與艾基爾一起的快樂地下城」來了！獲得阿基爾印章和阿卡納寶石，慶祝該角色的生日！獎勵「阿卡納寶石」和限量版「阿基爾」印章作為獎勵。活動期間每天通關地下城即可獲得獎勵。",
    "full_details": "Notices\n【Raising Dungeon】\"Happy Dungeon with Agil\" is here! Get the Agil stamp and Arcana Gems!\nEVENT\n2024-03-08 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\n\"Happy Dungeon with Agil\" is here! Get the Agil stamp and Arcana Gems in celebration of this character's birthday!\nRewards\n\"Arcana Gems\" and a\nlimited-edition \"Agil\" stamp\nare available as rewards.\nClear the dungeon every day during the event to get up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n.\nPeriod\nMarch 8, 2024 (Fri) 4:00 - March 15, 2024 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nAgil's Party Bazooka\nMonster\nCrabby Mimic/Hard Mimic\nDetails(All ｍimic are common)\nWatch out for its scratches and bites.\nWeakness(All ｍimic are common)\nBlunt Element\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nArcana Gem\n50\n200\nArcana Gem\n50\n300\nArcana Gem\n50\n400\nArcana Gem\n100\n500\nArcana Gem\n50\n600\nArcana Gem\n50\n700\nArcana Gem\n50\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nMemory Stamp 269\nUse to obtain the \"Agil's Party Bazooka\" stamp.\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nArcana Gem\n50\nCompleted within 1 minutes\nArcana Gem\n50\nImportant\nCleared dungeons will be reset the following day at 4:00am (JST/UTC+9) and can be re-attempted after that.\nThis is a solo event that you can challenge with Agil as your partner.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
