    "full_details": "Notices\nHigh difficulty \"Chaos Showdown\" updated! Get your hands on the powerful Dark Black Series armor!\nEVENT\n2024-02-07 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe high-difficulty dungeon, \"Chaos Showdown\", has been updated!\nGet the powerful \"Dark Black Series\" armor!\nThe following difficulty levels are open to parties!\nTake on Chaos Showdown 90 difficulty to get Dark Black King, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 90.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 95 difficulty to get Dark Black Sea Horse, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 95.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 110 difficulty to get Dark Black Colossal, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 110.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 135 difficulty to get Dark Black Snake Samurai, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 135.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 155 difficulty to get Dark Black Blazing, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 155.\nDungeon Duration\nFebruary 7, 2024 (Wed) 14:00 - February 21, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBoss Appearing\nDifficulty\nBoss Name\nWeakness\nChaos Showdown 90\nDark Black King\nBlunt Element\nChaos Showdown 95\nDark Black Sea Horse\nThrust Element\n・\nEarth Element\nChaos Showdown 110\nDark Black Colossal\nThrust Element\n・\nHoly Element\nChaos Showdown 135\nDark Black Snake Samurai\nSlash Element\n・\nWind Element\nChaos Showdown 155\nDark Black Blazing\nSlash Element\n・\nDark Element\nChaos Showdown 175\nDark Black Asura\nBlunt Element\n・\nWater Element\nChaos Showdown 195\nDark Black Warden\nThrust Element\n・\nDark Element\nChaos Showdown 215\nDark Black White Wyrm\nSlash Element\n・\nWater Element\n\"Dark Black Series\" equipment can be produced at the Workshop using production materials dropped from the boss.\nDark Black Series List\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black King Armor\n816\n12210\nLv.90\nDark Black King Greaves\n670\n8547\nLv.90\nDark Black Sea Horse Armor\n866\n12810\nLv.95\nDark Black Sea Horse Greaves\n710\n8967\nLv.95\nDark Black Colossal Armor\n917\n14010\nLv.110\nDark Black Colossal Greaves\n752\n9807\nLv.110\nDark Black Snake Samurai Armor\n1257\n20190\nLv.135\nDark Black Snake Samurai Greaves\n1031\n14133\nLv.135\nDark Black Blazing Armor\n1358\n21990\nLv.155\nDark Black Blazing Greaves\n1114\n15393\nLv.155\nDark Black Asura Armor\n1460\n24400\nLv.175\nDark Black Asura Greaves\n1197\n16303\nLv.175\nDark Black Warden Armor\n1563\n26850\nLv.195\nDark Black Warden Greaves\n1282\n17253\nLv.195\nDark Black White Wyrm Armor\n1667\n29350\nLv.215\nDark Black White Wyrm Greaves\n1367\n18253\nLv.215\nRandom Bonus\nThe value and type of the Dark Black Series bonus are random.\nStatus\nDark Black White Wyrm Armor\nDark Black White Wyrm Greaves\nAttack\n30\n30\nDefense\n80\n50\nHP\n2500\n4000\nExample: If three types of defenses are given to Dark Black White Wyrm Armor, defense will increase by 240 total.\n* Succession cannot be used for the Dark Black Series.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end\nAccept it from the \"Chaos Showdown\" NPC at the \"Blackiron Palace\".\nRewards\nThe following items can be obtained from score rewards, challenge rewards, and achievement rewards.\nDungeon\nRewards\nChaos Showdown 90 \"Dark Black King\"\nCrimson Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 95 \"Dark Black Sea Horse\"\nAmber Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 110 \"Dark Black Colossal\"\nTopaz Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 135 \"Dark Black Snake Samurai\"\nEmerald Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 155 \"Dark Black Blazing\"\nSapphire Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 175 \"Dark Black Asura\"\nIndigo Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 195 \"Dark Black Warden\"\nAmethyst Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 215 \"Dark Black White Wyrm\"\nQuartz Crystal Shard\nCheck in-game for more details on the rewards.\nImportant\n\"Chaos Showdown\" 175, 195, and 215 difficulties are solo only.\nChaos Showdown is a permanent dungeon where the boss changes approximately every two weeks. The rotation will start over again after six weeks.\nYour score reward and challenge reward information will not reset when each dungeon returns.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
