    "full_details": "Notices\n[20-Hours Only] A Christmas present for you! A ★4 Guaranteed Free 11x Order is here!\nShop\n2023-12-25 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nA surprise Christmas present!\nFor 20 hours only, everyone will have one try at the \"\n★4 Guaranteed Free 11x Order\n\"!\nOne ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Caroller of Joy] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nWeakness Attack/Swift Switch/Counter\nAttack\n67\nDefense\n38\nHP\n1675\nSkill Effect\n[Weakness Attack 3] Critical damage +12%./[Swift Switch 5] For 5 sec, -50% damage taken and +50% evasion rate when you hit using switch. *It will not be activated with focus attack. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)/[Counter 5] Adds a buff when evading, +30% critical rate for 8 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSecret of the Legendary Sword\n[When Rush Activates]Extends the effect of Rush by 5 sec.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Release of Power] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nBlaze Swipe\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1110% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack against burned enemies increases 30%./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[A Will to Carry On] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHydro Reap\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1420% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces all skill's cool times by 3 → 6 → 9 sec when hitting with skills.\n★4[Talented Guardian] Koharu\nSkill Name\nBattle Experience/Evasion\nAttack\n63\nDefense\n20\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n●[Battle Experience 4] Additional damage according to number of HITs when you attack./[Evasion 4] Evasion rate +10%. *It will not be activated with focus attack.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Golden Flower Protection] Alice\nSkill Name\nFlash Blade/ Break Attack\nAttack\n45\nDefense\n54\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Flash Blade 4] Critical rate for normal attack's +35%./[Break Attack 4] Attack +35% to enemies when using break.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nDecember 25, 2023 (Mon) 4:00 - December 25, 2023 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\nThis 11 Order can only be used once per player.\nThere is no single Order.\nIncludes ★2–★4 Skill Records.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
