    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] The Guild Joining Campaign is on now! Get awakening material by joining a guild!\nCampaign\n2023-12-20 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nSupport a guild! Join a guild and earn a Joining Bonus together with everyone!\nThe\n\"Guild Joining Campaign\"\nis on now!\nIt's a great opportunity to join a guild or recruit new members.\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the December 20, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 11, 2024 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nGuild Joining Bonus\nThe Guild Joining Bonus will improve based on the number of members in your guild.\nNumber of Guild Members\nJoining Bonus\n30\nAwakening Star×50\nGreat Red Jewel×15\nGreat Green Jewel×15\nGreat Yellow Jewel×15\nGreat Blue Jewel×15\n20-29\nAwakening Star×35\nGreat Red Jewel×10\nGreat Green Jewel×10\nGreat Yellow Jewel×10\nGreat Blue Jewel×10\n10-19\nAwakening Star×20\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\n1-9\nAwakening Star×10\nDistribution of Guild Joining Bonus\nThe relevant bonus will be sent to everyone who belongs to a guild at the time of the January 11, 2024 (Thu) maintenance.\n* We plan to distribute the bonuses after the January 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nGuilds\nGuilds can be created and joined through the \"Guild Counter\" NPC.\nYou can gain the benefits of Guild Skills that will help in your journeys, such as increased item drop rates and increased Weapon Proficiency acquisition by joining a guild and increasing its Guild Level.\nPlayers who belong to guilds can also use Guild Raid buffs acquirable from Guild Level 16 to help with Guild Events.\nPlease see below for more details on guilds.\nCreating a Guild\nGuild Skills\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nYou will not be able to receive the bonus if your request to join a guild is still processing or if you have been kicked out of a guild by the Campaign deadline.\nWe cannot answer individual questions about guilds or guild members. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
