    "snippet": "桐人、莉法、幸、三亞在全新的★4技能紀錄中齊聚一堂，共度雪夜祭典！ 「白色聖誕令」來了！保證在步驟 5 獲得一項新的 ★4 技能記錄！新的 ★4 技能記錄的加價！在第 1 步，您可以獲得 11 個訂單，價值 1,250 顆奧秘寶石！一張 ★4 技能記錄...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"White Christmas Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-12-13 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Leafa, Sachi, and Sanya have gathered for a snowy evening festival in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nWhite Christmas Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[A Feast of Meat & Cake] Kirito\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nEarth Turbine Burst\nSkill Name\nEarth Turbine\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n32\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→\nEarth\n→Blunt→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n68\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1360% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Earth Force 4/Buff] Earth element damage +15% for 15 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n3810% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Earth Force 5/Buff(PT)] Earth element damage +20% for you and your party for 15 sec.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP32)\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Before the Sun Comes Up] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nMoon Smash\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1820% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Small]/[Gust 4/Buff]When equipping 2 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, attack +45% for 5 sec./[Sky Talisman 4/Buff] Thrust element damage -80% to enemies for 15 sec./[Human Talisman 4/Buff] Slash element damage -80% to enemies for 15 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[A Prayer to Light the Tree] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nNight Bouncer\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n76\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n1890% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Stigma/Debuff] Increases damage taken by enemies for 18 sec (Stack 3) +0.5% for every Stack 1./[Stigma/Debuff] When the target is hit using the Switch, increases damage taken by enemies for 18 sec (Stack 9) +0.5% for every Stack 1.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Beaming Stars & Smiles] Sanya\nSkill Name\nSuper Enhance Heal/Play it by Ear\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n44\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Super Enhance Heal] Effect of healing items and field objects +100%./[Play it by Ear 5] Attack +25% when HP is above 50%, and defense +15% when HP is under 50%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n\"[Before the Sun Comes Up] Leafa\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the December 13, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 11, 2024 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
