    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Santa Claus in Blue Decline\" is back! Get \"Sanya's\" Limited-edition Stamp!\nEVENT\n2023-12-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"Santa Claus in Blue Decline\" is back!\nThe Scenario Event \"Santa Claus in Blue Decline\"\n\"Kirito\" and his friends visit the Christmas plaza.\nIn the midst of the festivities, a sudden snowstorm inflicts everyone with a DoT that begins to slowly sap their HP.\nRewards\nGather \"Yolka Ornament\", tradable items acquired as event rewards and drops, and exchange them at the Trader for\n\"Sanya's\"\nLimited-edition Stamp!\nThe \"Mysterious Sounding Bell\", which increases the attack of party members in the same field, also drops in the dungeon!\nLimited Items\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nMysterious Sounding Bell\nRaises the ATK of party members in the same field by 3% for 3 min.\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nXmas with Sanya\nTrade \"Yolka Ornament\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemory Stamp 154\nUse to obtain the \"Xmas with Sanya\" stamp.\n50\n1\nAwakening Star\n20\n75\nLife Potion\n5\n20\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n15\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n15\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n15\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n15\nTrader\nSee each Trader NPC for more info, or go to Menu > Items > Enhance:Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the \"Trade Yolka Ornament\" banner.\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Entry\", \"Interior\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\", and \"Special\" difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nThe score earned in \"Extreme\" difficulty is not added to the \"Total Score Reward\", but you will receive rewards based on your score.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score\nEntry\nBasic Clear Bonus:24P＋Survival Bonus: 1P per surviving player\n30\nInterior\nBasic Clear Bonus:74P＋Survival Bonus: 1P per surviving player\n80\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:170P＋Survival Bonus: 5P per surviving player\n200\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:420P＋Survival Bonus: 10P per surviving player\n480\nSpecial\nBasic Clear Bonus:1880P＋Survival Bonus: 20P per surviving player\n2000\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus:1000P＋Survival Bonus: 20P per surviving player\n1120\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join Special and Extreme difficulty Quick Parties.\nSpecial: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nExtreme: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\n\"\nSpecial\n\"\nYou can get a high score in the \"\nSpecial\n\" difficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the \"\nSpecial\n\" 3 times per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nHigh difficulty \"\nExtreme\n\"\nYou can clear the \"\nExtreme\n\" one time per day.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the December 6, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×900\nMedal of Combat Arts×4\nAwakening Star×25\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\nMemoria Niter S×10\n\"Extreme\" Score Rewards\nExtreme\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n1000\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n2000\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n3000\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n4000\nMemoria Niter S\n3\n5000\nMemoria Niter S\n3\n6000\nMemoria Niter S\n3\n7000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n8000\nMartial Arts Text\n1\n9000\nRecord Frame L\n20\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nC-Cold!\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Yolka Ornaments in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×1\nСнегурочка\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Yolka Ornaments in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×2\nXmas forever!\nLet's collect a total of 9999 Yolka Ornaments in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×3\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Asuna\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 4 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the December 6, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 11, 2024 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nChyskhaan\nDetails\nIts main attack inflicts \"Frostbite\".\nIt has a mist that inflicts \"Poison\", and on \"Special\" and \"Extreme\" difficulties, this poisonous mist will inflict the more powerful \"Fatal Poison\".\nOn \"Extreme\" difficulty, its bell ringing attack that inflicts \"Curse\" will also add a debuff that makes you \"Seal item\".\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Frostbite\", \"Poison\", \"Fatal Poison\" and \"Curse\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nIf you have previously played the \"Santa Claus in Blue Decline\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAchievements and achievement progress\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\nAfter you clear a \"Special\" difficulty dungeon three times, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nAfter you clear a \"Extreme\" difficulty dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nItem use inside the \"Extreme\" difficulty dungeon is restricted, and Revive Crystals can only be used once.\n\"Yolka Ornaments\" and \"Mysterious Sounding Bells\" will be deleted on January 17, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
