    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Comeback Login Bonus\" is here!\nCampaign\n2023-11-16 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nWe will be offering a Comeback Login Bonus for a total of 7 days for users who have not logged in to the game for 30 days or more.\nIf you log in for a total of 7 days during the event period, you will receive\n2,500\nArcana Gems for one 11x Order, as well as\n560\nRecord Frames L that can enhance eight ★4 Skill Records to level 70!\nIn addition, you can obtain rewards that will help you progress through the game, such as 200 Revive Crystals, 1,000 Restorative Potions, and 700,000 Col.\nPeriod\nNovember 16, 2023 (Thu) 4:00 - December 7, 2023 (Thu) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nApplicable Players\nUsers who have not logged in for 30 days or more since their last login\nReward Details\nNumber of Days Logged In\nReward\nAmount\nDay1\nRevive Crystal\nRecord Frame L\nSaleable Col Bag\n100\n80\n1\nDay2\nArcana Gems\nRecord Frame L\nSaleable Col Bag\n250\n80\n1\nDay3\nArcana Gems\nRecord Frame L\nSaleable Col Bag\n1000\n80\n1\nDay4\nArcana Gems\nRecord Frame L\nSaleable Col Bag\n250\n80\n1\nDay5\nRestorative Potion\nRecord Frame L\nSaleable Col Bag\n1000\n80\n1\nDay6\nRevive Crystal\nRecord Frame L\nSaleable Col Bag\n100\n80\n1\nDay7\nArcana Gems\nRecord Frame L\nSaleable Col Bag\n1000\n80\n1\n* A Sellable Col Bag can be sold for 100,000 Col at the merchant.\nBy selling all seven that are available, you will earn 700,000 Col.\nImportant\nYou can receive the login bonus after completing the quest \"The Indomitable Fang\".\nDaily distribution time will be from 4:00 AM to 3:59 AM of the next day. (JST/UTC+9)\nPlease note that the distribution date does not switch when the date changes.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
