    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Strea's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Strea!\nShop\n2023-11-06 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Strea's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Fun Theme Park] Strea\n(Accele Skill)\" and \"\n[Signs of an Unclear Future] Strea\n(Connect Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nStrea's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Strea guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Strea\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Fun Theme Park] Strea\nSkill Name\nCombination/Spiceholic\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Combination 5] Skill's power is added +150% when used in switch./[Spiceholic 3] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Signs of an Unclear Future] Strea\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShadow Punishment\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nBreak Gauge\n59\nSkill Effect\n1790% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using dark skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Dark element damage +50% → 100% → 150%.\n\"[Signs of an Unclear Future] Strea\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nNovember 6, 2023 (Mon) 0:00 - November 15, 2023 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Strea\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Strea\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThere is no voice production when the Accele Skill \"[Fun Theme Park] Strea\" is drawn.\nThere is no voice production when the Connect Skill \"[Signs of an Unclear Future] Strea\" is drawn.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
