    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Kirito & Asuna's Wedding Anniversary Order\" is here! On Step 5, one new ★4 Kirito or Asuna Skill Record is guaranteed!\nShop\n2023-10-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIn celebration of Kirito and Asuna's wedding anniversary, new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Happy Home] Kirito\n(Connect Skill)\" and \"\n[A Moment with Family] Asuna\n(Burst Skill)\" are here!\n\"\nKirito & Asuna's Wedding Anniversary Order\n\" is on!\nThis order features ★4 Kirito, Asuna, and Yui Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\nOn Step 4 and Step 5, the total drop rate is increased to 2.0% for the featured Skill Records!\nPlus, on Step 5, one new ★4 Kirito or Asuna Skill Record is guaranteed!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Happy Home] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHydro Square\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1760% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Switch gauge rises by 6 x the number of Asuna Skill Records in the same set.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using water skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Yui's Skill Records in the same set, Water element damage +50% → 100% → 150%.\n★4[A Moment with Family] Asuna\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nFire Riot Burst\nSkill Name\nFire Riot\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Thrust→\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n60\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1430% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] fire element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Weakness Attack 4/Buff] When equipping 1 or more of Yui's Skill Records in the same set, critical damage +20% for 15 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4000% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Switch gauge rises by 5 x the number of Kirito Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] Critical rate +1000%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP28)\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Happy Home] Kirito\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nOctober 23, 2023 (Mon) 0:00 - November 5, 2023 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne new ★4 Kirito or Asuna Skill Record is guaranteed!! 2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
