    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] Take on the Colossus Hunt with Mito now! Get a new Mito avatar, and Superior Ingots to use for Equipment Refinement!\nEVENT\n2023-10-22 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary!\nDefeat the Fuscus the Vacant Colossus and get rewards!\nFor every dungeon in this event,\nMito\nwill join you!\nRewards\nIntroducing the new Mito avatar, Outfit of Twilight, as a reward!\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, up to 20\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 200\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\nThis time you can get\nSuperior Ingots\n, which can be used for Equipment Refinement, and Rare Metal Scraps and Superior Metal Scraps, which can be used to produce ingots.\nMore Equipment Refinement Details Here\n\"Star Fragments\" may drop on certain difficulty levels!\nAvatar Images\nTrader Rewards\nExchange the \"Red Colossus Plates\" you obtain from the event at the exclusive Trader to get items.\n\"Blue Colossus Plates\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the October 31, 2023 (Tue) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on November 8, 2023 (Wed).\nTrade \"Red Colossus Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nOutfit of Twilight\n400\n2\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n40\nSuperior Ingot\n75\n15\nRare Metal Scrap\n50\n10\nSuperior Metal Scrap\n25\n50\nMedal of Combat Arts\n150\n4\nAwakening Star\n20\n40\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n10\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n10\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n10\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n10\nTrade \"Blue Colossus Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n10\n30\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n35\nSuperior Ingot\n75\n15\nRare Metal Scrap\n50\n10\nSuperior Metal Scrap\n25\n50\nMedal of Combat Arts\n150\n4\nAwakening Star\n20\n35\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTrader Period\nRed Colossus Plate: October 22, 2023 (Sun) 12:00 - Before the November 22, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nBlue Colossus Plate: Starts after the October 31, 2023 (Tue) maintenance and ends before the November 22, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Entry\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\", \"Gaining Ground\", \"Special\", and \"Extreme\" difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n.\nYour rewards will be based on your score.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score₍This does not include the Special Bonus₎\nEntry\nBasic Clear Bonus:99P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n105\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:299P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n305\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:1185P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n1215\nGaining Ground\nBasic Clear Bonus:3585P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n3615\nSpecial\nBasic Clear Bonus:2940P＋Survival Bonus:10P per surviving player\n3000\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus:4880P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n5000\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join \"Gaining Ground\", \"Special\" and \"Extreme\" difficulty Quick Parties.\nGaining Ground: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nSpecial: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\nExtreme: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 80,000 or higher\n\"\nGaining Ground\n\"\nYou can get a high score in the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" difficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" one time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\n\"\nExtreme\n\"\nItem use inside the \"\nExtreme\n\" difficulty dungeon is restricted, and Revive Crystals can only be used once.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×700\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nMemoria Niter S×100\nSuperior Ingot×10\nSuperior Metal Scrap×120\nRare Metal Scrap×60\nAwakening Star×25\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\nSpecial Bonus\nA Special Bonus will be in effect for the dungeon in this event.\nIf you clear the dungeon with compatible Skill Records equipped, you'll receive a large additional score bonus!\nList of Special Bonus Compatible Skill Records\nSkill Name\nEquipment Type\nSpecial Bonus\nEntry\nDepth\nDANGER\nGaining Ground\nSpecial\nExtreme\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\n★4[Laying It All on This Hit] Mito\nAbility\n20\n40\n60\n120\n240\n480\n600\n1200\n600\n1200\n1000\n2000\n★4[Moment of Determination] Asuna\n1H Rapier\n20\n40\n60\n120\n240\n480\n600\n1200\n600\n1200\n1000\n2000\n★4[Split-Second Hit] Kirito\n1H Sword\n20\n40\n60\n120\n240\n480\n600\n1200\n600\n1200\n1000\n2000\n★4[Decisive Blow] Argo\nDagger\n20\n40\n60\n120\n240\n480\n600\n1200\n600\n1200\n1000\n2000\n★4[Cute Wolf Girl] Asuna\nAbility\n10\n20\n30\n60\n120\n240\n300\n600\n300\n600\n500\n1000\n★4[Ruler of the Blue Seas] Eugeo\n1H Sword\n10\n20\n30\n60\n120\n240\n300\n600\n300\n600\n500\n1000\n★4[Scary Things Are Scary...] Asuna\n1H Rapier\n7\n14\n21\n42\n84\n168\n210\n420\n210\n420\n350\n700\n★4[Combination Play] Koharu\nDagger\n7\n14\n21\n42\n84\n168\n210\n420\n210\n420\n350\n700\n★3[Resolute Swordsman] Nautilus\nAbility\n3\n6\n9\n18\n36\n72\n90\n180\n90\n180\n150\n300\n★3[Brave Fight] Kirito\nAbility\n3\n6\n9\n18\n36\n72\n90\n180\n90\n180\n150\n300\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nCrystal of Technology\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Red Colossus Plate in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nCombat Machine\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Red Colossus Plate in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Event Dungeon\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nOctober 22, 2023 (Sun) 12:00 - Before the November 15, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n* The high-difficulty dungeon Abyss will be implemented after the October 31, 2023 (Tue) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nFuscus the Vacant Colossus\nDetails\nBreaks can be performed.\nOn Special, Extreme, and Abyss difficulties, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nOn DANGER, Gaining Ground, Special, Extreme, and Abyss difficulty levels, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nWater Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Abyss\"difficulty\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nResistance\n* Only \"Abyss\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nBlunt Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Curse\", \"Debility\" and \"Paralysis\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\n* Debility: Lowers max HP with each hit (up to 99%).\nRecover using items like Cleansing Potions.\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nAfter you clear a \"Gaining Ground\" difficulty dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nPlates will be deleted on November 22, 2023 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
