    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(8/30)\nMAINT.\n2023-08-29 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n8/30, 2023 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n[5.5 Year Anniversary] \"Heapin' 20M EXP Event\" begins\n[5.5 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n[5.5 Year Anniversary] \"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\nAdded \"Kada Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Chaos Showdown\" UPDATE\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 8/30 Maintenance\n\"[Returning] Watermelon Panic!\"\n\"[Returning] Bit scary?! Cave Exploration\"\n\"[Returning] Will of Steel to Catch the King\"\n\"Klein's Test of Courage Operation [Returning]\"\n\"2023 Midsummer Fishing Competition\"\nAs the special period for the\n\"Yui, Glow of the Heart\"\nevent will be ending, the conditions for joining will be changed as follows.\nComplete the 91F Main Quest\n*Following maintenance on 8/30, you will be able to progress by meeting the conditions.\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
