    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Seaside Leisure Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-08-04 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Sinon, Asuna, and Lisbeth are all living it up at the midsummer beach here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nSeaside Leisure Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Ocean Runner] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nVertical Water\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n20\nSkill Effect\n1280% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 1./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Breeze Across the Sea] Sinon\nSkill Name\nFive Sharp Weapons/Burning Blow/Hold the Front\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Five Sharp Weapons 3] Attack +800 when attacking with thrust element./[Burning Blow 3] Attack against burned enemies increases 18%./[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Shining Beach Goddess] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nSand Thorn\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n50\nSkill Effect\n1320% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Splash Dive] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nSomersault Water\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n14\nSkill Effect\n1430% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using water skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Silica's Skill Records in the same set, Water element damage +50% → 100% → 150%.\n\"[Ocean Runner] Kirito\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAugust 4, 2023 (Fri) 17:00 - Before the September 6, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
