    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Yui's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Yui!\nShop\n2023-08-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Yui's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Impenetrable Fortress] Yui\n(MOD Skill)\" and \"\n[Together From Here On] Yui\n(Awakening Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nYui's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Yui guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Yui\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Impenetrable Fortress] Yui\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHydro Slant\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n60\nBreak Gauge\n27\nSkill Effect\n1410% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Together From Here On] Yui\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Aqua Conversion/Tactical Advisor\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Aqua Conversion 5] Fire element's damage to enemies -15% and water element's damage to enemies +30%.［Tactical Advisor 4］ When equipping 2 or more of Yui's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nAugust 1, 2023 (Tue) 0:00 - August 10, 2023 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Yui\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Yui\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
