    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] The \"Free Once Daily 100% Agil Order\" is on!\nShop\n2023-07-12 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary!\nEvery Agil that's appeared in an Order until 2020 is included in the lineup!\nGet a free Order each day with the \"\nFree Once Daily 100% Agil Order\n\"!\nThe Free Once Daily 100% Agil  Order will reset every day at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9). You can get one Order a day!\n- Event Period\nStarts after the July 12, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 2, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Important\n·During this event, players will be able to try once every day.\n·New days begin at 4:00am every day (JST/UTC+9).\n·Includes ★2–★4 Agil Skill Records.\n·Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nGo to Notice List"
