    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] The \"Discovery! Riddle Quest\" is here!\nEVENT\n2023-07-12 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary!\nUse hints to guess the next destination and discover the treasure box!\nThe \"Discovery! Riddle Quest\" is on now.\nIn the \"Discovery! Riddle Quest\", use the on-screen hints to get to your destination.\nOnce you've arrived, new hints will appear to help you get to the next one.\nComplete the quest by reaching the final destination and finding the treasure box.\nIf you lose track of the hints along the way, you can check them at any time by tapping \"Show hint\" on the quest details screen.\nQuest Reward\nArcana Gems×100\n1,000,000Col\nEXP 3,000,000\nMemory Stamp 236\nMemory Stamp 236\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nGAME PROJECT 10th!\nAchievement Rewards\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nDiscovery! Twilight Getaway\nClear the [Riddle] Twilight Getaway\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Male Minstrel\" NPC at the Teleport Gate Plaza to accept the quest.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the July 12, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 26, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete 1F (Main Quest \"Labyrinth Strategy\")\n* We recommend progressing through the main quest so that you have access to each floor.\nImportant\nThe \"Discovery! Riddle Quest\" is a 1x Only quest.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
