    "full_details": "Notices\n[24-Hours Only] Sword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary! A ★4 Guaranteed Free 11x Order is here!\nShop\n2023-07-07 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n24-hours only! Available once per player!\nIn celebration of the Sword Art Online game series' 10th anniversary, we're offering a ★4 Guaranteed Free 11x Order!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Release of Power] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nBlaze Swipe\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1110% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack against burned enemies increases 30%./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Glimmering Flash] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHydro Nova\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1150% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack against enemies with Frostbite increases 30%./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Piercing Hero] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFull-Flamed Savage\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n9.0\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n900% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch guage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[One and Only Flash] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHydro Hit\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n28\nBreak Gauge\n18\nSkill Effect\n880% damage (All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Precise Attack 4/Buff] Critical rate +25% for 15 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nJuly 7, 2023 (Fri) 0:00 - July 7, 2023 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\nThis 11 Order can only be used once per player.\nThere is no single Order.\nIncludes ★2–★4 Skill Records.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
