    "full_details": "Notices\n[2000+ Days Anniversary] Get up to 2,000 Arcana Gems! The Memorial Dungeon is here!\nEVENT\n2023-05-22 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIt's been 2,000 days since SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor was released in Japan!\nA special dungeon where you can get up to\n2,000 Arcana Gems\nis here!\nClear it once per day to get Arcana Gems daily!\n* Can be cleared up to nine days total.\n▼Event Period\nMay 22, 2023 (Mon) 4:00 (JST/UTC+9) - Before the May 31, 2023 (Wed) Maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nScore Rewards\nMemorial Dungeon\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nArcana Gems\n200\n200\nArcana Gems\n200\n300\nArcana Gems\n200\n400\nArcana Gems\n200\n500\nArcana Gems\n200\n600\nArcana Gems\n200\n700\nArcana Gems\n200\n800\nArcana Gems\n200\n900\nArcana Gems\n200\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nRewards\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nCol\n2000\nCompleted without any tumble\nArcana Gems\n100\nCompleted within 1 minutes\nArcana Gems\n100\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Anniversary Dungeon\" NPC at the \"Memorial Dungeon\" to challenge the dungeon.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nBoss Monster\nGreat Golden Spirit\nDetails\nIt will bite and charge at you.\nWeakness\nBlunt Element\nImportant\nThe dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
