    "full_details": "Notices\nCountdown to 2,000 days since release! The Up to 110 Free Orders event is on now!\nShop\n2023-05-12 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCountdown to 2,000 days since SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor was released in Japan!\n\"\nUp to 110 Free Orders\n\" is here! Get up to 110 Skill Records!\nDuring the \"\nUp to 110 Free Orders\n\", one free 11x Order will be available every day. Players can take advantage of this for up to 10 days!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Release of Power] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nBlaze Swipe\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1110% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack against burned enemies increases 30%./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Light that Purifies Chaos] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHydro Shower\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n105\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n1650% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Ultimate Light 4/Buff] Own critical rate raises, and reduces the next damage taken (Stack 5) during 20 sec.Critical rate +1% per stack, and reduces the next damage taken by -1% per stack.Each effects will be removed by taking damage./[Ultimate Light 4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Own critical rate raises, and reduces the next damage taken (Stack 15) during 20 sec.Critical rate +1% per stack, and reduces the next damage taken by -1% per stack.Each effects will be removed by taking damage.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Far-Flying Arrow] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nAtmos Rain\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n19\nSkill Effect\n1410% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Target Location/Arc/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Less likely to attract aggro from enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRaises 3 → 6 → 9 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself when hitting with skills.\n- Period\nMay 12, 2023 (Fri) 4:00 - June 1, 2023 (Thu) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\nDuring this event, players will receive one free 11x Order per day for up to 10 days total.\nThere is no single Order.\nNew days begin at 4:00 am every day (JST/UTC+9).\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
