    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Discovery! Riddle Quest\" is here!\nEVENT\n2023-04-19 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nUse hints to guess the next destination and discover the treasure box!\nThe \"Discovery! Riddle Quest\" is on now.\nIn the \"Discovery! Riddle Quest\", use the on-screen hints to get to your destination.\nOnce you've arrived, new hints will appear to help you get to the next one.\nComplete the quest by reaching the final destination and finding the treasure box.\nIf you lose track of the hints along the way, you can check them at any time by tapping \"Show hint\" on the quest details screen.\nQuest Reward\nArcana Gems×100\n1,000,000Col\nEXP 3,000,000\nRestorative Crystal×5\nRevive Crystal×30\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nDiscovery! Minstrel Tale\nClear the [Riddle] Minstrel Tale\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Male Minstrel\" NPC at the Teleport Gate Plaza to accept the quest.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the April 19, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 10, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\n* We recommend progressing through the main quest so that you have access to each floor.\nImportant\nThe \"Discovery! Riddle Quest\" is a 1x Only quest.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
