    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Leafa's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Leafa!\nShop\n2023-04-19 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Leafa's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Sweet Castle] Leafa\n(Burst Skill)\" and \"\n[Aggressive Dropkick] Leafa\n(Awakening Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nLeafa's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Leafa guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Leafa\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sweet Castle] Leafa\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nPhoton Punishment Burst\nSkill Name\nPhoton Punishment\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nHoly\n→Slash→\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n28.0\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nBreak Gauge\n59\nBreak Gauge\n118\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1450% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Holy Element Enhance4/Buff] Holy element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4060% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Restore 12000 HP when hitting with this skill.\n* Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP28)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Aggressive Dropkick] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHydro Judgement\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n13.0\nSwitch Gauge\n53\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1470% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Qigong 3/Buff] Slowly recovering its own HP for 30 sec. Recover 50/3 sec per stack (Stack 6)./[Tough 4/Buff] Flinch resist +100% for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nApril 19, 2023 (Wed) 0:00 - April 28, 2023 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Leafa\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Leafa\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
