    "full_details": "Notices\nAbout modifications to some skill names\nNOTICES\n2023-04-05 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nDuring April 5, 2023 (Wed) maintenance, the names of some skills were modified.\nModified content\nAlong with the addition of the new \"Skill Releaser\" feature, we have modified the names of some skills, as they were different from what was intended.\nNo changes have been made to the effects of modified skills.\nRelevant Skill Records\nSkill name before modification\nSkill name after modification\n[Firm Will] Kirito\nRecoiling wind\nWind Recoil\n[Passion Attack] Alice\nRecoiling Heart\nHeart Recoil\n[Black Lily Flash] Asuna\n* Before Transformation\nRepost\nRiposte\n[Heavy Attacker] Agil\nWhirlwind\nWhirl Wind\n[Be Brave] Sachi\nEdgefall\nEdge Fall\n[To Live] Sinon\nBlast Shot\nBlast-Shot\n[Tireless Bow] Deusolbert\nFlame Blast Shot\nFlame Blast-Shot\n[Spring Maiden] Sinon\nRock Blast Shot\nRock Blast-Shot\n[Spring Maiden] Sinon\nRock Blast Shot Burst\nRock Blast-Shot Burst\n[Lady Fox] Sinon\nDark Blast Shot\nDark Blast-Shot\n[Black-Winged Sniper] Sinon\nShine Blast Shot\nShine Blast-Shot\n[Unexpectedly Big Catch] Sinon\nHydro Blast Shot\nHydro Blast-Shot\nWe will continue to  make modifications while considering the circumstances of our customers.\nWe hope you continue to enjoy \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nGo to Notice List"
