    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Young Heroes Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-04-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Asuna, Yuuki, and Leafa are kindergarteners in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nYoung Heroes Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[I'll Protect You!] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSharpened Light\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1650% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Off on an Adventure!] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nRapid Shine\nSP Cost\n45\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n1410% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Poison/Status Ailments] Inflict Poison (Stack 1) for 30 sec. Also, the following effects will be added when equipping 3 or more Yuuki Skill Records in the same set./[Bleed/Status Ailments] Inflict Bleed (Stack 1) for 30 sec./[Burn/Status Ailments] Inflict burn (Stack 1) for 30 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] Inflict Frostbite (Stack 1) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nIncrease status ailment stacks by 5 → 10 → 15 on enemies.\n★4[Hiking on a Sunny Day] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHydro Pain\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1390% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] Own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 3).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Free Drawing] Leafa\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Shine Boost/Switching to Melee\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Shine Boost 4] Elemental damage other than holy dealt to enemies -50%, and holy element's damage to enemies +40%./[Switching to Melee 4] Attack +20% when not equipping any Sinon's Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nApril 1, 2023 (Sat) 0:00 - April 30, 2023 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
