    "snippet": "[3/8 13:00 (JST/UTC+9) 更新] 2023年3月8日（週三）維護期間，新增「藍色公會戰略板塊」作為掉落物。還添加了成就獎勵和商人獎勵項目。用「藍色公會戰略盤」兌換追加物品。  新增物品 可交易物品清單 需要數量 交易限額 記憶體...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[3/8 13:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] \"Event rewards\" Added!【5 Year Anniversary】\"Guild Strategy Event  Millennium Woods\" is here! Get the \"Guild Durun Head\" accessory avatar!\nEVENT\n2023-03-08 13:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[3/8 13:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\n\"Blue Guild Strategy Plate\" were added as drops during the March 8, 2023 (Wed) maintenance.\nAchievement rewards and Trader reward items were also added.\nExchange \"Blue Guild Strategy Plate\" for the added items.\nAdded Items\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n350\n5\nMedal of Combat Arts\n350\n5\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nRelease Crystal (M)\n100\n5\nRelease Crystal (S)\n30\n30\nRestorative Potion\n1\n100\nLife Potion\n5\n20\nHealing Crystal\n5\n20\nCleansing Potion\n3\n15\nRevive Crystal\n5\n30\nRecord Frame L\n3\n30\nGlare Dragon Stone\n3\n30\n10,000Col\n3\n120\n* \"Blue Guild Strategy Plates\" will be deleted on April 5, 2023 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nTrader Period\nBlue Guild Strategy Plate:Starts after the March 8, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 5, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nWolf Pack Strategy Guild\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Blue Guild Strategy Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\n-----------------------------\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 5 Year Anniversary!\nWe will be holding the \"Guild Strategy Event  Millennium Woods\", where you can take on the \"Millennium Woods\" raid boss dungeon.\nAttempt it with up to 30 guild members!\nRewards\nCollect the Red Guild Strategy Plates you obtain from drops, and exchange them at the exclusive Trader for the \"Guild Durun Head\", an accessory avatar that comes with a guild icon.\n\"Blue Guild Strategy Plates\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the March 8, 2023 (Wed) maintenance.\nGet up to 75\n\"Awakening Star\"\n, up to 15\n\"Medal of Unity\"\n, up to 20\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 150\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\nEvery player will receive their own Total Score and challenge rewards if they clear it.\nThere's a chance that Star Fragments will drop on all difficulties.\nAvatar\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nGuild Durun Head A\nAccessory Avatar\nGuild Durun Head B\nAccessory Avatar\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nThe \"Guild Event Extreme Battle Badge\" item is a challenge reward on \"\nExtreme\n\" difficulty.\nObtain 30 of these items by repeating the challenge, and you'll earn the \"\nThose Who Show Unity\n\" record and Revive Crystals as achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nMW Strategy Guild\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Red Guild Strategy Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nThose Who Show Unity\nLet's collect a total of 30 Guild Event Extreme Battle Badge\nRevive Crystal×1\nRecord Background\nTrade \"Red Guild Strategy Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nGuild Durun Head A\n350\n1\nGuild Durun Head B\n350\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n350\n5\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nMemoria Niter S\n350\n5\nTrade \"Blue Guild Strategy Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMedal of Combat Arts\n350\n5\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nMemoria Niter S\n350\n5\nTrader Period\nRed Guild Strategy Plate:Starts after the February 28, 2023 (Tue) maintenance and ends before the April 5, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nBlue Guild Strategy Plate:Starts after the March 8, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 5, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in  count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nClear bonus\nStarting Point\nSpecial\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus\n120P\n500P\n1200P\nSurvival Bonus\n1 person 10P\n1 person 10P\n1 person 10P\nTime Bonus\n1 second 1P\n1 second 1P\n1 second 1P\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nGuild Durun Head A×1\nGuild Durun Head B×1\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nAwakening Star×25\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\nMemoria Niter S×125\nMedal of Unity×15\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Guild Strategy Event\" NPC in the \"Guild Room\" to challenge the dungeon.\nTalk to the \"Guild Room Guide\" NPC in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to go to your \"Guild Room\".\nEvent Period\nStarts after the February 28, 2023 (Tue) maintenance and ends before the March 29, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nMust be a member of a guild.\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\n* The previous winning guild of the \"Guild of Guilds\" can attempt the dungeon from the NPC in the Champion's Room.\nBoss Monster\nDurun the Millennial Wolf\nDetails\nDefeat the monsters in the dungeon, and the boss will appear in the final wave, along with the \"Radic the Wolf General\" and five types of Crystals.\nClear the dungeon by defeating the \"Durun the Millennial Wolf\".\nOn \"Extreme\" difficulties, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nWhen the five types of Crystals activate, they will give Durun the Millennial Wolf a buff that reduces the damage it takes.\nThis buff can be removed by destroying the Crystals.\nJust like Durun the Millennial Wolf, Radic the Wolf General and the Crystals have resistance to all elements except for their elemental weakness.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nWind Element\nResistance\nThrust Element\nBlunt Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Reduces damage\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Bloodshed\" and \"Paralysis\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\nGuilds\nGuilds can be created and joined through the \"Guild Counter\" NPC.\nYou can gain the benefits of Guild Skills that will help in your journeys, such as increased item drop rates and increased Weapon Proficiency acquisition by joining a guild and increasing its Guild Level.\nThe Guild Raid buff acquirable from Guild Level 16 is useful for taking on Raid Boss Dungeons, Ranking Events, and other guild events.\nPlayers who do not belong to a guild should use this opportunity to join one!\nPlease see below for more details on guilds.\nCreating a Guild\nGuild Skills\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nRaid Boss Tickets are not required to challenge the Raid Boss.\nOther guild dungeons cannot be attempted while guild members are attempting the Guild Strategy Event Millennium Woods.\nThe Raid Boss Dungeon \"Millennium Woods\" is different from the 81F dungeon.\n\"Red Guild Strategy Plates\", \"Blue Guild Strategy Plates\", and \"Guild Event Extreme Battle Badges\" will be deleted on April 5, 2023 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
