    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Uniform Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-02-08 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Argo, Sinon, and Sanya are wearing elegant black uniforms in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nUniform Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Brave Figure in Black] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nVorpal Crack\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n86\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n1650% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Just As Planned] Argo\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nShredding Rock\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n64\nBreak Gauge\n29\nSkill Effect\n1600% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Spirited Roar] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nPhoton Rain\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n65\nBreak Gauge\n28\nSkill Effect\n- Charging -\n1270% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./▲[Bonus] The lower your own HP, damage increases against monsters not targeting you. (max 100%)\n- Uncharged -\n870% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] The lower your own HP, damage increases against monsters not targeting you. (max 100%)\n*Gauge value is when charging\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Sharp Gaze] Sanya\nSkill Name\nVital Assention/Ground Dance\nAttack\n47\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Vital Assention 3] Defense +400./[Ground Dance 4] Deals +20% Earth element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the February 8, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends March 8, 2023 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
