    "snippet": "登入《刀劍神域積分因子》的使用者註意事項。  我們於2023年1月25日13:00開始進行維護，於2023年1月25日17:00(JST/UTC+9)完成。以下是新的更新。  ▼新實施的新活動 防禦戰 ver. 2：“巨豬來襲！【歸來…”",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(1/25)\nMAINT.\n2023-01-24 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n1/25, 2023 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe Defense Battle ver. 2: \"Attack of the Giant Boar! [Returning]\" begins\nAdded Tons of EXP Event \"Wonder Animal Assault\" Event rewards\n\"Chaos Showdown\" New Boss and Dark Black Armor Added\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 1/25 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 31\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
