    "full_details": "Notices\nChanges to Daily Missions/Weekly Missions\nNOTICES\n2023-01-13 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nFollowing maintenance on 1/18/2023 (Wed), Daily Mission achievement conditions and Weekly Mission reward contents will be changed.\n*For customers who logged in at least once between 1/18/2023 4:00 (JST/UTC+9) and  maintenance on 1/18/2023,  Daily Mission achievement conditions 1/28 will be the same as before the change.\n▼Content to be changed\n■Daily Mission\nThe content of some missions will be changed. Reward contents will not be changed.\nChange Before\nAfter Change\nStart game\nStart game\nClear Daily Dungeon\nClear Daily Dungeon\nInteract with Assisting Character\nInteract with Assisting Character\nClear dungeon with the Assist Party\nClear Raising Dungeon *\nClear Character Quest\nClear Labyrinth Dungeon or Chaos Showdown\n* \"Raising Dungeon\" refers to the following campaign dungeon for growing your character.\nOne of these dungeons is planned to continue daily.\n‧Great Enhancement Event  VS Yuuki\n‧Klein's Training Regimen\n‧Build Up Equipment with Lisbeth\n‧Build Up Skills with Sinon\n‧Raising Assisting Character Campaign\n‧Happy Dungeon\nTargeted dungeons can also be confirmed from the achievement conditions from the Daily Mission \"Clear Raising Dungeon.\"\nWeekly Mission\nSome reward contents will be changed. Mission contents will not be changed.\nMission contents\nChange Before\nAfter Change\nClear Daily Mission 1 time\nRestorative Potion×5\nRestorative Potion×30\nClear Daily Mission 3 time\nCleansing Potion×5\nRevive Crystal×5\nClear Daily Mission 5 time\nRecord Kit M×1\nFruit Water×20\nClear Daily Mission 7 time\nRefining Hammer+×1\nMartial Arts Text×3\nClear Daily Mission 10 time\nMartial Arts Text×1\nRelease Crystal (S)×5\nClear Daily Mission 15 time\nRelease Crystal (S)×3\nAwakening Star×5\nClear Daily Mission 20 time\nArcana Gems×100\nArcana Gems×100\n▼About compensation for the change to Weekly Mission rewards\nTargeted dungeons can also be checked from the Daily Mission \"Clear Raising Dungeon\" achievement conditions.\n■Compensation\n‧Restorative Potion×30\n‧Revive Crystal×5\n‧Fruit Water×20\n‧Martial Arts Text×3\n‧Release Crystal (S)×5\n‧Awakening Star×5\n■Sending date\nScheduled for 1/18/2023 (Wed) after maintenance\n■Deadline to receive compensation\nBy 1/25/2023 (Wed) before maintenance\nWe will continue to  make modifications while considering the circumstances of our customers.\nWe hope you continue to enjoy \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nGo to Notice List"
