    "full_details": "Notices\n[1/2 0:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] Fishing Ranking Event, \"2022 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition\" is here!\nEVENT\n2023-01-02 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[1/2 0:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nRanking Rewards have been distributed. Please collect them from the present box.\nFor more details about the rewards, see \"Ranking Rewards\" below.\n-----------------------------\nFishing Ranking Event \"2022 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition\" is on now.\nIn the \"2022 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition\", you fight for the best rank based on your catch scores.\nExpect\nhigh scores\nby fishing Party Bream exclusive to the Sunrise Ship Event Map!\nParty Bream\nEvent Period\nSunrise Ship Event Map Period: Starts after the December 21, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 11, 2023 (Wed) maintenance.\nRanking Period: Starts after the December 21, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the December 31, 2022 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nTo check your current ranking or score, go to Menu > Community > Ranking > 2022 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition ranking banner.\nRewards\nPlace at the top of the rankings to get\nlimited-edition Fishing Competition records, rare fishing bait\n, and\nMemoria Niter L\n, a Skill Record Limit Break material, as a present!\nExchange for up to 1,000\nArcana Gems\n, up to 15\nMedals of Combat Arts\n, as well as other items such as\nCore Metals\nand Release Crystals at the 2022 New Year's Eve Fish Trader.\nEach fish likes different bait.\nTry different things and challenge the event.\n2022 New Year's Eve Fish Trader Period\nStarts after the December 21, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 25, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nRecord\nYou will also be able to receive a record via achievement rewards by finishing in the top ranking.\nRecord Acquisition\nAchievement Rewards\nNYE Fishing King 2022\nRevive Crystal×1\nNYE Fishing Elite 2022\nRevive Crystal×1\nNYE Fishing Mania 2022\nRevive Crystal×1\n* The item with your Record will be deleted on January 25, 2023 (Wed) at 13:59(JST/UTC+9).\nEvent Locations\nScores from fish caught on the \"Sunrise Ship\" Event Map (Beginner, Intermediate, and Advanced) as well as the day and night \"Serene Shore\" and \"Peaceful Forest Path\" on the 22F will be displayed in the rankings.\nHead to the \"Sunrise Ship\" Event Map by talking to the \"Boarding Guide\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\".\nGo to the \"Serene Shore\" or \"Peaceful Forest Path\" on the 22F by talking to \"Nishida\" in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\".\nTalk to the \"Night Map Guide\" NPC on the \"Serene Shore\" to go to the night map.\nEvent Map & 22F\nRecommended Fishing Lv\nSunrise Ship(Beginner)\n1～10\nSunrise Ship(Intermediate)\n11～20\nSunrise Ship(Advanced)\n21～\nSerene Shore\n1～10\nPeaceful Forest Path\n11～15\nSerene Shore (Night)\n16～20\nPeaceful Forest Path (Night)\n21～\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nRanking Reward\nRanking\nRewards\nAmount\n#1\nRecord:NYE Fishing King 2022\n1\nRecord:NYE Fishing Elite 2022\n1\nRecord:NYE Fishing Mania 2022\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n30\nRelease Crystal (L)\n20\n#2～#20\nRecord:NYE Fishing Elite 2022\n1\nRecord:NYE Fishing Mania 2022\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n5\nRelease Crystal (L)\n3\n#21～#100\nRecord:NYE Fishing Mania 2022\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n20\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n20\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n20\nMemoria Niter L\n1\nRelease Crystal (L)\n1\n#101～#300\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n15\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n15\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n15\nMemoria Niter M\n3\n#301～#500\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n5\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n5\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n5\nMemoria Niter M\n1\n#501～#10000\nMemoria Niter S\n1\nRanking rewards will be distributed from January 2, 2023 (Mon) 0:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nReward Acceptance Period: Until January 25, 2023 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
