    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Theatrical Release Celebration If I'm With You Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-12-21 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive: Scherzo of Deep Night movie is here!\nKirito, and Asuna are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nTheatrical Release Celebration If I'm With You Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sound of Liberation] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nValiant Wind\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n21\nSkill Effect\n1350% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Leafa's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Night of Conquest] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nPhoton Linear\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n20\nSkill Effect\n1360% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Thrust 4/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +30% for 20 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nDecember 21, 2022 (Wed) maintenance - January 11, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
