    "full_details": "Notices\n[Resolved] About the Issue with App Updates\nNOTICES\n2022-12-06 14:15:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThis is an announcement for players logged in to Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\r\n\r\nThere was an issue where some customers were unable to properly update to the version 2.1.1 of the app released on 11/30 (Wed).\r\nThis issue was resolved around 12/2 (Fri) 5:42 PM (JST/UTC+9), and we have confirmed that the app can now be updated normally.\r\n\r\nAs a token of apology from us, we will be sending out a compensation of 250 Arcana Gems during our 12/7 maintenance.\r\n*Please receive it by maintenance on 12/21 (Wed).\r\n\r\nWe sincerely apologize for any inconvenience caused at this time.\r\nThank you for your continued support of Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\nGo to Notice List"
