    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Klein's Birthday Order\" is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Klein\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-11-28 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Klein's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[In Food Heaven] Klein\n\" and \"\n[Cutting Breakthrough] Klein\n(MOD Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nKlein's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Klein Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Klein is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Klein!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[In Food Heaven] Klein\nSkill Name\nVeteran Sword Technique/Flexibility\nAttack\n61\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Veteran Sword Technique 4] Attack power increase with own level×0.17%. (max 34%)/[Flexibility 4] Petrify resistance +80% when HP is at 100%. Recovers a max of 1% HP per 3 sec when HP falls below 99%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Cutting Breakthrough] Klein\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nEarth Dive\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1460% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack rises 500 x the number of Kirito Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using earth skills while the buff to raise Earth element's damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nNovember 28, 2022 (Mon) 0:00 - December 7, 2022 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n4.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Klein!　One ★4 Klein guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
