    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Veteran Warriors Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-11-24 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nGet at least 1 ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nThe \"\nVeteran Warriors Order\n\" is here, featuring the brave warriors from SWORD ART ONLINE!\n- Duration\nStarts after the November 24, 2022 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the December 7, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【★4 Skill Records (Partial)】\n★4[Evangelical Cantata] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFlame Blast\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1310% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Train Conductor] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWhirl Flash\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n660% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/▲▲▲[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 250%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Ironclad Business Spirit] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nGale Split\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1450% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Gust 4/Buff] Attack +45% for 5 sec./[Sky Talisman 4/Buff] Thrust element damage -80% to enemies for 15 sec./[Human Talisman 4/Buff] Slash element damage -80% to enemies for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Energetic Rhythm] Klein\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nRefuge Water\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1250% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[PT Precise Attack 4/Buff] Party critical rate +30% for 20 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Leaping All About] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Flame Boost/The Legendary Sword's Rule\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Flame Boost 4] Elemental damage other than fire dealt to enemies -50%, and fire element's damage to enemies +40%./[The Legendary Sword's Rule] Attack +20% when not equipping any Kirito's Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Brilliant Combat] Eiji\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWind Slash\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1080% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Element Weak 4/Debuff] Wind element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec./▲▲[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Yuna's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000./[Bonus] Deal 1000 x the number of Yuna Skill Records in the same set in additional damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
