    "snippet": "劇情活動「很久以前的誓言」回來了！  劇情活動「很久以前的誓言」今年再次舉辦派對，你和小春很興奮，去見了「亞絲娜」等人，並邀請他們一起去。  獎勵收集第三枚勳章，這是作為事件獲得的可交易物品...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"An Oath from Long Ago\" is back! Get a ★4 Kirito MOD Skill!\nEVENT\n2022-11-24 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"An Oath from Long Ago\" is back!\nThe Scenario Event \"An Oath from Long Ago\"\nExcited about the party taking place again this year,\nyou and Koharu go to meet with \"Asuna\" and the others and invite them along.\nRewards\nGather Third Medals, which are tradable items acquired as event rewards and drops, and get the limited-edition Asuna stamp and\n★4 [Man of the Day] Kirito MOD Skill\nfrom the Trader!\nGet\nCore Metal\nfrom Total Score Rewards.\nGet up to 1,000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 50\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, and up to 15\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\nfrom the entire event.\nSkill Record\n★4[Man of the Day] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nVertical X\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nSlash\nSkill Effect\n600% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Damage +15% to enemies when using a non-elemental skill.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nAnniversary Celebration\nTrade \"Third Medal\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\n★4[Man of the Day] Kirito\n400\n5\nMemory Stamp 153\nUse to obtain the \"Anniversary Celebration\" stamp.\n150\n1\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nLife Potion\n5\n20\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nTrader\nSee each Trader NPC for more info, or go to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the \"Trade Third Medal\" banner.\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Entry\", \"Interior\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\", and \"Special\" difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nThe score earned in \"Extreme\" difficulty is not added to the \"Total Score Reward\", but you will receive rewards based on your score.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score\nEntry\nBasic Clear Bonus:24P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n30\nInterior\nBasic Clear Bonus:74P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n80\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:170P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n200\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:420P＋Survival Bonus:10P per surviving player\n480\nSpecial\nBasic Clear Bonus:1880P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n2000\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus:1000P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n1120\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join \"Special\" and \"Extreme\" difficulty Quick Parties.\nSpecial: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nExtreme: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\n\"\nSpecial\n\"\nYou can get a high score in the \"\nSpecial\n\" difficulty bonus dungeon in this event.\nYou can clear the \"\nSpecial\n\" 3 times per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nHigh difficulty \"\nExtreme\n\"\nYou can clear the \"\nExtreme\n\" one time per day.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the November 24, 2022 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the December 21, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n150\nArcana Gems\n50\n300\nArcana Gems\n50\n450\nArcana Gems\n50\n600\nArcana Gems\n50\n750\nArcana Gems\n50\n870\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n900\nArcana Gems\n50\n1040\nAwakening Star\n5\n1280\nArcana Gems\n50\n1680\nArcana Gems\n50\n1840\nAwakening Star\n5\n2080\nArcana Gems\n50\n2320\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2480\nArcana Gems\n50\n2640\nAwakening Star\n5\n2720\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n2880\nArcana Gems\n50\n2960\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n3040\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n3120\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n3400\nArcana Gems\n50\n3800\nAwakening Star\n5\n4400\nArcana Gems\n100\n5400\nArcana Gems\n100\n5600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n5800\nAwakening Star\n5\n6240\nGreat Blue Jewel\n3\n7200\nArcana Gems\n100\n7680\nGreat Red Jewel\n3\n8160\nGreat Green Jewel\n3\n8640\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n3\n12480\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n144000\nCore Metal\n1\n\"Extreme\" Score Rewards\nExtreme\nTotal scores\nScore Reward\nReward\n1000\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n2000\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n3000\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n4000\nMemoria Niter S\n3\n5000\nMemoria Niter S\n3\n6000\nMemoria Niter S\n3\n7000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n8000\nMartial Arts Text\n1\n9000\nRecord Frame L\n20\n10000\nMartial Arts Text\n1\n11000\nRecord Frame L\n20\n12000\nMartial Arts Text\n1\n13000\nRecord Frame L\n20\n14000\nMartial Arts Text\n1\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nMy Celebration\nLet's collect a total of 1000 Third Medals in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×1\nLet's Party!\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Third Medals in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×2\nMajor Sweet Tooth!\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Third Medals in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×3\nHow to Participate\nOpen the List of Events from the Menu in the upper left corner of the screen, and tap the \"An Oath from Long Ago\" banner to go to the Event Map \"Party Area\".\nTalk to Asuna in the Event Map \"Party Area\" to accept the scenario quest.\nThere are 5 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the November 24, 2022 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the December 14, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nBoss Monster\nGenie in the Cake\nDetails\nIt dishes up a wide variety of cake-based attacks.\nThese cake attacks can target the player and hit them with a focus attack or can place a field over a wide area that damages the player.\nWeakness\nNone\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nIf the ★4 Skill Records you acquire have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Memoria Niter L\".\nIf you have previously played the \"An Oath from Long Ago\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAchievements and achievement progress\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\nAfter you clear a \"Special\" difficulty dungeon three times, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nAfter you clear a \"Extreme\" difficulty dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nItem use inside the \"Extreme\" difficulty dungeon is restricted, and Revive Crystals can only be used once.\n\"Third Medal\" will be deleted on December 21, 2022 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2022-11-23T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2022-12-13T19:00:00+00:00"
