    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Dash Up! Floor Breakthrough Panel Mission\" is on now with three panel missions! You can get Arcana Gems, Medals of Combat Arts, and Incense to Increase Luck S as completion rewards!\nEVENT\n2022-11-02 14:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n100F\nis scheduled to release soon!\nJust before its release, we're holding a special mission to help you ascend Aincrad! The\n\"Dash Up! Floor Breakthrough Panel Mission\"\nis on now!\nRewards\nThere are three Panel Missions, No. 1 to No. 3!\nClear the designated floors to obtain useful items such as Revive Crystals, Glare Dragon Stones, Record Frame L, and Restorative Potions.\nGet the Refining Hammer+ by obtaining two pieces of any armor through production or purchase.\nGet a completion reward by clearing all the missions listed on a panel.\nThe completion rewards are 300 Arcana Gems for No. 1, 5 Medal of Combat Arts for No. 2, and 15 Incense to Increase Luck S for No. 3.\nPeriod\nNovember 2, 2022 (Wed) 14:00 - November 30, 2022 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n* This Panel Mission Reward is available until December 7, 2022 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nMission Details\nFloor Breakthrough Panel Mission No.1\nMission\nRewards\nAmount\nClear Aincrad 1F\nRestorative Potion\n500\nClear Aincrad 2F\nRevive Crystal\n60\nClear Aincrad 3F\nRecord Frame L\n80\nClear Aincrad 4F\nGlare Dragon Stone\n80\nClear Aincrad 6F\nCleansing Potion\n150\nClear Aincrad 8F\nSaleable Col Bag\n* You will be able to sell it at the Merchant for 100,000 Col\n5\nClear Aincrad 10F\nRecord Kit S\n100\nClear Aincrad 11F\nRecord Kit M\n100\nClear Aincrad 12F\nLife Potion\n20\nComplete Reward\nAmount\nArcana Gems\n300\nFloor Breakthrough Panel Mission No.2\nMission\nRewards\nAmount\nClear Aincrad 13F\nRed Jewel\n50\nClear Aincrad 14F\nGreen Jewel\n50\nClear Aincrad 20F\nYellow Jewel\n50\nClear Aincrad 25F\nBlue Jewel\n100\nClear Aincrad 27F\nSlicing Stone\n50\nClear Aincrad 35F\nPiercing Stone\n50\nClear Aincrad 40F\nStriking Stone\n50\nClear Aincrad 47F\nBlocking Stone\n100\nClear Aincrad 50F\nRefining Hammer\n100\nComplete Reward\nAmount\nMedal of Combat Arts\n5\nFloor Breakthrough Panel Mission No.3\nMission\nRewards\nAmount\nClear Aincrad 55F\nHigh Red Jewel\n50\nClear Aincrad 61F\nHigh Green Jewel\n50\nClear Aincrad 74F\nHigh Yellow Jewel\n50\nClear Aincrad 75F\nHigh Blue Jewel\n100\nClear Aincrad 81F\nSlicing Stone+\n50\nClear Aincrad 85F\nPiercing Stone+\n50\nClear Aincrad 91F\nStriking Stone+\n50\nClear Aincrad 99F\nBlocking Stone+\n100\nProduce or purchase 2 armors\nRefining Hammer+\n100\nComplete Reward\nAmount\nIncense to Increase Luck S\n15\nImportant\nFloor Breakthrough Panel Missions No. 1 to 3 are independent of each other and can be progressed simultaneously.\nCleared floors' Missions will become completed Panel Missions.\nThe count for Missions will start when Panel Missions open.\nThe Incense to Increase Luck S will be removed on December 12, 2022 (Mon) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
