    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Sanya's Birthday Order\" is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Sanya\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-10-29 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Sanya's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Devil Mood] Sanya\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[Mountain of Presents] Sanya\n\" are now available!\n\"\nSanya's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Sanya Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Sanya is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Sanya!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Devil Mood] Sanya\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nVorpal Shadow\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1180% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Night Erosion 4/Buff] Attack + 0.5% per stack (Stack10) during 25 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Recover 5% of max HP when hitting bleeding enemies./[Bonus] Attack +30% against bleeding enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Mountain of Presents] Sanya\nSkill Name\nBloody Blow/Foreign Friend\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n54\nHP\n2875\nSkill Effect\n[Bloody Blow 4] Attack +24% against bleeding enemies./[Foreign Friend 1] Attack rises 200 x the number of Rain Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nOctober 29, 2022 (Sat) 0:00 - November 7, 2022 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n4.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Sanya!　One ★4 Sanya guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
