    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"All Hallows' Eve Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2022-10-13 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Yuuki, Eugeo, and Leafa are dressed for Halloween in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nAll Hallows' Eve Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Mischievous Smile] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nWind Smash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1270% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000./[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Sweets in Danger] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nProjection Shadow\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1410% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Ultimate Light 4/Buff] Own critical rate raises, and reduces the next damage taken (Stack 5) during 20 sec.Critical rate +1% per stack, and reduces the next damage taken by -1% per stack.Each effects will be removed by taking damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRaises 3 → 6 → 9 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself when hitting with skills.\n★4[Dark Underlings Wanted] Eugeo\nSkill Name\nIron-Fisted Punishment/Enhance Stun Res.\nAttack\n59\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Iron-Fisted Punishment 4] Attack +500 when attacking with blunt element./●[Enhance Stun Res. 4] Stun resistance +70%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Devil Charm] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nThrust of Flame\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n660% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Blaze Demon 4/Buff] Fire element damage +55% for 8 sec./[Fire Element Weak 4/Debuff] Fire element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the October 13, 2022 (Thu) maintenance and ends on October 31, 2022 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
