    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Puppet Master Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2022-09-21 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki, Sinon, Sachi, and Klein are puppeteers in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nPuppet Master Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Lively Jester] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nDark Linear\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1340% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Weak Thrust 3/Debuff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +20% for 8 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] It will Frostbite (Stack 3) at specific rate for 30 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] Turn the enemy with slash Element into Frostbite (Stack 5) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Green Puppeteer] Sinon\nSkill Name\nSteel Fang/Evasion\nAttack\n61\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Steel Fang 4] Attack +500 when attacking with thrust element./[Evasion 4] Evasion rate +10%. *It will not be activated with focus attack.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[The Joy of Pulling Strings] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nShadow Fall\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n820% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Powerful Puppet Master] Klein\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHoly Smite\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1570% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the September 21, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the October 12, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
