    "full_details": "Notices\n[9/21 13:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] \"Event rewards\" Added! Great Proficiency Items Event \"Tales of Series Battle Rush\" is here!\nEVENT\n2022-09-21 13:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[9/21 13:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\n\"White Battle Rush Plates\" were added as drops.\nAchievement rewards and Trader reward items were also added.\nExchange \"White Battle Rush Plates\" for the added items.\nAdded Items\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n10\n30\nMedal of Combat Arts\n350\n5\nAwakening Star\n20\n10\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n2\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n2\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n2\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n2\nRelease Crystal (L)\n350\n1\nRelease Crystal (M)\n125\n3\nMartial Arts Text\n50\n25\nRestorative Potion\n1\n40\nLife Potion\n5\n10\nEmergency Crystal\n5\n20\nCleansing Potion\n3\n10\nRevive Crystal\n10\n30\nRecord Frame L\n3\n35\nGlare Dragon Stone\n3\n35\n10,000Col\n1\n120\n* \"White Battle Rush Plates\" will be deleted on September 28, 2022 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nTrader Period\nWhite Battle Rush Plate: Starts after the September 21, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 28, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nTo New Heights\nLet's collect a total of 2000 White Battle Rush Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\n-----------------------------\nBattle in the Arena against Yuri, Lloyd, and Milla from the Tales of series!\nCome out victorious, and get tons of items from rewards and drops to increase your weapon proficiency and acquire proficiency skills!\nRewards\nGet your hands on Black Battle Rush Plates in the event and use them at the Trader to get Medals of Combat Arts, as well as Release Crystals that you can use to learn proficiency skills!\nYou can also get lots of \"Release Crystals\" from Total Score Rewards.\n\"White Battle Rush Plates\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the September 21, 2022 (Wed) maintenance.\nGet up to 1,000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 50\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, and up to 20\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\nfrom the entire event.\nIn addition to Black Battle Rush Plates, there's a chance that Yuri, Lloyd, and Milla will drop Martial Arts Texts and Release Crystals (S).\nGet rare items by using Boost Mode to increase the drop rate!\nSee here for more details on \"Boost Mode\".\nTrade \"Black Battle Rush Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMedal of Combat Arts\n350\n5\nAwakening Star\n20\n15\nRelease Crystal (L)\n350\n2\nRelease Crystal (M)\n125\n6\nMartial Arts Text\n50\n25\nTrade \"White Battle Rush Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n10\n30\nMedal of Combat Arts\n350\n5\nAwakening Star\n20\n10\nRelease Crystal (L)\n350\n1\nRelease Crystal (M)\n125\n3\nMartial Arts Text\n50\n25\nEvent Period\nStarts after the September 14, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 28, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nTrader Period\nBlack Battle Rush Plate: Starts after the September 14, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 28, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nWhite Battle Rush Plate: Starts after the September 21, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 28, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nThe Trader will no longer be available after the event ends on September 28, 2022 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores are all counted toward the \"\nTotal Score Reward\n\". Your rewards will be based on your score.\nClear bonus\nNormal\nAdvanced\nPremium\nManiac\nBasic Clear Bonus\n199P\n1000P\n3540P\n5000P\nSurvival Bonus\n1 person 1P\n1 person 10P\n1 person 10P\n1 person 50P\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join \"Premium\" and \"Maniac\" difficulty Quick Parties.\nPremium: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nManiac: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\n\"\nPremium\n\"\nYou can get a high score in the \"\nPremium\n\" difficulty bonus dungeon in this event.\nYou can complete the \"\nPremium\n\" dungeon once a day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nHigh difficulty \"\nManiac\n\"\nIn the high-difficulty dungeon \"\nManiac\n\", item use is restricted while inside the dungeon and \"Revive Crystals\" can only be used once.\nSpecial Bonus\nA Special Bonus will be in effect in the Tales of Series Battle Rush.\nIf you clear it with compatible Skill Records equipped, you will receive a large additional score bonus.\nList of Special Bonus Compatible Skill Records\nSkill Name\nEquipment Type\nSpecial Bonus\nBeginner\nAdvanced\nPremium\nManiac\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\n★4[Intense Dual Blades] Kirito\n1H Sword\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n750\n1500\n★4[Master of the Four] Asuna\n1H Rapier\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n750\n1500\n★4[Attuned Mage] Koharu\n1H Club\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n750\n1500\n★4[Blade of Faith] Eugeo\nAbility\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n750\n1500\n★4[Peace-Seeking Knight] Alice\n2H Spear\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n750\n1500\n★4[Passionate Avenger] Sinon\n1H Sword\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n750\n1500\n★4[Seventh Fonic Hymn] Leafa\nAbility\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n750\n1500\n★4[Tempestuous Umbrella Wielder] Yuuki\n1H Rapier\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n750\n1500\n★4[Raging Silver Wolf] Kirito\nAbility\n10\n20\n50\n100\n180\n360\n250\n500\n★4[Blazing Sword] Alphen\nAbility\n10\n20\n50\n100\n180\n360\n250\n500\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×700\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nAwakening Star×25\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\nRelease Crystal (L)×8\nRelease Crystal (M)×10\nRelease Crystal (S)×245\nMartial Arts Text×50\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nFriendly Rivalry\nLet's collect a total of 1000 Black Battle Rush Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nFriendship in a Sword\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Black Battle Rush Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Yuri\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nOpponent\nYuri\nDetails\nThe enemy uses Bleed.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Bleed\"\nLloyd\nDetails\nThe enemy uses a buff during certain attacks that reduces damage.\nOn Maniac difficulty, the enemy uses a buff during certain attacks that reflects damage.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Increase Attack\", \"Reduces damage\", and \"Reflect Damage\"\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Stun\"\nMilla\nDetails\nThe enemy uses a buff during certain attacks that reduces damage.\nOn Maniac difficulty, the enemy uses a buff during certain attacks that reflects damage.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Increase Attack\", \"Reduces damage\", and \"Reflect Damage\"\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Paralysis\"\n* Reflect Damage: Reduces the damage received and reflects a percentage of it.\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nAfter you clear the \"Premium\" dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\n\"Black Battle Rush Plate\" and \"White Battle Rush Plate\" will be deleted on September 28, 2022 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
