    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Awakening Step-Up Order\" is here! One ★4 Awakening Skill is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2022-08-26 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe \"\nAwakening Step-Up Order\n\" featuring ★4 Awakening Skills is here!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\nOn Step 4 and Step 5, the total drop rate for ★4 Awakening Skills increases to 2.0%!\nAdditionally, on Step 5, one of the ★4 Awakening Skills is guaranteed!\nMore Awakening Skill Details Here\n【Some Featured ★4 Awakening Skills】\n★4[Protector of Time] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nStorm Cinque\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec./[Weak Thrust 4/Debuff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +25% for 8 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Complete Set] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nEnhance Poison Aim/Step-in/More Deban\nAttack\n50\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Poison Aim 5] Increase the target success rate for Poison./[Step-in 5] Increases the critical rate as number of HITS increase./[More Deban 2] When equipping 1 or more of Silica's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Attack Supporter] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nFlame Invasion\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1250% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Poison Boost 4/Debuff] Lowers enemy's poison resistance 50% for 30 sec (easier to inflict Poison) and poison damage +100%./▲▲[Bonus] Increase status ailment stacks by 8 on enemies when hitting poisoned enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Step Offers/Details\nStarts August 26, 2022 (Fri) 17:00 and ends before the September 7, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 Awakening Skills\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 Awakening Skills\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 Awakening Skills\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% Total Drop Rate for ★4 Awakening Skills\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Awakening Skill guaranteed! 2.0% Total Drop Rate for ★4 Awakening Skills\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
