    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Sinon's Birthday Order\" is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Sinon\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-08-21 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Sinon's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Relaxing at the Campsite] Sinon\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[Two Precise Arrows] Sinon\n(Awakening Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nSinon's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Sinon Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Sinon is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Sinon and are at an increased 6.0% Drop Rate!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Relaxing at the Campsite] Sinon\nSkill Name\nOpposing Heart/Resonance of Flame\nAttack\n62\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Opposing Heart 3] Attack +18% to the enemies that have a buff effect/[Resonance of Flame 4] Fire element damage +30% to the enemies that have a buff effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Two Precise Arrows] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nBurning Rain\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n- Charging -\n1460% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/[Adversity 3/Buff] The lower your own HP, critical damage increases for 15 sec./[Adversity 4/Buff] The lower your own HP, critical damage increases for 15 sec.\n*Longer charge time than usual\n- Uncharged -\n910% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Adversity 3/Buff] The lower your own HP, critical damage increases for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nAugust 21, 2022 (Sun) 0:00 - August 30, 2022 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n6.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Sinon!　One ★4 Sinon guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
