    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign for Sinon\" is here! Build up your Assisting Characters with the dungeon and rewards!\nCampaign\n2022-08-19 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCelebrate Sinon's birthdays with the \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign for Sinon\", on now!\nTake on the \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign\", where you and your Assisting Characters can earn more EXP than in normal dungeons.\nRewards\nPlayers can acquire present items and items to recover stamina for the assist function from Score and Challenge Rewards.\nAlso available are limited items including an Sinon Memory Stamp and the \"Special Gift for Sinon\", which is a present item that increases Friendship EXP for \"Sinon\".\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nKitty Sinon\nLimited Items\nEffect\nSpecial Gift for Sinon\nA gift for Sinon, to maybe get along better.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to take on the \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\".\nEvent Period\nAugust 19, 2022 (Fri) 4:00 - August 26, 2022 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nMemory Stamp 206\nUse to obtain the \"Kitty Sinon\" stamp.\n1\n200\nSpecial Gift for Sinon\n1\n300\nRecord Kit M\n25\n400\nSmall Gift\n1\n500\nTasty Bread\n5\n600\nSpecial Gift for Sinon\n1\n700\nFresh Fish\n5\n800\nSmall Gift\n1\n900\nEnergy Fruit\n5\n1,000\nSpecial Gift for Sinon\n1\n1,100\nAsuna's Handmade Seasoning\n5\n1,200\nSmall Gift\n1\n1,300\nBeautiful Flower\n5\n1,400\nGlittering Blue Butterfly\n5\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nRecord Kit M\n30\nCompleted without any tumble\nRecord Frame L\n30\nCompleted within Target Time (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nGolden Bells\n1\nImportant\nThe Assisting Character Sinon will be unlocked when you complete the 9F main quest.\nThe \"Special Gift for Sinon\" does not expire.\nThis \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" can be cleared once per day.\nThis \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" is updated daily at 4:00 am (JST/UTC+9). After this, the previous day's dungeon cannot be attempted.\nIt is possible to take characters other than \"Sinon\" as Assisting Characters into the \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\".\nThis \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" is a solo and Assist Party-only dungeon.\nNote: Players who challenge this \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" solo will not earn any EXP for their Assisting Characters.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
