    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Grand Order\" is here! ★4 birthday Skill Records are part of this lineup!\nShop\n2022-08-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe \"\nGrand Order\n\" is here, and ★4 Skill Records are part of this lineup, including birthday Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn all Steps, the\ntotal drop rate for ★4 Skill Records is 8.0%\n!\nAdditionally, on Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Rulid's Protector] Alice\nSkill Name\nAqua Boost/Icy Shield\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Aqua Boost 4] Elemental damage other than water dealt to enemies -50%, and water element's damage to enemies +40%./[Icy Shield 4] Adds a buff when you hit using Switch. Your defense increases for 40 sec. (STACK 10)+0.3% per 1 STACK. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Starry Sky Dance] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWind Revolution\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack + 30% during the buff effect for increased max HP/[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[A Focused Blow] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nShadow Waltz\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1410% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Wide]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack +25% to enemies when using break./[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 100%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the August 15, 2022 17:00 - August 25, 2022 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n11 Order for 1,250 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP2\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP3\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed! 8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
