    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Guild Support Campaign is here! You can use limited-time Guild Skills!\nCampaign\n2022-08-10 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThis is your chance to grow your guild with limited-time Guild Skills and special quests that will earn you tons of Guild Points (GP)!\nThe Guild Support Campaign is on now.\nIt's a great opportunity to join a guild or recruit new members.\n■Limited-Time Guild Skills\nFor a limited-time, use Guild Skills that add Production's Additional Bonus Up or increase EXP gained when defeating a monster!\nPlease refer to the list below for more info on the limited-time Guild Skills.\nGuild Lv Needed\nSkill Name\nSkill Details\nGuild Points Cost\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only I: Player Exp Up\nExp +50% when monster is defeated.\nIn effect: 30 min\n6000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only II: Player Exp Up\nExp +75% when monster is defeated.\nIn effect: 1 hour\n12000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only III: Player Exp Up\nExp +100% when monster is defeated.\nIn effect: 3 hours\n30000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only I: Item Drop Rate Up\nItem drop rate +20%.\nIn effect: 30 min\n6000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only II: Item Drop Rate Up\nItem drop rate +25%.\nIn effect: 1 hour\n12000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only III: Item Drop Rate Up\nItem drop rate +30%.\nIn effect: 3 hours\n30000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only I: Col Up\nCol +40% when monster is defeated.\nIn effect: 30 min\n6000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only II: Col Up\nCol +60% when monster is defeated.\nIn effect: 1 hour\n12000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only III: Col Up\nCol +80% when monster is defeated.\nIn effect: 3 hours\n30000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only I: Production add Bonus Up\nIncreases the additional bonus rate by 30% for equipment and ring production.\nIn effect: 30 min\n6000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only II: Production add Bonus Up\nIncreases the additional bonus rate by 40% for equipment and ring production.\nIn effect: 1 hour\n12000GP\nGuild Lv.1\nLimited Time Only III: Production add Bonus Up\nIncreases the additional bonus rate by 50% for equipment and ring production.\nIn effect: 3 hours\n30000GP\n* The limited-time Guild Skills will be available until maintenance begins on August 22, 2022 (Mon).\n* Guild Skills with the same effect cannot be equipped at the same time.\n■Super Guild Point Quest\nSuper Guild Point Quest give more Guild Points (GP) than normal Quests.\nPlus, earn EXP, Col, and Guild Exp.\nJoin a guild and help it grow!\nQuest Rewards\nGet the following rewards by completing the Super Guild Point Quest.\nGuild EXP 200\nGP 2000\n5000Col\nExp 1000\nQuest Period\nStarts after the August 10, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 22, 2022 (Mon) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nQuest Starting Location\nTake on the challenge from the Guild Room.\nThe winning guild of the \"Guild of Guilds\" can attempt it from the Champion's Room.\nGuild Quest\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nMust be a member of a guild.\nGuilds\nGuilds can be created and joined through the \"Guild Counter\" NPC.\nYou can gain the benefits of Guild Skills that will help in your journeys, such as increased item drop rates and increased Weapon Proficiency acquisition by joining a guild and increasing its Guild Level.\nPlayers who do not belong to a guild should use this opportunity to join one!\nPlayers who belong to guilds can also use Guild Raid buffs acquirable from Guild Level 16 to help with Guild Events.\nPlease see below for more details on guilds.\nCreating a Guild\nGuild Skills\nImportant\nSuper Guild Point Quest are updated daily at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9). After this, the previous day's Quests cannot be accepted.\nYou cannot enter a Guild Room if you have not joined a guild.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
