    "full_details": "Notices\n【Holiday Campaign】\"MOD Step-Up Order Part 2\"! Includes ★4 \"MOD Skill\" for 1H Swords, Daggers, 1H Clubs, and Bows! Get 1 ★4 \"MOD Skill\" guaranteed on STEP5!\nShop\n2022-06-29 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nThe \"\nHoliday Campaign MOD Step-Up Order Part 2\n\" is here, featuring ★4 \"MOD Skill\" for 1H Swords, Daggers, 1H Clubs, and Bows!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\nOn Step 4 and Step 5, the total drop rate for ★4 MOD Skills increases to 2.0%!\nAdditionally, on Step 5, one of the ★4 MOD Skills is guaranteed!\nMore MOD Skill Details Here\n【Some Featured ★4 MOD Skills】\n★4[Challenger Wanted] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nValiant Gaia\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1240% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500./[Bonus] Restore 8000 HP when hitting with this skill while using switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Dragon Show] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nTerror Flame\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1210% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Miner's Triumphant Return] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nDeadly Smash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1120% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Recovers your SP by 10 when critical is activated with this skill. /[Bonus] Critical rate +100% against enemies with the thrust element.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Strict Butler] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nShade Shot\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1210% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] The lower your own HP, damage increases against monsters not targeting you. (max 100%)/[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the June 29, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 13, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 MOD Skill guaranteed! 2.0% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
