    "full_details": "Notices\n\"87F\" installed! \"87F Start Dash Event\" is on now!\nUPDATE\n2022-06-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nMajor Updates\nAdded a new quest alongside the release of the 87F.\nTo celebrate the floor's opening, we will be holding a limited-time 87F Start Dash Event where you can get lots of items.\n《New Quest》\nMain Quest\nThe Troubled Proprietress\nStart Map\nSteam Country\nBoss Monster\nMateo the Mounting Macaque\nDetails\nCritical resistance is always active.\nIt has a Break Gauge which can be broken with Slash Element attacks.\nIn dungeons, it uses the critical resistance buff and the Seal Items debuff.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nEarth Element\nResistance（Dungeon）\nThrust Element\nBlunt Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nCritical\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Critical resistance\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Fatal Poison\" and \"Petrify\"\nDebuff \"Decrease defense\" and \"Seal item\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Status ailment \"Petrify\": Lose the ability to use actions or items, and take double the damage.\nThis will be removed after a certain amount of time or by taking damage.\nCollect coins that drop from monsters on 87F and exchange them for lots of items!\nThe monsters in the field will drop \"Silver Floor Coins\", and the monsters in the dungeons \"Steam Country - Entry\" and \"Steam Country - Interior\" will drop \"Gold Floor Coins\".\nThe \"Dungeon Guide\" NPC who will take you to the dungeons will appear when you complete the main quest on 87F.\nRewards\nThere are a variety of items at the Trader, including Awakening Stars, Medals of Combat Arts, and up to 600\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 85F Main Quest through the end.\nTrade \"Gold Floor Coin\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×20\n20\n15\nMedal of Combat Arts\n80\n8\nAwakening Star\n20\n40\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n8\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n8\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n8\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n8\nRelease Crystal (L)\n100\n1\nMemoria Niter S\n50\n5\nTrade \"Silver Floor Coin\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×20\n20\n15\nMedal of Combat Arts\n80\n7\nAwakening Star\n20\n35\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n7\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n7\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n7\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n7\nRelease Crystal (L)\n100\n1\nMemoria Niter S\n50\n5\nGold & Silver Floor Coin Trader\nSee each Trader NPC for more info, or go to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the Gold & Silver Floor Coin Trader banner.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the June 22, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 13, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nTrader Period\nStarts after the June 22, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 21, 2022 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nImportant\n87F will not have any additional sub quests, character quests, or floor bosses.\n\"Gold Floor Coins\" and \"Silver Floor Coins\" will be removed on July 21, 2022 (Thu) at 14:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
