    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Rain's Birthday Order\" is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Rain\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-06-21 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Rain's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Seasoned With Magic]Rain\n(Connect Skill)\" and \"\n[Scarlet Light Sword] Rain\n(MOD Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nRain's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Rain Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Rain is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Rain!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Seasoned With Magic] Rain\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nSandtron\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1420% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Ultimate Light 4/Buff] Own critical rate raises, and reduces the next damage taken (Stack 5) during 20 sec.Critical rate +1% per stack, and reduces the next damage taken by -1% per stack.Each effects will be removed by taking damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces all skill's cool times by 3 → 6 → 9 sec when hitting with skills.\n★4[Scarlet Light Sword] Rain\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nGaia V Arc\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1330% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Sanya's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000./[Bonus] Deal 1000 x the number of Sanya Skill Records in the same set in additional damage./[Bonus] Restore 8000 HP when hitting with this skill while using switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nJune 21, 2022 (Tue) 0:00 - June 30, 2022 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n4.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Rain!　One ★4 Rain guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThere is no voice production when the Connect Skill \"[Seasoned With Magic] Rain\" is drawn.\nThere is no voice production when the MOD Skill \"[Scarlet Light Sword] Rain\" is drawn.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
