    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Lisbeth's Birthday Order\" is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Lisbeth\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-05-18 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Lisbeth's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Ardent Request] Lisbeth\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[One Job Down] Lisbeth\n(MOD Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nLisbeth's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Lisbeth Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Lisbeth is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Lisbeth and are at an increased 6.0% Drop Rate!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Ardent Request] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nIron-Fisted Punishment/More Deban/Enhance Petrify Res.\nAttack\n49\nDefense\n44\nHP\n2800\nSkill Effect\n[Iron-Fisted Punishment 4] Attack +500 when attacking with blunt element./[More Deban 2] When equipping 1 or more of Silica's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%./[Enhance Petrify Res. 5] Petrify resistance +70%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[One Job Down] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nAtmos Crush\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1250% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack +50% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark)./[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nMay 18, 2022 (Wed) 0:00 - May 27, 2022 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n6.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Lisbeth!　One ★4 Lisbeth guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
