    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Fish Assault\" is here! Get lots of EXP from the hordes of monsters that attack you!\nEVENT\n2022-05-11 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHordes of monsters attack in the \"Fish Assault\"!\nAfter a certain amount of time passes, the boss monster will appear.\nDrive off hordes of monsters and earn\ntons of EXP\n!\nRewards\nExchange the \"Yellow Fish Plates\" you obtain from the event at the Trader to get \"Medals of Combat Arts\" and \"Awakening Stars\" for Skill Record Awakening.\n\"Green Fish Plates\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the May 18, 2022 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on May 25, 2022 (Wed).\nGet up to 1,000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 75\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, and up to 25\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\nfrom the entire event.\nIn addition to \"Fish Plates\", monsters have a chance of dropping \"Red Fruits\" and \"Blue Fruits\", both of which can be used to produce recovery items!\nThere is a chance that Star Fragments will drop from the \"The King of Lakes\" boss monster on \"Normal\", \"Advanced\", \"Premium\", and \"Maniac\" difficulties.\nGet rare items and lots of EXP by using Boost Mode to increase the Drop Rate and EXP obtained!\nSee here for more details on \"Boost Mode\".\nTrade \"Yellow Fish Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMedal of Combat Arts\n350\n5\nAwakening Star\n20\n30\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n3\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n3\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n3\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n3\nRelease Crystal (M)\n125\n3\nTrade \"Green Fish Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\nMedal of Combat Arts\n350\n5\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n2\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n2\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n2\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n2\nRelease Crystal (M)\n100\n3\nTrader Period\nYellow Fish Plate: Starts after the May 11, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 8, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nGreen Fish Plate: Starts after the May 18, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 8, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Beginner\", \"Normal\", \"Advanced\", and \"Premium\" difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n.\nYour rewards will be based on your score.\nThe score earned in \"Maniac\" difficulty is not added to the Total Score Reward, but you will receive rewards based on your score.\nClear bonus\nBeginner\nNormal\nAdvanced\nPremium\nManiac\nBasic Clear Bonus\n25P\n25P\n25P\n25P\n25P\nSurvival Bonus\n1 person 25P\n1 person 50P\n1 person 150P\n1 person 400P\n1 person 400P\nFirst Attack Bonus\n1P\n2P\n4P\n12P\n12P\nLast Attack Bonus\n1P\n2P\n4P\n12P\n12P\n\"Premium\"\nYou can get a high score in the\n\"Premium\"\ndifficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the\n\"Premium\"\n1 time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nHigh difficulty\n\"Maniac\"\nThe high-difficulty dungeon\n\"Maniac\"\nwill be added after the May 18, 2022 (Wed) maintenance.\nThe high-difficulty dungeon\n\"Maniac\"\nhas a Recommended Total Power of 120,000. The boss has weaknesses that are different from those on other difficulty levels.\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join \"Premium\" and \"Maniac\" difficulty Quick Parties.\nPremium: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nManiac: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n200\nArcana Gems\n50\n3600\nArcana Gems\n50\n6000\nArcana Gems\n50\n10450\nArcana Gems\n50\n16700\nArcana Gems\n50\n22500\nExp Crystal M\n3\n25500\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n30000\nExp Crystal M\n5\n31500\nArcana Gems\n50\n37500\nExp Crystal M\n5\n39000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n46500\nArcana Gems\n100\n51000\nExp Crystal M\n5\n54000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n61500\nArcana Gems\n100\n69000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n72000\nExp Crystal L\n1\n76500\nArcana Gems\n100\n78000\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n79500\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n81000\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n82500\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n84000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n85500\nExp Crystal L\n1\n87000\nAwakening Star\n10\n91500\nArcana Gems\n100\n93000\nGreat Red Jewel\n3\n94500\nGreat Green Jewel\n3\n96000\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n3\n97500\nGreat Blue Jewel\n3\n105000\nExp Crystal L\n2\n120000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n150000\nAwakening Star\n15\n165000\nExp Crystal L\n2\n180000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n3\n240000\nExp Crystal L\n2\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nWhat the fish!\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Yellow Fish Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nBig catch!\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Yellow Fish Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Assault Event\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the May 11, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 31, 2022 (Tue) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nBoss Monster\nThe King of Lakes\nDetails\nIt has a focus attack and attacks that can inflict you with Frostbite and Stun.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Maniac\"difficulty\nBlunt Element\nWind Element\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nAfter you clear a \"Premium\" difficulty dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nItem use inside the \"Maniac\" difficulty dungeon is restricted, and \"Revive Crystals\" can only be used once.\n\"The King of Lakes\" will keep appearing until time is up, even after it has been defeated.\nAfter entering the dungeon for the Assault Event, you'll have 3 minutes to clear it.\nAfter time runs out, you can skip the monster hunt log wait time by tapping the screen.\n\"Yellow Fish Plates\" and \"Green Fish Plates\" will be deleted on June 8, 2022 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
