    "full_details": "Notices\n1,500 Days Since the SAOIF Worldwide Release! \"Get 1,500 Arcana Gems\"\nEVENT\n2022-05-02 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate 1,500 Days Since the SAOIF Worldwide Release, players can\nreceive up to 1,500 Arcana Gems\nfrom the login bonus on now.\nYou can receive 100 Arcana Gems each day by logging in.\nPeriod\nMay 2, 2022 (Mon) 4:00 - June 1, 2022 (Wed) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\nYou can receive the login bonus after completing the quest \"Another Reality\".\nDaily distribution time will be from 4:00 AM to 3:59 AM of the next day. (JST/UTC+9).\nPlease note that the distribution date does not switch when the date changes.\nThe quest schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
