    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Knight's Song Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-05-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Leafa, Lisbeth, and Sachi are noble swan knights in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nKnight's Song Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Evangelical Cantata] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFlame Blast\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1310% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Lively Agilita] Leafa\nSkill Name\nHold the Front/Prosper\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2800\nSkill Effect\n[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%./[Prosper 4] Attack +20% when HP is above 50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Thoughtful Toccata] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nPhoton Fissure\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRecovers your SP by 8 → 16 → 24 when critical is activated.\n★4[Finale Cadenza] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nBlaze Fall\nSP Cost\n40\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n520% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +200% to enemies when using fire skills while the buff to raise fire damage is in effect./[Bonus] Deal 2000 additional damage to enemies that have a buff effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nMay 1, 2022 (Sun) 0:00 - May 17, 2022 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
