    "full_details": "Notices\nLineup Updated! One ★4 2H Axe Skill Record guaranteed in the \"★4 2H Axe Guaranteed Order\"!\nShop\n2022-04-30 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAvailable four Per Player!\nA new lineup is here for the ★4 2H Axe Guaranteed Order where you are\nguaranteed\none 2H Axe★4 Skill Record!\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"2H Axes\"!\nIncludes\n\"MOD Skills\"\n,\n\"Awakening Skills\"\n, and\n\"Burst Skills\"\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Endeavoring Axe Strike] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nRumbling Rock\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1280% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] +25% damage towards enemy on break./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Leafa's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Assaulting Blow] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nEarth Judgement\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1000% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Earthquake Battle Axe 4/Buff] +2500 additional damage when attacking for 15 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Additional damage effect will be tripled by the buff, ability, and proficiency skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Top Speeder] Leafa\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nRock Split Burst\nSkill Name\nRock Split\nSP Cost\n28\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nBlunt→\nEarth\n→\nEarth\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n760% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Tough 4/Buff] Flinch resist +100% for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n1520% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Tough 4/Buff] Flinch resist +100% for 30 sec./[Giant Power 4/Buff] Additional damage based on Max HP for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nStarts after the April 30, 2022 17:00 - May 7, 2022 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nThere is no single Order.\nThis 11 Order can only be used 4 times per player.\nThe previously bought \"★4 2H Axe Guaranteed Order\" is available for purchase again if you have already purchased it 4 times.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
