    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Awakening Step-Up Order Part 2\" is here! On Step 5, one ★4 Awakening Skill is guaranteed! 2H Axe, Dagger, Bow, and Ability ★4 Awakening Skills are available!\nShop\n2022-04-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe \"\nAwakening Step-Up Order Part 2\n\" is here! Featuring 2H Axe, Dagger, Bow, and Ability ★4 Awakening Skills!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\nOn Step 4 and Step 5, the total drop rate for ★4 Awakening Skills increases to 2.0%!\nAdditionally, on Step 5, one of the ★4 Awakening Skills is guaranteed!\nMore Awakening Skill Details Here\n【Some Featured ★4 Awakening Skills】\n★4[Bohemian Paint] Argo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nFlame Waltz\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1210% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Find Weakness 4/Debuff] Finds the enemy's weakness for 15 sec at a specific rate.　The critical rate +20% to enemy that has their weakness found./[Mountain of Bodies 3/Buff] Additional damage based on current HP for 30 sec when hitting with switch./[Perish 3/Debuff] Receive 3x damage for 30 sec when hitting with switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Snack Break] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nBlaze Edge\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1220% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Poison Boost 4/Debuff] Lowers enemy's poison resistance 50% for 30 sec (easier to inflict Poison) and poison damage +100%./[Bleed Boost 4/Debuff] Lowers enemy's bleed resistance 50% for 30 sec (easier to inflict Bleed) and bleed damage +100%./▲[Bonus] Attack +15% against poisoned enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Sniping Arrow] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nProjection Light\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n940% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Reckless Courage 4/Buff] The lower your own HP, attack increases for 15 sec./[Death Mark/Debuff] Increases damage to enemy by x1.1 for 12 sec when you hit using Switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Slip Away] Sachi\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Thin Ice\nAttack\n39\nDefense\n58\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Thin Ice 4] Defense -30%, and HP -99% every 3 sec during the buff effect for increased max HP.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Step Offers/Details\nApril 15, 2022 (Fri) 17:00 - April 26, 2022 (Tue) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 Awakening Skills\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 Awakening Skills\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 Awakening Skills\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% Total Drop Rate for ★4 Awakening Skills\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Awakening Skill guaranteed! 2.0% Total Drop Rate for ★4 Awakening Skills\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
