    "snippet": "通常每天只能通關一次的混沌Boss地下城，在活動期間，每個難度每天可以通關兩次！這是你製作混沌 Boss 頭像的機會！  Boss掉落的獎勵製作材料可以用來製作混沌Boss頭像。喲...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Chaos Boss Dungeon +1\" is here! Clear it up to 2 times a day!\nEVENT\n2022-04-13 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Chaos Boss Dungeon that can usually only be cleared once per day can be cleared twice per day at each difficulty for the duration of the event!\nThis is your chance to make a Chaos Boss Avatar!\nReward\nProduction materials which may drop from the boss can be used to produce\nChaos Boss avatars\n.\nYou can also receive production materials from rewards.\nHow to Participate\nAccept the Chaos Boss Dungeon from the NPCs \"Chaos Boss Dungeon Interior\" and \"Chaos Boss Dungeon Depth\" in the Blackiron Palace.\nEach \"Chaos Boss Dungeon\" difficulty can be accepted from a different NPC.\nRecommended Total Power\nEach dungeon has a different Recommended Total Power for challenging the boss. This is set at 60000×6 or more for Interior and 80000×6 or more for Depth.\nTotal Power is a number that gives an approximation of the player's overall strength.\nIt changes based on factors like equipment, Skill Records, and weapon proficiency level.\nCheck it by going to Menu > Status > Player.\nWhen your Total Power is near the recommended amount, challenge the boss with a party!\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nEvent Period\nStarts after the April 13, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 20, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n-See here for more details on the \"Chaos Boss Dungeon.\"\nImportant\nAfter you clear the dungeon twice, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nChaos Boss Dungeons that have been cleared once prior to the April 13 (Wed) maintenance can be cleared one more time after maintenance is complete.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2022-04-12T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2022-04-19T19:00:00+00:00"
