    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign for Alice and Eugeo\" is here! Build up your Assisting Characters with the dungeon and rewards!\nCampaign\n2022-04-08 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCelebrate Alice's and Eugeo's birthdays in the  \"\nRaising Assisting Character Campaign for Alice and Eugeo\n\", on now!\nTake on the \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign\", where you and your Assisting Characters can earn more EXP than in normal dungeons.\nRewards\nPlayers can acquire present items and items to recover stamina for the assist function from Score and Challenge Rewards.\nAlso available are limited items including Memory Stamps and Special Gift present items that increase Friendship EXP for Alice, and Eugeo.\nThe Special Gift can be obtained even if the target character has not yet been unlocked. Please use it once you've unlocked the character.\nAssisting Characters \"Eugeo\"\nObtain Blue Rose Badges to unlock the Assisting Character Eugeo from the achievement rewards.\nBlue Rose Badges are available from the Scenario Event \"Heroine Destruction Rhapsody\" Trader up until the May 11, 2022 (Wed) maintenance begins.\nSee here for more details on the Scenario Event \"Heroine Destruction Rhapsody\".\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nInnocent Alice\nInnocent Eugeo\nLimited Item\nEffect\nSpecial Gift for Alice\nA gift for Alice, to maybe get along better.\nSpecial Gift for Eugeo\nA gift for Eugeo, to maybe get along better.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to take on the \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\".\nEvent Period\nApril 8, 2022 (Fri) 4:00 - April 15, 2022 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 1F Main Quest through the end\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nMemory Stamp 197\nUse to obtain the \"Innocent Alice\" stamp.\n1\n200\nSpecial Gift for Alice\n1\n300\nSmall Gift\n3\n400\nSpecial Gift for Eugeo\n1\n500\nEnergy Fruit\n2\n600\nSpecial Gift for Alice\n1\n700\nSmall Gift\n3\n800\nMemory Stamp 198\nUse to obtain the \"Innocent Eugeo\" stamp.\n1\n900\nSpecial Gift for Eugeo\n1\n1000\nSmall Gift\n3\n1100\nSpecial Gift for Alice\n1\n1200\nEnergy Fruit\n3\n1300\nSpecial Gift for Eugeo\n1\n1400\nSmall Gift\n3\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nRecord Kit M\n30\nCompleted without any tumble\nRecord Frame L\n30\nComplete within the targeted time (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nGolden Bells\n1\nImportant\nThe Assist Function is unlocked when you clear the 1F of Aincrad.\nAfter the Blue Rose Badge exchange period ends, we plan to offer another opportunity to unlock the Assisting Character Eugeo.\nThe Special Gifts do not expire.\nThis \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" can be cleared once per day.\nThis \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" is updated daily at 4:00 am (JST/UTC+9). After this, the previous day's dungeon cannot be attempted.\nIt is possible to take characters other than Alice, and Eugeo as Assisting Characters into the Raising Assisting Character Dungeon.\nThis Raising Assisting Character Dungeon is a solo and Assist Party-only dungeon.\nNote: Players who challenge this \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" solo will not earn any EXP for their Assisting Characters.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
