    "snippet": "登入《刀劍神域積分因子》的使用者註意事項。  我們於2022年4月6日13:00開始進行維護，於2022年4月6日17:00(JST/UTC+9)完成。以下是新的更新。  ▼新實施&新活動第22屆「公會公會」開始 　從本次公會公會開始......",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(4/6)\nMAINT.\n2022-04-05 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n4/6, 2022 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n22nd \"Guild of Guilds\" begins\nStarting with the 22nd \"Guild of Guilds\", major changes have been made to the event's dungeons and reward system.\nFor more details, please check the announcement after maintenance.\nAdded Scenario Event \"Heroine Destruction Rhapsody\" Event rewards\nAfter maintenance, Eugeo will no longer join players in the dungeon in an event-exclusive outfit.\nThe Scenario Event \"Jumping Kibaou\" is back\nIf you have previously played the \"Jumping Kibaou\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAchievements and achievement progress\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\n\"Chaos Showdown\" UPDATE\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 4/6 Maintenance\nWorldwide 4 Year Anniversary! Hunting Event \"Lovely Shrewman Hunt\"\nWorldwide 4 Year Anniversary! \"Guild Support Campaign\"\nWorldwide 4 Year Anniversary! \"Armament Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\n\"Sparkling Station Order\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
