    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Philia's Birthday Order\" is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Philia\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-03-31 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Philia's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[A Dazzling Ball] Philia\n\" and \"\n[Apprehensive Encounter] Philia\n(MOD Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nPhilia's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Philia Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Philia is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Philia!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[A Dazzling Ball] Philia\nSkill Name\nCombination/Momentum Boost\nAttack\n47\nDefense\n44\nHP\n2950\nSkill Effect\n[Combination 4] Skill's power is added +100% when used in switch./[Momentum Boost 4] Adds a buff when your own Critical rate +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 5) for 40 sec when you hit using Switch. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Apprehensive Encounter] Philia\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nWater Converge\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1270% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Philia's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nMarch 31, 2022 (Thu) 0:00 - Apri 9, 2022 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n4.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Philia!　One ★4 Philia guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThere is no voice production when the MOD Skill \"[Apprehensive Encounter] Philia\" is drawn.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
