    "full_details": "Notices\n[3/16 13:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] \"Event rewards\" Added!【4 Year Anniversary】Guild Strategy Event Witch's Manor is here! Get the Guild Cat Doll accessory avatar!\nEVENT\n2022-03-16 13:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[3/16 13:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\n\"Blue Guild Strategy Plate\" were added as drops during the March 16, 2022 (Wed) maintenance.\nAchievement rewards and Trader reward items were also added.\nExchange \"Blue Guild Strategy Plate\" for the added items.\nAdded Items\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMedal of Combat Arts\n350\n5\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nRelease Crystal (M)\n100\n5\nRelease Crystal (S)\n30\n30\nRestorative Potion\n1\n100\nLife Potion\n5\n20\nEmergency Crystal\n5\n30\nHealing Crystal\n10\n20\nCleansing Potion\n3\n15\nRevive Crystal\n10\n30\nRecord Frame L\n3\n30\nGlare Dragon Stone\n3\n30\n10,000Col\n3\n120\n* \"Blue Guild Strategy Plates\" will be deleted on April 6, 2022 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nTrader Period\nBlue Guild Strategy Plate:Starts after the March 16, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 6, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nCat Strategy Guild\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Blue Guild Strategy Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nRecord Background\n-----------------------------\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 4 Year Anniversary Event!\nWe will be holding the Guild Strategy Event Witch's Manor, where you can take on the Witch's Manor raid boss dungeon.\nAttempt it with up to 30 guild members!\nRewards\nCollect the Red Guild Strategy Plates you obtain from drops, and exchange them at the exclusive Trader for the Guild Cat Doll, an accessory avatar that comes with a guild icon.\nBlue Guild Strategy Plates will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the March 16, 2022 (Wed) maintenance.\nYou can get items like Awakening Star awakening materials, all kinds of Great Jewels, skill enhancement and transformation materials, and Memoria Niter S from this event.\nEvery player will receive their own score and challenge rewards if they clear it.\nThere's a chance that Star Fragments will drop on all difficulties.\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nWM Strategy Guild\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Red Guild Strategy Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nShowing Our Bonds\nLet's collect a total of 30 Guild Event Extreme Battle Badges\nRevive Crystal×1\nRecord Background\nTrade \"Red Guild Strategy Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nGuild Cat Doll A\n350\n1\nGuild Cat Doll B\n350\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n350\n5\nAwakening Star\n20\n30\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nTrade \"Blue Guild Strategy Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMedal of Combat Arts\n350\n5\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nTrader Period\nRed Guild Strategy Plate:Starts after the March 2, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 6, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nBlue Guild Strategy Plate:Starts after the March 16, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 6, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Starting Point\", \"Special\", and \"Extreme\" difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nClear bonus\nStarting Point\nSpecial\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus\n120P\n500P\n1200P\nSurvival Bonus\n1 person 10P\n1 person 10P\n1 person 10P\nTime Bonus\n1 second 1P\n1 second 1P\n1 second 1P\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n400\nMedal of Unity\n1\n8000\nMedal of Unity\n1\n12000\nMedal of Unity\n1\n20900\nMedal of Unity\n1\n22800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n24700\nAwakening Star\n5\n26600\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n28500\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n33400\nMedal of Unity\n1\n39000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n51000\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n57000\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n63000\nMedal of Unity\n2\n69000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n75000\nAwakening Star\n5\n78000\nGuild Cat Doll A\n1\n81000\nGreat Red Jewel\n3\n87000\nGreat Green Jewel\n3\n93000\nMedal of Unity\n2\n99000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n105000\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n3\n117000\nGreat Blue Jewel\n3\n123000\nMedal of Unity\n3\n129000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n135000\nAwakening Star\n5\n147000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n153000\nMedal of Unity\n3\n159000\nAwakening Star\n10\n165000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n3\n183000\nGuild Cat Doll B\n1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Raid Boss Dungeon\" NPC in the \"Guild Room\" to challenge the dungeon.\nTalk to the \"Guild Room Guide\" NPC in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to go to your \"Guild Room\".\nEvent Period\nStarts after the March 2, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the March 30, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\n‧Must be a member of a guild.\n‧Complete Main quest \"The Indomitable Fang\"\nBoss Monster\nBlast Black Cat\nDetails\nDefeat the monsters in the dungeon, and the Furious White Cat will appear in the final wave, along with five types of Crystals.\nClear the dungeon by defeating the Blast Black Cat.\nOn Starting Point and Special difficulties, its attacks can inflict Bleed and Stun.\nOn Extreme difficulty, its attacks can inflict Bloodshed, Stun, and the Seal Items debuff.\nIf a targetted player is out of its range, it will grant stack buffs that increase the attack and defense of all monsters in the dungeon.\nWhen the five types of Crystals activate, they will give the Blast Black Cat a buff that reduces the damage it takes from players.\nThis buff can be removed by destroying the Crystals.\nDestroyed Crystals will respawn after a certain amount of time has passed.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nWater Element\nResistance\nSlash Element\nBlunt Element\nFire Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nGuilds\nGuilds can be created and joined through the \"Guild Counter\" NPC.\nYou can gain the benefits of Guild Skills that will help in your journeys, such as increased item drop rates and increased Weapon Proficiency acquisition by joining a guild and increasing its Guild Level.\nPlayers who do not belong to a guild should use this opportunity to join one!\nPlayers who belong to guilds can also use Guild Raid buffs acquirable from Guild Level 16 to help with Guild Events.\nPlease see below for more details on guilds.\nCreating a Guild\nGuild Skills\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nRaid Boss Tickets are not required to challenge the Raid Boss.\nIf any guild member is already attempting a Guild Strategy Event  Witch's Manor, that dungeon must be cleared or finished before another Guild Strategy Event  Witch's Manor can be attempted.\nThe Raid Boss Dungeon Witch's Manor is different from the 8F dungeon.\nRed Guild Strategy Plates, Blue Guild Strategy Plates, and Guild Event Extreme Battle Badges will be deleted on April 6, 2022 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
