    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Heart-Fluttering Valentine's Order is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-02-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nDressed for Valentine's Day, Alice, Sinon, Leafa, and Argo are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nHeart-Fluttering Valentine's Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Emotional Hit Rate] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nShadow Needle\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1410% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Less likely to attract aggro from enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRaises 3 → 6 → 9 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself when hitting with skills.\n★4[Trick Cookie] Argo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nAqua Split\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n740% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Attack + 50% in proportion with your remaining HP (the more remaining HP, the higher)./[Bonus] Critical damage +15% against enemies with the thrust element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Amateur Baking] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShine Tempest\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1320% damage (10x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Dusk 4/Debuff] Enemy's hit rate -15% for 15 sec.(Evasion more likely to occur)/▲[Bonus] Reduces status ailment stacks by 5 on yourself, when hitting with skills while inflicted with Burn (Will not be below 1).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Valentine's Assault] Leafa\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Enhance Bleed Aim\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n40\nHP\n3025\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[Enhance Bleed Aim 4] Chance of bleed UP.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nFebruary 1, 2022 (Tue) 0:00 - February 22, 2022 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\n·Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n·All Steps are 11 Orders.\n·The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\n·After Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\n·Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
