    "full_details": "Notices\nTrain for the Ragout Rabbit hunt! \"Rabbit Hunt\" on now!\nCampaign\n2022-01-26 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe\n\"Ragout Rabbit\"\nis a monster that occasionally appears on the field and drops Red Hot Ore.\nIn this campaign, you can practice hunting it by taking on dungeons where \"Ragout Rabbit\" appears.\nRewards\nThe score rewards give one \"Red Hot Ore\" that can be used to forge equipment.\nYou can also get up to 25 \"Superior Metal Scraps\" and 25 \"Common Metal Scraps\" to produce Ingots.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Rabbit Hunt\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the January 26, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the February 17, 2022 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n-Participation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nMonster\nRagout Rabbit\nDetails\nIt moves quickly and runs away from the player.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nThrust Element\nBlunt Element\n* Weapon elemental weaknesses differ depending on the Ragout Rabbit.\nResistance\nFrostbite\nBleed\nBurn\nPoison\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nCommon Metal Scrap\n5\n200\nCol\n10000\n300\nCommon Metal Scrap\n5\n400\nCol\n10000\n500\nCommon Metal Scrap\n5\n600\nCol\n10000\n700\nCommon Metal Scrap\n5\n800\nCol\n10000\n900\nCommon Metal Scrap\n5\n1000\nCol\n10000\n1200\nSuperior Metal Scrap\n5\n1400\nCol\n20000\n1600\nSuperior Metal Scrap\n5\n1800\nCol\n20000\n2000\nSuperior Metal Scrap\n5\n2300\nCol\n20000\n2600\nSuperior Metal Scrap\n5\n2900\nCol\n20000\n3200\nSuperior Metal Scrap\n5\n3500\nCol\n20000\n4000\nRed Hot Ore\n1\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nCol\n10000\nCompleted without any tumble\nCol\n20000\nCompleted within 3 minutes\nCol\n30000\nImportant\n‧The Ragout Rabbits in this dungeon do not drop the items Red Hot Ore or Ragout Rabbit Meat.\n‧The Ragout Rabbits in this dungeon will not disappear after a certain amount of time.\n‧The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
