    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Firefighter Order is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-01-26 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki and Agil are firefighters of the present and past, and are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nFirefighter Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Uplifting Banner] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWater Smash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Small]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack + 50% in proportion with your remaining HP (the more remaining HP, the higher)./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Swift Firefighter] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nWater Rampage\nSP Cost\n40\nElement\n-\nSkill Effect\n[Water Protection 5/Buff] Water damage +15% for you and your party for 10 sec./[Water God's Fury/Debuff] Elemental damage other than water -30% for you and your party for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nStarts after the January 26, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the February 17, 2022 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Duration\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nTotal drop rate of 0.65% for new ★4 Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nTotal drop rate of 0.65% for new ★4 Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nTotal drop rate of 0.65% for new ★4 Skill Records\n- Important\n·Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n·All Steps are 11 Orders.\n·The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\n·After Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\n·Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
