    "full_details": "Notices\n[1/26 17:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] Capping of skill effects linked to player level, and upward adjustment of the value that increases with a level up\nNOTICES\n2022-01-26 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\n[1/26 17:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nThe following content has been applied as previously announced as of the January 26, 2022 (Wed) maintenance.\nSettings\nChanged skill effects which are linked to player level\n- Increased the value that increases with one level up\n- Set a maximum value equivalent to Lv. 200.\n* The Lv. limit as of January 26, 2022 is Lv. 180, and the release of Lv. 200 is yet to be determined.\nSkills Affected\nSkill Name\nBefore Adjustments: Player Lv. 170\nAfter Adjustments: Player Lv. 170\nMaximum\nBefore Adjustments: The number increased with each level up\nAfter Adjustments: The number increased with each level up\nVeteran Sword Technique 3\nAttack 17%\nAttack 20.4%\nAttack 24%\nAttack 0.1%\nAttack 0.12%\nVeteran Sword Technique 4\nAttack 25.5%\nAttack 28.9%\nAttack 34%\nAttack 0.15%\nAttack 0.17%\nLight Magic 4\nDefense 25.5%\nDefense 28.9%\nDefense 34%\nDefense 0.15%\nDefense 0.17%\nNight Magic 4\nAdditional damage 510\nAdditional damage 680\nAdditional damage 800\nAdditional damage 3\nAdditional damage 4\nDevil Magic 4\nAdditional damage 850\nAdditional damage 1020\nAdditional damage 1200\nAdditional damage 5\nAdditional damage 6\nSpecial Training Results 4\nCritical rate 42.5%\nCritical rate 47.6%\nCritical rate 56%\nCritical rate 0.25%\nCritical rate 0.28%\nGale Rage 4/Buff\nAdditional damage 1700\nAdditional damage 2040\nAdditional damage 2400\nAdditional damage 10\nAdditional damage 12\nAfter implementing these game balancing adjustments, we plan to continue to monitor the situation and make further changes as needed.\nWe hope you continue to enjoy \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nGo to Notice List"
