    "full_details": "Notices\nOne ★4 Burst Skill is guaranteed on Step 5! The \"Burst Step-Up Order\" is here!\nShop\n2022-01-09 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe \"Burst Step-Up Order\" featuring ★4 Burst Skills is here!\nAs of our maintenance on June 30, 2021 (Wed), the skill cool times for 1H Rapier, 2H Spear, and Dagger \"Burst Skills\" have been shortened, making them easier to use.\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\nOn Step 4 and Step 5, the total drop rate for ★4 Burst Skills increases to 2.0%!\nAdditionally, on Step 5, one of the ★4 Burst Skills is guaranteed!\n【Some Featured ★4 Burst Skills】\n★4[Sword of Light] Asuna\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nPiercing Frost Burst\nSkill Name\nPiercing Frost\nSP Cost\n20\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nThrust→\nWater\n→\nWater\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n700% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲[Bonus] 25% increase with critical damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n1400% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Precise Attack 4/Buff] Critical rate +30% for 30 sec./[Bonus] 50% increase with critical damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Fever of Exhaltation] Yuna\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nSound Dive Burst\nSkill Name\nSound Dive\nSP Cost\n24\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→\nWind\n→Thrust→\nWind\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1250% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Element Weak 4/Debuff] Wind element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec./[Celebration4/Buff] Your HP recovers for 30 sec.(1.5%/3sec)Effect will be removed with damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n3500% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Wide]/[Wind Element Weak 4/Debuff] Wind element damage to monster +25% for 20 sec./[Bonus] Attack + 50% in proportion with your remaining HP (the more remaining HP, the higher).\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Best Memory] Silica\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nTerror Shadow Burst\nSkill Name\nTerror Shadow\nSP Cost\n26\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nSlash→\nDark\n→\nDark\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n840% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] When an enemy with Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite) was hit, increase status ailment stacks by 3 on enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n1680% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] When an enemy with Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite) was hit, increase status ailment stacks by 10 on enemies./[Bonus] Releases own status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite, Curse, Debility) recovers HP by 2% per Stack.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nJanuary 9, 2022 (Sun) 17:00  -  January 22, 2022 (Sat) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 Burst Skills\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 Burst Skills\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 Burst Skills\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% Total Drop Rate for ★4 Burst Skills\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Burst Skill guaranteed! 2.0% Total Drop Rate for ★4 Burst Skills\n- Important\n·Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n·All Steps are 11 Orders.\n·The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\n·After Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\n·Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
