    "full_details": "Notices\nGet boss avatars! Chaos Boss Dungeon Part 19 Open for Challengers!\nEVENT\n2021-12-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nLegion Butterfly Chaos has arrived in the high-difficulty Chaos Boss Dungeon!\nThe \"Chaos Boss Dungeon Part 19\" is open.\nReward\nProduction materials which may drop from the boss can be used to produce\nboss avatars\n.\nYou can also receive production materials from rewards.\nAvatar Images\nChaos Boss Dungeon/Black Butterfly Recommended Total Power\nDifficulty\nTotal Power\nInterior\n80,000 × 6\nDepth\n100,000 × 6\nTotal Power is a number that gives an approximation of the player's overall strength.\nIt changes based on factors like equipment, Skill Records, and weapon proficiency level.\n* Each dungeon has a different total power recommendation.\nCheck it by going to Menu > Status > Player.\nWhen your Total Power is near the recommended amount, challenge the boss with a party!\nHow to Participate\nAccept the Chaos Boss Dungeon from the NPCs \"Chaos Boss Dungeon Interior\" and \"Chaos Boss Dungeon Depth\" in the Blackiron Palace.\n-Participation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\n-Dungeon Duration\nThis dungeon can be challenged after the maintenance on December 22, 2021.\nChaos Boss Dungeon・Black Butterfly (\nVS Legion Butterfly Chaos\n)\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n5,000\nBlack Butterfly Wing\n1\n10,000\nBlack Butterfly Wing\n1\n15,000\nBlack Butterfly Wing\n1\n20,000\nBlack Butterfly Wing\n1\n25,000\nBlack Butterfly Stones from Abyss\n1\n30,000\nBlack Butterfly Wing\n1\n35,000\nBlack Butterfly Wing\n1\n40,000\nBlack Butterfly Wing\n1\n45,000\nBlack Butterfly Wing\n1\n50,000\nBlack Butterfly Stones from Abyss\n1\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nCompleted without any tumble\nBlack Butterfly Wing\n1\nDefeat boss\nBlack Butterfly Wing\n1\nCompleted within 10 minutes\nBlack Butterfly Stones from Abyss\n1\nImportant\n‧Each dungeon difficulty can be accepted from a different NPC.\n‧Once you clear the dungeon, you can't challenge it again until the system resets at 4:00 am (JST/UTC+9).\n‧The rewards for both Interior and Depth difficulties are the same.\n‧The Challenge Rewards can only be earned once.\nGo to Notice List"
