    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Aria of a Starless Night Order Part 4\" is here! One of the new Skill Records is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2021-12-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCelebrate the release of the SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive: Aria of a Starless Night movie! Kirito, Asuna, and Mito are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nAria of a Starless Night Order Part 4\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Taking the Initiative] Kirito\nweapon type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nBurn Spike\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill effect\n1320% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Blaze Demon 3/Buff] Fire element damage +45% for 8 sec./\n▲[Bonus] Critical damage +20%.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n［When Rush Activates］ Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[In My Sight] Asuna\nweapon type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nRising Flame\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill effect\n1420% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Ultimate Light 4/Buff] Own critical rate raises, and reduces the next damage taken (Stack 5) during 20 sec.Critical rate +1% per stack, and reduces the next damage taken by -1% per stack.Each effects will be removed by taking damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces all skill's cool times by 3 → 6 → 9 sec when hitting with skills.\n★4[Secret Wish] Mito\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Hold the Front\nAttack\n62\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2425\nSkill effect\n[Advance Trooper 2] Attack +200./[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n［During Rush］ Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the December 22, 2021 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 13, 2022 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\n‧Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n‧All Steps are 11 Orders.\n‧The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\n‧After Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\n‧Please be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
