    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Interior difficulty level of Chaos Showdown can now be challenged by parties. Get your hands on the Dark Black Series, which can be equipped at Lv. 95!\nNOTICES\n2021-12-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Interior difficulty level of Chaos Showdown can now be\nchallenged by parties\n!\nIn Interior difficulty, you can obtain powerful armor and production materials for the Dark Black Series, which can be equipped at Lv. 95.\nIf you can't defeat a boss solo, try again with a party.\nChallenge each of the boss monsters on every difficulty in Chaos Showdown: All Open up until January 12, 2022 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)!\nDetails about the \"Chaos Showdown: All Open\" are available here\n* You can still take on Entry difficulty with a party to get production materials for Dark Black Series, which can be equipped from player Lv. 90.\nEquippable Lv. 95 Dark Black Series List\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nDetails\nDark Black Sea Horse Armor\nDefense:866 HP Bouns:12810 (Max)\nDark Black Sea Horse Greaves\nDefense:710 HP Bouns:8967 (Max)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nDetails\nDark Black False Statue Armor\nDefense:866 HP Bouns:12810 (Max)\nDark Black False Statue Greaves\nDefense:710 HP Bouns:8967 (Max)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nDetails\nDark Black Beast Armor\nDefense:866 HP Bouns:12810 (Max)\nDark Black Beast Greaves\nDefense:710 HP Bouns:8967 (Max)\n·The value and type of the Dark Black Series bonus are random.\n·Succession cannot be used for the Dark Black Series.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end\nAccept it from the \"Chaos Showdown\" NPC at the \"Blackiron Palace\".\nGo to Notice List"
