    "full_details": "Notices\nHoliday Campaign! Search \"Unlock MOD III Double Drop Rate Campaign\"!  \"Unlock MOD\" items are guaranteed in Search 11! Get rare items in Search!\nShop\n2021-12-08 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nIn addition to one Unlock MOD item\nguaranteed\nwith Search 11, the\ndrop rate of Unlock MOD III is doubled during\nthe campaign period.\nAsk Argo for assistance to seek out items that can unlock MOD Slots, temporarily enhance Assisting Characters, temporarily increase drop rates, and much more using \"\nSearch\n\"!\nMore MOD Skill Details Here\n【Guaranteed items from \"Search 11\"】\nUnlock MOD II SS\nUnlock MOD III (1H Sword)\nUnlock MOD III (1H Rapier)\nUnlock MOD III (2H Spear)\nUnlock MOD III (1H Club)\nUnlock MOD III (2H Axe)\nUnlock MOD III (Dagger)\nUnlock MOD III (Bow)\nCommission Fee\n1 Search Trip: 200 Arcana Gems\n11 Search Trips: 2000 Arcana Gems\nSearch \"Unlock MOD III Double Drop Rate Campaign\" Period\nStarts after the December 8, 2021 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the December 22, 2021 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nItem Name\nItem Effect\nUnlock MOD III (1H Sword)\nUnlock the 3rd slot for MOD Skills.　For 1H Sword skills.\nUnlock MOD III (1H Rapier)\nUnlock the 3rd slot for MOD Skills.　For 1H Rapier skills.\nUnlock MOD III (2H Spear)\nUnlock the 3rd slot for MOD Skills.　For 2H Spear skills.\nUnlock MOD III (1H Club)\nUnlock the 3rd slot for MOD Skills.　For 1H Club skills.\nUnlock MOD III (2H Axe)\nUnlock the 3rd slot for MOD Skills.　For 2H Axe skills.\nUnlock MOD III (Dagger)\nUnlock the 3rd slot for MOD Skills.　For Dagger skills.\nUnlock MOD III (Bow)\nUnlock the 3rd slot for MOD Skills.　For Bow skills.\nUnlock MOD II SS\nUnlock the 2nd slot for MOD Skills.　For Sword skills.\nGorgeous Present (Kirito)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Kirito.An expensive present item.\nGorgeous Present (Asuna)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Asuna.An expensive present item.\nGorgeous Present (Silica)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Silica.An expensive present item.\nGorgeous Present (Lisbeth)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Lisbeth.An expensive present item.\nGorgeous Present (Sachi)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Sachi.An expensive present item.\nGorgeous Present (Leafa)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Leafa.An expensive present item.\nGorgeous Present (Yuuki)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Yuuki.An expensive present item.\nGorgeous Present (Sinon)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Sinon.An expensive present item.\nGorgeous Present (Alice)\nGet 180 Friendship EXP towards Alice.An expensive present item.\nLife Crystal I\nRecovers party member's HP in the same field by 8000.\nLife Crystal II\nRecovers party member's HP in the same field by 12000.\nLife Crystal III\nRecovers party member's HP in the same field by 20000.\nExp Crystal XL\nA crystal that grants you 10,000,000 EXP.\nRecord Frame LL\nMaterial used toenhance SkillRecords.\nGlare Sacred Stone\nMaterial used toenhance equipment.\nAroma to Increase Luck I\nIncreases the drop rate by x1.5 for 60 min when used.\nAroma to Increase Luck II\nIncreases the drop rate by x2.2 for 60 min when used.\nAroma to Increase Luck III\nIncreases the drop rate by x2.8 for 60 min when used.\nAroma to Increase EXP I\nIncreases the Exp by x2.2 for 60 min when used.\nAroma to Increase EXP II\nTriples the amount of Expacquired for 60 min when used.\nAroma to Increase EXP III\nQuadruples the amount of Expacquired for 60 min when used.\nAroma to Increase Weapon EXP I\nDoubles Proficiency level EXP for 30 min when used.\nAroma to Increase Weapon EXP II\nDoubles Proficiency level EXP for 60 min when used.\nAroma to Increase Weapon EXP III\nDoubles Proficiency level EXP for 90 min when used.\nSpecial Sacred Tree Leaf\nA leaf from the \"Sacred Tree\" of the Elves.\nRecovers 3000 HP of players within a 100m radius.\nHigh Sacred Tree Leaf\nA leaf from the \"Sacred Tree\" of the Elves.\nRecovers 3000 HP of players within a 50m radius.\nSacred Tree Leaf\nA leaf from the \"Sacred Tree\" of the Elves.\nRecovers 3000 HP of players within a 25m radius.\nDragon Water\nInstantly recovers 3000 HP.　Cure status ailments.\nAssisting Character (Enhance Attack)\nIncreases Assisting Character's attack by 200% for 60 sec.\nAssisting Character (Enhance Defense)\nIncreases Assisting Character's defense by 100% for 60 sec.\nAssisting Character (Enhance HP)\nIncreases Assisting Character's max HP by 100% for 60 sec.\nAssisting Character (Precise Attack)\nIncreases Assisting Character's critical rate by 50% for 60 sec.\nAssisting Character (Weakness Attack)\nIncreases Assisting Character's critical damage by 100% for 60 sec.\nAssisting Character (Evasion)\nIncreases Assisting Character's evasion rate by 50% for 60 sec.\nManual to Increase Production I\nIncreases the random bonus rate for weapon production by 20% for 30 min when used.\nManual to Increase Production II\nIncreases the random bonus rate for weapon production by 40% for 30 min when used.\nManual to Increase Production III\nIncreases the random bonus rate for weapon production by 60% for 30 min when used.\nRecovery Potion I\nAdds an effect that gradually recovers 400 HP for 30 sec.\nRecovery Potion II\nAdds an effect that gradually recovers 400 HP for 60 sec.\nRecovery Potion III\nAdds an effect that gradually recovers 600 HP for 60 sec.\n* For more information, tap Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
