    "full_details": "Notices\nHoliday Campaign! \"Holiday Campaign MOD Step-Up Order Part 1\"! Includes ★4 \"MOD Skill\" for 1H Swords, 1H Rapiers, 1H Clubs, and Daggers! Get 1 ★4 \"MOD Skill\" guaranteed on STEP5!\nShop\n2021-12-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nThe \"\nHoliday Campaign MOD Step-Up Order Part 1\n\" is here, featuring ★4 \"MOD Skill\" for 1H Swords, 1H Rapiers, 1H Clubs, and Daggers!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\nOn Step 4 and Step 5, the total drop rate for ★4 MOD Skills increases to 2.0%!\nAdditionally, on Step 5, one of the ★4 MOD Skills is guaranteed!\nMore MOD Skill Details Here\n【Some Featured ★4 MOD Skills】\n★4[Challenger Wanted] Yuuki\nweapon type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nValiant Gaia\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill effect\n1240% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/\n▲▲[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500./[Bonus] Restore 8000 HP when hitting with this skill while using switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Motivating Voice] Asuna\nweapon type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nSacred Pain\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill effect\n1180% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/\n▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Jaunty Step] Lisbeth\nweapon type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nRefuge Fire\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill effect\n1040% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/\n▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Shelter from the Rain] Silica\nweapon type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nRapid Water\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill effect\n1210% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/\n▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nFrom December 6, 2021 (Mon) 17:00 - December 18, 2021 (Sat) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 MOD Skill guaranteed! 2.0% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\n- Important\n‧Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n‧\"MOD Skill\" for 2H Spears, 2H Axes, and Bows are not included.\n‧All Steps are 11 Orders.\n‧The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\n‧After Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\n‧Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
