    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Connect Step-Up Order\" is here! One ★4 Connect Skill is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2021-11-30 17:10:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSeven new ★4 Skill Records are featured in the\nConnect Step-Up Order\n!\nAll 7 of the new ★4 Skill Records are Connect Skills!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\nAdditionally, on Step 5, one of the new ★4 Connect Skills is guaranteed!\nDetails about the \"Connect Skill\" are available here\n【Featured New ★4 Connect Skills】\n★4[Shaping Your Own Fate] Kirito\nweapon type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nBackdraft\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill effect\n1420% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces status ailment stacks by 5 → 10 → 15 on yourself, when hitting with skills while inflicted with Burn (Will not be below 1).\n★4[A Will to Carry On] Asuna\nweapon type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHydro Reap\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill effect\n1420% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces all skill's cool times by 3 → 6 → 9 sec when hitting with skills.\n★4[Feelings of Dawn] Koharu\nweapon type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nShadow Slice\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill effect\n1380% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces status ailment stacks by 5 → 10 → 15 on yourself when hitting with skills while poisoned (Will not be below 1).\n★4[Battle Style] Lisbeth\nweapon type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nRock Impulse\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill effect\n1300% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRecovers your SP by 8 → 16 → 24 when critical is activated.\n★4[Blue Spearhead] Sachi\nweapon type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nConverging Storm\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill effect\n1560% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRecovers 4% → 8% → 12% of your own max HP when hitting with skills.\n★4[Power Fighter] Agil\nweapon type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nSurging Earth\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill effect\n1670% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n* Easily draw enemy aggro.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +2500 → 5000 → 7500 to enemies when using break.\n★4[Far-Flying Arrow] Sinon\nweapon type\nBow\nSkill Name\nAtmos Rain\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill effect\n1410% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Target Location/Arc/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Less likely to attract aggro from enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRaises 3 → 6 → 9 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself when hitting with skills.\n- Duration\nAfter the November 30, 2021 (Tue) maintenance - January 3, 2022 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for new ★4 Connect Skills\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for new ★4 Connect Skills\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for new ★4 Connect Skills\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for new ★4 Connect Skills\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne new ★4 Connect Skill is guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for new ★4 Connect Skills\n- Important\n‧Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n‧All Steps are 11 Orders.\n‧The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\n‧After Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\n‧Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
