    "full_details": "Notices\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3! The \"Aria of a Starless Night Order Part 3\" is here!\nShop\n2021-11-17 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCelebrate the release of the SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive: Aria of a Starless Night movie!\nAsuna and Mito are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nAria of a Starless Night Order Part 3\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Skill Enlightenment] Asuna\nweapon type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nExploding Hit\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill effect\n1300% damage (All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Enhance Thrust 3/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +25% for 20 sec./[Weakness Attack 4/Buff] Critical damage +20% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[A Fate that Cuts] Mito\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Flame Conversion/Meeting a Friend\nAttack\n60\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2350\nSkill effect\n[Advance Trooper 3] Attack +300./[Flame Conversion 3]\nWater element's damage to enemies -10%\nand fire element's damage to enemies +20%./[Meeting a Friend] Recovers 80 HP every 3 sec when equipping 3 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n［When Rush Activates］ Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the November 17, 2021 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the December 22, 2021 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\n·Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n·All Steps are 11 Orders.\n·The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\n·After Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\n·Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
