    "full_details": "Notices\nStrea's Birthday Order is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Strea\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2021-11-06 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Strea's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Light Cut] Strea\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[Beginning Outlook] Strea\n\" are now available!\n\"\nStrea's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Strea Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Strea is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Strea!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Light Cut] Strea\nweapon type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nBandit Thrust\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill effect\n1310% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Toukou 5/Buff] -50% damage taken for 3 sec.(Invalid when equipped by Partner)/\n▲[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +50% while defense+ buff is activated.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n［During Rush］ Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Beginning Outlook] Strea\nSkill Name\nEnhance HP/Enhance Defense\nAttack\n49\nDefense\n60\nHP\n2200\nSkill effect\n[Enhance HP 3] Max HP +10%./[Enhance Defense 4] Defense +15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nNovember 6, 2021 (Sat) 0:00 - November 15, 2021 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n4.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Strea!　One ★4 Strea guaranteed!\n- Important\n‧Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n‧All Steps are 11 Orders.\n‧After Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\n‧Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\n‧The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
