    "full_details": "Notices\nKirito & Asuna's Wedding Anniversary Order is here! One ★4 Kirito or Asuna Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2021-10-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIn celebration of Kirito and Asuna's wedding anniversary, new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[A Warm Day] Kirito\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[An Important Day] Asuna\n(Burst Skill)\" are here!\n\"\nKirito & Asuna's Wedding Anniversary Order\n\" is on!\nFeaturing Kirito and Asuna ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Kirito or ★4 Asuna is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 Skill Records are Kirito or Asuna and have an increased 6.0% Drop Rate!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[A Warm Day] Kirito\nSkill Name\nEnhance Thrust/Coordinated Assault\nAttack\n51\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2575\nSkill effect\n[Enhance Thrust 3] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +15%./[Coordinated Assault 4] While switch damage mulitiplier+ buff is effective,\ndefense will decrease by 500\nand attack will increase by 20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n［During Rush］ Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[An Important Day] Asuna\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nweapon type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nShadetron Burst\nSkill Name\nShadetron\nSP Cost\n24\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Thrust→Thrust\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skills Effect\n1300% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Black & White Combination/Buff] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Switch damage multiples +300% for 10 sec./\n▲[Bonus] When this skill direct hits, reduces all skill's cool times by 2 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n3640% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Weak Thrust 4/Debuff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +25% for 24 sec./[Bonus] Attack against enemies with Frostbite increases 50%.\n* Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP24)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nOctober 23, 2021 (Sat) 0:00 - November 5, 2021 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n6.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records! All ★4 Skill Records are Kirito or Asuna! One ★4 Kirito or ★4 Asuna guaranteed!\n- Important\n·Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n·All Steps are 11 Orders.\n·The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\n·After Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\n·Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
