    "full_details": "Notices\nKirito's Birthday Order is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Kirito\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2021-10-07 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Kirito's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Burning Spirit] Kirito\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[One With the Horse] Kirito\n(Awakening Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nKirito's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Kirito Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Kirito is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Kirito and are at an increased 6% Drop Rate!\nNew ★4 Skill Records\n★4[Burning Spirit] Kirito\nweapon type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nPurification\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill effect\n1310% damage (7x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Counter Reflection 4/Buff] All damage will be reduced 40%, and reflect 75% back to enemy for 4 sec.(Invalid when equipped by Partner)/\n▲[Bonus] Attack rises 150 x the number of Kirito Skill Records in the same set.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[One With the Horse] Kirito\nSkill Name\nAll In Black\nAttack\n50\nDefense\n44\nHP\n2725\nSkill effect\n[All In Black 4] Adds additional effects based on the number of Kirito's Skill Records equipped in the same set.2 or more: Recovers a max of 1.2% HP per 3 sec.3 or more: Max HP +5%.4 or more: Critical rate +10%.5 or more: Critical damage +10%.6 or more: Attack +15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nDodge\n[During Rush] Evasion rate +4%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nOctober 7, 2021 (Thu) 0:00 - October 16, 2021 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n6.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Kirito!　One ★4 Kirito guaranteed!\n- Important\n‧Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n‧All Steps are 11 Orders.\n‧After Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\n‧Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\n‧The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
