    "full_details": "Notices\nAsuna's Birthday Order is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Asuna\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2021-09-30 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Asuna's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[With Love] Asuna\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[Like a Comet] Asuna\n(Awakening Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nAsuna's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Asuna Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Asuna is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Asuna and are at an increased 6% Drop Rate!\nNew ★4 Skill Records\n★4[With Love] Asuna\nSkill Name\nCombination/Frostbite Blow\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2650\nSkill effect\n[Combination 4] Skill's power is added +100% when used in switch./[Frostbite Blow 3] Attack against enemies with frostbite increases 18%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nDodge\n[During Rush] Evasion rate +4%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Like a Comet] Asuna\nweapon type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nDark Cinque\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill effect\n1290% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Frostbite Boost 4/Debuff] Lowers enemy's frostbite resistance 50% for 30 sec (easier to inflict frostbite) and frostbite damage +100%./\n▲[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n［During Rush］ Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nSeptember 30, 2021 (Thu) 0:00 - October 9, 2021 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n6.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Asuna!　One ★4 Asuna guaranteed!\n- Important\n‧Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n‧All Steps are 11 Orders.\n‧After Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\n‧Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\n‧The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
