    "snippet": "每位玩家可用四個！  ★4 1H Club 保證訂單全新陣容登場，保證您獲得一份 1H Club ★4 技能記錄！ ★4筆技能記錄全部為「1H俱樂部」！包含「覺醒技能」！  【部份★4技能紀錄】 ★4【忠誠之鎚】小春武器型1H 俱樂部技能名稱Watering FallSP Cos...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nLineup Updated! One ★4 1H Club Skill Record guaranteed in the ★4 1H Club Guaranteed Order!\nShop\n2021-09-16 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAvailable four Per Player!\nA new lineup is here for the ★4 1H Club Guaranteed Order where you are\nguaranteed\none 1H Club ★4 Skill Record!\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"1H Clubs\"!\nIncludes\n\"Awakening Skills\"\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Loyal Hammer] Koharu\nweapon type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nWatering Fall\nSP Cost\n36\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill effect\n750% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Skillful Blacksmith] Lisbeth\nweapon type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nStone Gong\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill effect\n980% damage (All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[PT Enhance Thrust 4/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting by you and your party +30% for 20 sec./\n▲▲[Bonus] Critical rate +300% against enemies with a buff effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n［During Rush］ Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n©RK/K/SP ©BNEI Illustrated by abec\n★4[Friend Mace] Lisbeth\nweapon type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nCrusher Turbine\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill effect\n860% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Battle Support 4/Buff]Party critical rate +25% for 30 sec, gradually recovers HP (1.5%/3 sec). The effect on the target will be released when the effected target takes damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n［During Rush］ Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n* Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n- Duration\nStarts after the September 16, 2021 17:00 - September 25, 2021 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\n* There is no single Order.\n* This 11 Order can only be used 4 times per player.\n* The previously bought \"★4 1H Club Guaranteed Order\" is available for purchase again if you have already purchased it 4 times.\n* Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
