    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Beasts Disguised as Beauties Order\" is here! One of the new Skill Records is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2021-09-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAlice, Sinon, Leafa, and Koharu have become legendary beasts and are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nBeasts Disguised as Beauties Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Lady Demon] Alice\nSkill Name\nEnhance Berserk/Enhance Paralysis Res./Hostility: Poison\nAttack\n62\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2425\nSkill effect\n[Enhance Berserk 4] When the player is Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite, Curse, Debility), Attack +25%./[Enhance Paralysis Res. 4] Paralysis Res. increase 70%./\n[Hostility: Poison] When equipping 1 of Kirito's Skill Records in a set, adds poison effect on yourself for 30 sec when you hit using Switch (Stack 1).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Omen of Tranquility] Koharu\nweapon type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nEarth Disruption\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill effect\n1230% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/\n▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Lady Fox] Sinon\nweapon type\nBow\nSkill Name\nDark Blast Shot\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill effect\n1290% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Adversity 3/Buff] The lower your own HP, critical damage increases for 15 sec./\n▲[Bonus] All the Stack Buff effected to the enemy will -2 in numbers of Stacks (Will not be below 1).\n*Less likely to attract aggro from enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Lucky Ninetails] Leafa\nweapon type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nStrong Curtain\nSP Cost\n12\nElement\n-\nSkill effect\n[Flourish 4/Buff] Debility resistance +28% for 60 sec./[Hands down 4/Buff] 60 sec, the critical rate will increase a little, the higher the Max HP is.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n* Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n- Duration\nStarts after the September 15, 2021 Maintenance - October 13, 2021 Maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\n* All Steps are 11 Orders.\n* After Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\n* Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\n* The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
